<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Kɛɛwotiiti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kɛɛwotiiti</para>
  <para style="toc3">KKw</para>
  <para style="mt1">Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi ɠa é ga Egilisii lɔɔzei vaa ma wɔlɔwɔlɔ zɛʋɛi, ta ʋelei Egilisii ɠaawɔɔlɔni la, é zo Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ, ta Zudé yooi zu ná pɛ, é li Samali, eyɛsu é ɓudɛ miná maazu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ Yesu boni la ná-kaladopoiti ma, aisa é ʋa lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1:8</ref></char>). Luke ɠa é ma zɛʋɛi ɠɛai, tɔ nɔ ɠa ɓalaa é Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi zɛʋɛa, nii daaseigi ba. É ɠɛni ga ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔi, ta wɔin ɠɛni ma ga é sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nii gaaɠalagai. Ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ta Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi, é ti felegɔ pɛ teʋegɛ zunui ta ma, daa ɠɛni ga Teyofile. Naa ɠɛni ga Gɛlɛki ta, kɛlɛ kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ sɛʋɛ felegɔi niiti ti leʋega ɠɛni de keletiɛn ɓɔgi tanigaa ma, niiti Gɛlɛkiiti ta Zuifuiti ti ɠɛni ti zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1">1:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tanisu sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛʋɛ kona ʋuulɔzitaiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta puulɔzita maazu naanigɔi (60-64), Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma, tɔɔzei sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelagɛ aisa Pɔle ʋa ɠula kasoi ɠa. Luke ɠɛni Pɔle ʋolu siɛi zu, ta kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ é Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛni Antiyɔse taazuʋɛ. Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi ɠa é ga Luke ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ma zeidai, tɔɔzei ma zɛʋɛi lɔɔzeiʋɛ ga siɛgi zu Yesu wuzeɠea la, é lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛ vai ma ungi Luke ʋɛ, kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ta ga faa ɠila nɔ ta ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi: É ɠɛni pɔ ga Teyofile mu be, keletiɛinti be ti ɠɛni liizu ga mɔinɗa, ti lada ga nii ti ti ɠalagai la, gaamai ʋe. Naa ɠa é kɛa é laalɔa la Yesu ná-eteai zu vaiti su, é suɠula ga pagɔ, ta ʋele keletiɛn vai ɠaawɔɔlɔai la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Keelaiti Kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi ɠa Egilisi mɔungi ná-poogi veezu ade ya, ta ʋelei Egilisii ɠɛni zɛnvui wosu da, ná-kidaaleʋei zu Yesu ma. Keelaiti ta-ʋoogiti ta naa lɛɛzu ga adeye, ʋelei nu maanɛai è ɓɔɠɔ yɛ la Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yee zu, ɗa ɠɛna Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelia zɔiti ma.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ʋaani dɛ, é yei kaladopoiti ma, ta Egilisii tɔɔzei ga gaa ɗa wɔɔlɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-8:1">1:1—8:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma wɔinzeɠemai laalɛ Egilisii wu, naa ma ge tɔɔzei ga gaa ɗa wɔɔlɔ, é ɓudɛ Zeluzalɛme maazu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8:2-12:24">8:2—12:24</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Naa leʋegai ma, Pɔle liini ná-keela ziɛ mɔungi ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12:25-14:28">12:25—14:28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Totuɠɔiti ti zɛba ti ɠaalɛ ba Zeluzalɛme ga ti naa leve, nii soloogai kidaaleʋe nu niinɛiti ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Naa ʋolu Pɔle liini ná-keela ziɛi velesiɛi ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36—18:22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">6. É zɛba é li mɔnɔ ná-keela ziɛi zaʋasiɛi ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-20:38">18:23—20:38</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Naa ʋolu ti Pɔle zoni Zeluzalɛme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 21:1-26:32">21:1—26:32</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">8. Gaaɓela ga ti li ga Pɔle Wɔlɔme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 27:1-28:31">27:1—28:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ma minazeɠegi wo fai keelaiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Teyofile: Nà-sɛʋɛ mɔungi zu, gè naati pɛ suɠulani, niiti Yesu ti ɠɛɛni, ta kalagi niiti, é ɠɛni ti wosu, mɔunpa, <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>eyɛsu naama voloi zeeli, yeei é lɛɛni la geeɠɔlɔgi zu, kpegai ma ga deveiti fe keelaiti zea ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai maaʋele, niiti é yiimazeɠeni ga tiye. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Ná-kpɔlɔi ʋoluma, naati nɔ ɠa é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga tiye poo mɔinmɔin su ga toɠa vulua. Folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu, é ɠɛni ɠulazu kɛlɛma ti ʋɛ, é ɗa ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ, é ʋilɛ GALA ná-masadai ʋa.<verse eid="ACT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Yeeta, ti ɠɛai ma daamii wosu ʋɔɔma, é niima levei woni ga tiye, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À mina maaɠooza Zeluzalɛme ʋa, kɛlɛ à Kɛ̀ɛ ná-minazeɠegi maaɓɔun, nii kulaai dà, gè bo wo ma. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zan ɓatizei woni ga ziɛi, kɛlɛ wɔun, su la mɔ ɠooza, wa ɓatize ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lɛɛ ʋelei geeɠɔlɔgi zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Tɛigiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, naama ziɛgi zu ɠa è Izilayɛle masadai zeizu la ʋolu ɓaa?» <verse eid="ACT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo ɓɛdɛ la ba ga wo siɛgiti ta yeeɠɛɠalaiti kwɛɛ, niiti Kɛ̀ɛ ti leʋeai ba, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-zobogi zu. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yeizu la wo ma, wa zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔ, wo ɠɛ ga nà-zeeleiti Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ, Zudé yooi zu ná pɛ, Samali yooi zu ɓalaa, eyɛsu zou ɓela ga.»<verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Yesu ɓegai ma ga naama ɓɔɛiti bo, ti ɠaazuyɛni ba, é lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu ʋele, naa ʋoluma tonaɓiingi dɔɔɠuni ti ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Tɛi ti-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠɛni nɔ geezuʋɛ, siɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni liizu la, zunu felegɔ ɠulani kɛlɛma ti ʋɛ, ti maaɠiliai ga seɠe ɠolegiti, <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>ti ɠɛ keelaiti ma: «Galilé nuiti, lee vaa zu wo losu, wo ɗa wɛlɛ geezuʋɛ? Yesu nii buzeɠeai wo zaama, é lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, toɠa ʋa ʋolu mɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei wo kaai la, é ɗa lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Ti ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme, ti zeɠe Wolive ɠizei ma, nii é Zeluzalɛme ɠoba, ti yɔɠɔzu ɠoozai ga kilo ɠila. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠaleni la ma taazuʋɛ, ti lɛɛni geezu ʋɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ ti ɓena zei ná. Tɛiti ti ɠɛni ná ti laaseigiti kaa: Piyɛlɛ, Zan, Zake, Andelé, Filipe, Tomase, Ɓaatelemi, Matiyo, Alefé ná-doun zunui Zake, Simon nii é ɠɛni ga Zou Maalobo Nui ta, naa ʋɛɛ Zake ná-doun zunui Zude ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Ti pɛ ti ɓena ɠaalɛ ba, ti ɓɔni ɠi gila ma, ti ɠaaɓa GALA falii ma, naa ʋɛɛ anzanui tanigaa ʋa, ta Yesu dee Mali, ta deɠeiti.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zudase maavalibogi ɠaiziɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Naama voloiti su, Piyɛlɛ wuzeɠeni kɛɛɠɛloun ungila puufelegɔiti (120) saama, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>«Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, kɛni GALA Sɛʋɛi zu wooi a la ʋilɛ su, nii Zɛnvu Ɲadegai boni é ɠula Davide la, é ɓɔɛni ma yeeluɠɔ, é ʋilɛ Zudase ʋa, nii é loni Yesu zo nuiti tuɠɔ. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>É ɠɛni ga ade ta, é nɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ada-woti ɠilagi nii zu.» <verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>(Kpegai ma ga zou ɠila geya ga telebotala walii, nii ti feai zea, é looni ɠɔgi ma, kogi ʋali su, koozu zɔɔlaiti pɛ ti vaza. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Zeluzalɛme nuiti pɛ ti faa ɠwɛɛni su, naa ɠa é kɛa ti naama yooi laasei pɛai ga Akɛledama, ti-laawooi zu nii poluʋɛ ga «ɲamaba yooi»). <verse eid="ACT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>«Tama, sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi ma wuye zɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‹Seizuʋɛ ɲaka yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">é ʋala nuɓusɛiti ma ná!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:26">Guy 69:26</ref></char>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Naa ʋolu sɛʋɛai mɔnɔ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‹Taɠili ge zei potogi zu!›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 109:8">Guy 109:8</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>Kɛni mu, nu ɠila ge ʋɛɛ ade ʋa, zɔiti saama, niiti ti ɠɛa ade ʋa, naama ziɛgi pɛ su ade ɠɛni lɔɔzu la, ade ɗa ɠula ada Maliɠii Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>é zo Zan ná-ɓatizei wo siɛgi ma, é zeeli tɛɛ voloi ma geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naama nui ɠɛ ga zeelei ta, é ʋilɛ buzeɠe vai ʋa, é ɠula saai ya.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Ti nu felegɔ lɛɛni: Zozɛfe nii daa ɠɛni ga Ɓalasaɓase, daasei kili ge ɠɛni ba ga Zusetuse, ta Matiyase. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Naa ʋoluma, ti GALA falini ɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, ɗɛi è nui pɛ ziimaʋɛ ɠwɛɛ, nu felegɔi niiti saama, naa lɛ ga giye, nii è yiimazeɠeai la, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>nii a kɛ é Zudase losuʋɛ zeɠe, keela wotii nii zu, ʋɛ Zudase ná ɲakai yɛgai, é li ga liizu ʋele.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Ti kpakutoomai ɠɛɛni, kpakui looni Matiyase ma, é ʋɛɛ niina keela puugɔ maazu ɠilagi (11) zɔiti ba.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ʋaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Pantekote voloi zeeliai ma, ti pɛ ti ɠaalɛa ɠɛni de ba ada ɠila. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Gaamago, zɔngɔ wolai zeɠeni geezuʋɛ, eɠɛ fiilɛ wola, é pɛlɛi wu ná pɛ daave, ʋɛ ti ɠɛni zeini ná. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Nɛgiti, ti ɠulaai ga abuzogi, ti ɠulani ti ʋɛ kɛlɛma, ti ɠaaɠwɛ ma, ti zei ti ɠilagilagiti unma. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Naati pɛ ti laaveni ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, ti tɔɔzei ga ti ɗa ɓɔɛ zii woo ɠiligiti su, eɠɛʋelei Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛni feezu la ti ya ga ti bo.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Naama ziɛgiti su, Zuifui tanigaa ti ɠɛni ɲii wosu Zeluzalɛme, ti ɠɛni ga GALA gaazuluaba nuiti ti zeɠeai eteai zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Naama wooi ziaai ma, ti ma ʋɛbɛ wolai ʋaani, ti wola laavɔɔni, tɔɔzei ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ti woomɛnisu ti ɓɔɠɔ wooiti su. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Ti laavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nui niiti ti ɓɔɛzu ɠani, kɛbɛ ti pɛ ta ga Galilé nu, kɛlɛ? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>É leʋe ɠale mu, ade pɛ ade ti woomɛnisu ade ɓɔɠɔ wooiti su? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Adɛi de ga, Paate nuiti, ta Mɛde, Elame, Mezopotami, Zudé, Kapadɔse, Pɔn, Azi ɠoʋii, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Filizi, Panfili, Ezipete, naa ʋɛɛ Silɛne lugi zu ʋa Liɓi yooi zu, ta zɔiti ti zeɠeai Wɔlɔme, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Kelɛte ta Aalaɓi: Zuifuiti be-o ɓaa wɛɛinti be-o, niiti ti ʋilɛgai Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA pelei ma. Ade pɛ, ada ti woomɛnisu ade ɓɔɠɔ wooiti su, ti ɗa GALA ná-kɛɛwoti wolaiti bo.» <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Ti pɛ ti laavɔɔni, tanigaa ti ɠɛ unga wuulee, ti ɗa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Niima vai ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga lee?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Taɠiligaa ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Dɔɔ nɛɛnɛgi ɠa é ti zogai!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ GALA daawooi wo fai Pantekote voloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Piyɛlɛ wuzeɠeni é lo, keela puugɔ maazu ɠilagi (11) zɔiti saama, é wooɠulani, é ɠɛ ma: «À woilo ma-o! Zudé nuiti ta wɔigi wo ɲii wosu Zeluzalɛme, wo niima vaiti gaaɠa, niiti ti ɠɛɛzu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Dɔ lɛi é ʋa ɠɛ niima nuiti ba, eɠɛʋelei wo ɠisiɛzu la, folo liegi kpaazuʋɛ nɔ ɠa dɛ ade su. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Kɛlɛ nii GALA goo wo nui Zowɛle boni, naa ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ɠani. É ɠɛni ma:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>‹GALA ge ɠɛ ma: Folo ɠaaɓelagiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nà nà-Zɛnvui yeizu nuɓusɛi pɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wo-loun zunuiti ta wo-loun anzanuiti ta GALA gooiti bo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wa-wuzeɠe niinɛgiti ta kulakɛlɛmaiti ka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wa-ɠɛwola wɔlɔiti ta segiti bo.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Ungo, naama voloiti su, nà nà-Zɛnvui yei nà-botiɠɛ zunuiti ta nà-botiɠɛ anzanuiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">ti ɗa GALA gooi wo.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Nà maaɓɛlɛ vaiti kɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ta poogiti zooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">ɲamai ta abui ɠa ɠɛ ná, naa ʋɛɛ abu luului ma lonaɓiingi ʋa.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Foloi ɠa ʋote ga kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">alugi ɓɔi eɠɛ ɲamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">aisa Maliɠii ná-foloi ʋa zeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">folo wolai, nii maayikiai.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Naazu zɔi nɔpɛ a wooɠula Maliɠii ma, toɠa ɠizo.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 3:1-5">Zow 3:1-5</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>«À woilo niima wooiti ma, wɔi wo ga Izilayɛle nuiti, wa ɓɔɠɔi wo kwɛni ga GALA ge yeezeini Yesu Nazalɛte nui wu wo ɠaazu, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge ɠɛni laavɔɔ vaiti, maaɓɛlɛ vaiti ta laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu ga tɔun maaʋele wo zaama. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Zunui naa ɠwɛɛni wo ma, é zoloo GALA ná-devei ta ná-seikpasui ma, nii é kɛɛni ma yeeluɠɔ kaite, wo paaʋɛ siɛgi zu wo zɛga la tɔ koloɠolo nuiti zea, ti kpadɔ saa wului ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>GALA ge buzeɠeʋɛ ʋolu, é kula saai ma zoolɛiti su, mazɔlɔɔ naa la ɠɛni zolooga ga saai ʋa makɛ ba ná-zobogi wu. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Davide niima wooi woni, é ʋilɛ Yesu ʋa, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‹Gàazu logɛ Maliɠii ʋa yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">tɔɔzei toɠa kòbaʋɛ, nii a kɛ gè mina ɲiikpi eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zìi ɠaanɛa, gòoiti daavegɛ ga koozunɛɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">kpùsɛi ɓɔɠɔi ɠa looɠosu, makɛgai kitogi zu.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Mazɔlɔɔ è la ɠɛlɛa bà, gè ʋa yɛ gɔvɛalaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">è la vaa bu nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, gè ga wooɠɛɠila nu, gè ʋa luula kabayeɠei zu.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>È zɛnvu ʋelei lɛa ga ze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">ɗa nɔ̀un daave ga koozunɛɛi è-ɠɛɛ vai zu kòba.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Guy 16:8-11</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>«Kɛ̀ɛlointi, zobogi veeʋɛ bɛ̀ ga gè ɠɛ wo ma: Ade-mɛmɛwola Davide zaaʋɛ, maaɠulu, ná-kabai ɓalaa ka ade zaama zaaɠaza. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ga GALA goo wo nui ta, é ɠɛni kwɛɛni ga GALA ge minazeɠeni bɛ, é ɠona ga mavofodai ta ɠa zei ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Kilista wuzeɠe vai, é ɠula saai ya, naa ɠa Davide kaani ma yeeluɠɔ, naama wooi ɠa é boni ga: ‹GALA ge la ɠɛlɛa bà, gè ʋa yɛ gɔvɛalaazu, é la vaa bu, kpùsɛi ʋa luula kabayeɠei zu.› <verse eid="ACT 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>GALA ge Yesu nii wuzeɠeʋɛ, é kula saai ya, gi pɛ gá ga naama zeeleiti. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Buzeɠeʋɛ, é zei GALA zeezazuʋɛ, é Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔ Kɛɛɠɛ ya, nii ma minazeɠegi woni, naa ɠa é feai, eɠɛʋelei wo mɛnisu da, ta wo kaazu la. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Davide la lɛɛni geeɠɔlɔgi zu, kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi bogɛ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‹Maliɠii GALA ge ɠɛni Màliɠii ma: Zei zèezazuʋɛ,<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>eyɛsu gè è zili nuiti kɛ ga ɗa-ɠɔɠɔloma anii.›<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei pɛ maanɛɛʋɛ ti kwɛɛ, ti la da, ga Yesu nii wo kpadɔni saa wului ma, naa ɠa GALA ge kɛai ga Maliɠii ta Kilista.»<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋe nu mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Ti naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, é ti yiizoni ga gola, ti ɠɛni Piyɛlɛ ta keelai zɔiti ma: «Gi-ɠɛɛlointi, gá kɛ ɠale mu?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Piyɛlɛ ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ge ɓatize Yesu Kilista laaseigi zu, nii a kɛ wo zuvaayɛ ga wa-ɠotoiti, wa Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔ ga faanɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Mazɔlɔɔ minazeɠegi ɠa ga wɔnɔ, wa wo-lointi, ta naati tɔnɔ niiti ti maaɠoozaai, naati pɛ de-Maliɠii da-ƓALAGI ʋaazu ti lolisu.» <verse eid="ACT 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni zeele wooi wosu ti ma wooi taɠiligaa zu, é ɗa ti iɲɔdɔ, é ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: «À ɓɔɠɔ ɠula tukpɔi laawu, nii é ʋaazu zeelizu yamani ɲɔi nii zu nuɓusɛiti ma.»<verse eid="ACT 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Zɔiti ti yeezeini gooi wu, naati ti ɓatizeni, naama voloi nu waasaʋagɔ (3.000) ɠɛɠala ɠa é ʋɛɛni kidaaleʋe nuiti ba. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Ti ɠɛni woilosu yeenɔpɛ kalagi ma, nii keelaiti ti ɠɛni feezu, ti ɠɛ kpɔfaamai zu, ti ɗa daamii wo, ta ti ɗa GALA falii wo ʋɔɔma. <verse eid="ACT 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Dualuagi ɠɛni ɛsɛ pɛ su, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge ɠɛni maaɓɛlɛ vaiti ta laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu ga gola ga keelaiti maaʋele. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Kidaaleʋe nuiti pɛ ti ɠilini ʋa, ti-ɠɔligiti ti ɠɛ su ɠila kpe. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Ti ɠɛni ta-yooiti ta ti-ɠɔligiti pɔdizu, ti ʋa ga ma walii, ti gaaɠwɛ ɛsɛ ba, é zoloo ma nu ɓɛdɛma vai ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ɠaalɛɛzu ba folo-o-folo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti ɠɛni ɓului ɠaleɠalezu ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu, ti daamii wo koozunɛɛi zu, ta zii ʋagɔlai zu. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Ti ɠɛni GALA maamusɛzu, naa ʋoluma ta-vai ɠɛni nuɓusɛi pɛ ziilaazu. Folo-o-folo Maliɠii ɠɛni ta ɓɔsu kidaaleʋe nuiti ma ɓɔgi ʋa ga niiti é ɠɛni ti ɠizosu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛɠɛlɛ nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Yeeta, Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti ɠɛni lɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, GALA falii ma ziɛgi zu kpɔkɔ volo lɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi ma. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>É zolooni nɔ ga ti ʋaai ga mɛɠɛlɛ nui ta, nii é zɔlɔɔni ga mɛɠɛlɛgi. Folo ɠilagila ti ɠɛni ʋaazu la, ti da GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ziɠidaʋɛ naa laaseigi ga «Pɛlɛla Ʋagɔi», nii a kɛ é ɗa faaɓɔɠɔ maavali naama nuiti ma, ti lɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>É Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ɠaai ma, ti ɗa lɛ ná, é faaɓɔɠɔ maavalini ti ma. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti ɠaazuloni ba, Piyɛlɛ ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ lɛɛ gi ʋa!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>É ɠaazuloni ti ʋa, é ɗa ɠisiɛ ga naati ta ani veezu zea. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Wali la zèa, ɓaa zanu, kɛlɛ nii é zèa, nà naa veezu è ya, naa ɠa é ga: Nazalɛte nui Yesu Kilista laaseigi zu, wuzeɠe, è ziɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>É soni zeezai ʋa, é buzeɠe. Gaamago nɔ, kɔɠɔiti ta tɛɛ ɠainti ti zuloni kpe, <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>é ʋili kpulu, é wuzeɠe, é ɗa ziɛ. É ʋilɛni ti ʋolu, ti lɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɗa ziɛ, é ɗa ʋili, ta é ɗa GALA maamusɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Bɛbɛi pɛ ge kaani, é ɗa ziɛ, é ɗa GALA maamusɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni ɠwɛɛsu ɠaazu ba, ga tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni zeizu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ naa laaseigi ga «Pɛlɛla Ʋagɔi», é ɗa falii wo. Fai nii é ɠɛɛni zunui naa ʋɛ, é ɠɛni ga laavɔɔ va, ta kulafilibai nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kpɔɛi Piyɛlɛ suɠulani GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi mu ge la mɔ ɠɛni zeɠezu Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ʋolu. Bɛbɛi ɓizɛni, ti ʋa, ti ɠaalɛ ba ti ma seizei bosuʋɛ, ná laa ga «Salomɔn ná-seizei bo kotai». <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Piyɛlɛ miná ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni nuɓusɛiti ma: «Izilayɛle nuiti, lee vaa zu niima vai wo laavɔɔzu? Lee vaa zu wo ɠaazulosu gi ʋa, eɠɛ gá ɠa gá zunui nii wuzeɠe, é ɗa ziɛ, ga gi-zɛbɛi ɓaa gi ɠili ʋelei GALA ba? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Ade-mɛmɛwolani Abalaame, Izaake, ta Zakɔɓe ta-ƓALAGI ɠa é lɛbiyai veeni ná-botiɠɛ nui Yesu ʋɛ. Pilate ɠɛni pɔ ga é pilɛ, kɛlɛ wɔun, wo dɔɔni yeelɔɔzu, wo ɠɛlɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Wɔun, wo ɠɛlɛni Telebo Nui ʋa, nii ɲadegai, wo ɠɛ ti yeeɓe nu ʋaa nui ʋa wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Zɔi é zɛnvui unda, wo naa ʋaani, kɛlɛ GALA ge buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, gá ga naama zeeleiti. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Tɛi gɔun, gi ɠidaaleʋeai Yesu ma, naa ɠa é kɛa, daaseigi naa ná-zɛbɛi zobogi vea la zunui nii ya, nii wo kaazu, ta wo kwɛɛ. Kidaaleʋei Yesu ma, naa ɠa é zunui nii ɠɛdɛga kpezekele, eɠɛʋelei wo pɛ wo kaazu la.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>«Naa pɛ poluma, kɛ̀ɛlointi, faaɠwɛtalai ɠa wo naa ɠɛai la, wa wa-ɠundiɠiiti. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Kɛlɛ kaite, GALA ge boni é ɠula GALA goo wo nuiti pɛ da ma yeeluɠɔ, ga ná-nui nii é ga Kilista naa ɠa ɓɔlɔ, naa ɠa é daazeeliai ɠani. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo mu, wo lati ʋolu GALA ma, nii a kɛ wa-ɠotoiti ɓale tɛtɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Naazu dooɠo yeeɠɛɠalaiti ta ʋa, ti zeɠe Maliɠii ʋɔ bɛ, naa ʋoluma é naa leʋe wo ma, nii é deveni ma yeeluɠɔ wo ʋɛ, nii é ga Yesu Kilista. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Naa laa yɔɠɔzu, toɠa dɛ yɛsu geeɠɔlɔgi zu, eyɛsu eteai pɛ ge ɠɛ ga ma niinɛ, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge boni la kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ, é ɠula GALA goo wo nu ɲadegaiti da.<verse eid="ACT 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>«Tɔɔzei Moize ɠɛni ma: ‹Maliɠii, wa-ƓALAGI ɠa GALA goo wo nui ta wuzeɠezu wo ʋɛ ga nɔ̀un kɛʋele, wo-ɠɛɛleaiti saama. À woilo goo ma fai pɛ su! <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Kɛlɛ ni nui ta a ɠɛlɛna, ga é mina woilo GALA goo wo nui naa woo ma, naama nui ɠula ná-nuɓusɛiti saama ga saai.› <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>GALA goo wo nui niiti kpein ti ɓɔɛai, é lɔɔzei Samiyɛle ma, é zeeli naati pɛ ma, ti ʋaai tɔun poluma, ti pɛ ti niima voloiti ma vaa woni. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Wa ɠa, wo ga GALA goo wo nuiti ta-ʋoganii zeɠe nuiti, wo ɠɛ ga minazeɠegi ma ɠulanumai zɔlɔɔ nuiti, nii GALA ge kɛɛni ade-mɛmɛwolani bɛ, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la Abalaame ma: ‹Pɛlɛyeɠeiti kpein ti eteai zu, ta tuyai zɔlɔɔ è-mavofodai maaʋele ma.› <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Wa ɠa mɔunpa GALA ge ná-botiɠɛ nui wuzeɠeai ma, é teʋegai wo ma, nii a kɛ é tuya loo wo ʋɛ, ga é wo ɠilagilagi pɛ seɠe ná-telebotala ʋelei ma.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti lo fai tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakalaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Siɛgi zu Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti ɠɛni dɛ ɓɔɛzu la nuɓusɛiti pɔ, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti ʋaani, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɓɛɛ ɠundiɠii, naa ʋɛɛ Saduseyɛinti ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Ti wola yiiɠaawanaa ɠɛni de, tɔɔzei ti naati kaani, ti ɗa nuɓusɛiti kala ga tɛi Yesu wuzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya, gɔvɛiti ɓalaa ta wuzeɠe, ti ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Ti yeeʋɛɛni ti ma, ti ti ʋili kasoi ɠa eyɛsu poluma zobui, tɔɔzei kpɔkɔi ɠɛni de niina. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠidaaleʋeni naati saama, niiti ti woiloni ti-wooi ma, kidaaleʋe nui liegɔi a laazeeli nu waadɔɔlugɔ (5.000) zu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Poluma zobui, ta-ɠundiɠiiti, ta totuɠɔiti, ta tɔ kalamɔinti, ti ɠaalɛɛni ba Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Ane ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛni ti zaama, ta Kayife, ta Zan, ta Alɛgezandele, naa ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Ti ʋaani ga Piyɛlɛ ta Zan, ti naati to ɠakala, ti ti ɠaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓɛ ná-zɛbɛ ɓaa ɓɛ laasei ka wo niima vai ɠɛai la?» <verse eid="ACT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Naazu tɛi Piyɛlɛ laaveni ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À woilo nii ma, wɔi wo ga nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti, ta totuɠɔiti. <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Tɛi wo gi ɠaazaɠasu za faa ʋagɔi ma, nii kɛai seeɓɛ nu ɠila bɛ, wo ɠɛ gi dɛɛ, ʋelei baloai la, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>wo pɛ à kwɛɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti kwɛɛ ɓalaa, ga Nazalɛte nui Yesu Kilista, nii wo kpadɔni saa wului ma, GALA ge buzeɠe, é kula saai ya, naama ʋele ɠa zunui nii ɠɛdɛgai da, é loni wo ɠakala. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>Tɔ ɠa é ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‹Kɔtui nii pɛlɛ lo nuiti wo ɠɛlɛai ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">tama tɔ ɠa kɛai ga sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai.›<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Yesu ɠila nɔ ɠa kizogi ɠa zoo zɔlɔɔsu saɓui zu, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la nu ɠili nɔpɛ daasei feeni eteai zu nuiti saama, nii da zoo ɠizosu ga tɔun maaʋele.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Ti laavɔɔni gola siɛgi zu ti Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ɠaani la, ti ɗa ɓɔɛ ga ladalai, mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛni kwɛɛni ɓalaa ga naati ta ga kalatala nuiti. Ti kwɛɛni ga naati ta ga Yesu ziɛɲɔɠɔ wɔlɔmaiti. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi ti ɠɛni zunui ɠɛdɛgai ɠaazuloni ti ɠoba, ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa faa nɔpɛ bo ga gooɠaaʋote. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Ti ɠɛni ti ma naazu, ti ɠula tukpɔɠaaleʋe ʋɛlɛi wu, ti tɔɔzei ga ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa kpɔgi zu, <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa ada kɛ ga zunui niiti? Tɔɔzei Zeluzalɛme nuiti pɛ ti kwɛni ga ti laavɔɔ vaa wolai nii ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma, nii ade la zooga ade ʋa maaɠaali. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Kɛlɛ kɛni ade pele leʋe tuɠɔ ga su mina ɓaɠo nuɓusɛiti saama, ade tɔ sei ti ma, ade ti maalua ga ti mina mɔ ɓɔɛ daaseigi naa zu nu nɔpɛ gaazu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Ti naati tolini ʋolu, ti tɔgi zei ti ma, ti ɠɛ ma: «Eyɛsu pɛ wo mina mɔ ɓɔɛ, ɓaa wo ʋa kala bo, Yesu laaseigi zu.» <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Ɓɛgele ɠa soloogai GALA gaazu, gi ɠolo wo ʋɛ, ɓaa gi ɠolo GALA bɛ? Wa ɓɔɠɔi à naama lukpɔɠaaleʋena! <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Kɛlɛ gɔun, gi la zooga gi ʋa laaɠulu naa ma, nii gi kaai ta gi mɛnigai.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Ti naati maaluani ʋolu, ti ɓe ti ʋa. Ti la ɠɛni naati nimiza ʋele nɔpɛ kaani, mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠɛni GALA dɛbizu, tɔɔzei laavɔɔ vai naa ʋa, nii é ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zunui nii é ɠɛdɛni ga laavɔɔ vai, sɔlɔɔ konagi a la leʋe puunaanigɔ (40) ʋa.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋe nuiti ta-ƓALA falii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Ti ti ʋilɛgai ma, Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti liini ti-wɔɔlaiti pɔ bɛ, ti naama vaiti pɛ suɠula ti ma, niiti zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta totuɠɔiti ti boni ti ma. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Siɛgi zu ti naama vaiti mɛnini da, ti pɛ ti zolooni faa ɠila ma, ti wooɠula GALA ma, ti ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, ɗa ɠa è geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ɓɛtɛa, naa ʋɛɛ kpoloɗɛi ʋa, ta ti zu aniiti pɛ, <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>ɗa nɔ ɠa è niima wooi ʋuuni ga ɗa-Yɛnvu Ɲadegai maaʋele, ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui gi-mɛmɛwola Davide laaʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‹Leeni vaa zu zii ɠiligiti ti ɠɛɛni unga wuulee?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Leeni vaa zu ziiti pɛ ti kisiɛ ɲakaiti boni?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Zou masagiti ti kɔɔi ɓɛtɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">kundiɠiiti ti yaavai ɓɛtɛ Maliɠii laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">ta ná-zunui nii é gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma.›<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Gaamazu, Elɔde ta Pɔnse Pilate, naa ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta zii ɠiligiti ba, ti pɛ ti ɠaalɛɛni ba taai nii zu, ɗa-wotiɠɛ nu ɲadegai Yesu laalɔɠɔma, nii è gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma, <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>ti naama vai laazeeliʋɛ nɔ, nii è deveni ma yeeluɠɔ, ɗa-zobogi ta è-yiimai zu. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Niima ziɛgi zu, Maliɠii, woilo ta-maalua ɓɔɛiti ma, ti bosu, va bu gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti gi è-laawooi laazeeli ga ladalai. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Ɗa-zobogi ɠula kɛlɛma, naa ɠa a kɛ kɛdɛgi ɗa wo, laavɔɔ vaiti ta maaɓɛlɛ vaiti ti ɗa ɠɛ ɗa-wotiɠɛ nu ɲadegai Yesu laaseigi zu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga GALA fali, ʋɛ ti ɠɛni ná gaalɛbai zu, miná ɓalini, ti pɛ ti laaveni ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, ti tɔɔzei ga GALA daawooi laazeelia ga ladalai.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋe nuiti ta-ɠilibai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Zɔiti kpein ti ɠɛni ga kidaaleʋe nuiti, ti ɠilini ɓɔɠɔ ʋa ɠi gila ta zɛnvu ɠila su. Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni zeaɠɔli seɠezu ga tɔ ɠila nɔnɔ, kɛlɛ ti pɛ ti ɓɔni ti-ɠɔligiti ma. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Keelaiti ti ɠɛni zeele wooi wosu ga zɛbɛ wolai ga Maliɠii Yesu wuzeɠeʋɛ, é ɠula saai ya. GALA ná-zaalai ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu ti pɛ ba ga zɛbɛ wolai. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Ti zaama, nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ʋalani ani nɔpɛ ma, tɔɔzei zɔiti kpein zooiti ɓaa pɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni ti ya, ti ɠɛni pɔdizu, ti ʋa ga ma zɔngɔi, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>ti fe keelaiti zea, ti gaaɠwɛ ɛsɛ pɛ ba, eɠɛʋelei ma nu maavai la. <verse eid="ACT 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Levi mavofodai ta ɠɛni ná, daaseigi ga Zozɛfe, é ɠɛni ga Sipele nu. Keelaiti ti daasei pɛɛni ga Ɓalanaɓase, (nii poluʋɛ ga «nu iɲɔdɔɔ nui»). <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Zooi ta ɠɛni zea, é pɔdini, é ʋa ga ma zɔngɔi, é fe keelaiti zea.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ananiase ta Safila ta-vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Kɛlɛ zunui ta ɠɛni ná, daaseigi ga Ananiase, anzai laa ga Safila, ti ti-ɠɔligi ta ʋɔdini. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Naa ʋoluma, ta anzai ti zolooni ma ga ti ma zɔngɔi ɠilazuʋɛ makɛ ya, é ʋa ga mɔtai, é fe keelaiti zea. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Ananiase, lee vaa zu Setana è-yiimaʋɛ laavegai? È zou zɔngɔi ɠilazuʋɛ makɛ, è zɛɛi wo Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>È ʋa ɠɛ è zooi ʋɔdi, ɗa lɛi ɗɔnɔ ʋa ɠɛa de? Pɔdia ʋoluma ɓalaa, ma zɔngɔi la ɠɛa è yeema ɓaa? È leʋegɛ ɠale mu, è nii ɠɛɠala vai ɓɛtɛ yiimaʋɛ? Nuiti tɛi è ʋa zɛɛi wo ti ma, GALA ka è zɛɛi wogai ma.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Ananiase naama ɓɔɛiti mɛnigai ma, é looni, é za. Zɔiti kpein ti naama wooi mɛnini, ti pɛ ti luani. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Zunu loungoiti ti wuzeɠeni, ti maavelevele, ti lii la, ti maaɠulu.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Lɛlɛ saʋagɔ ɠɛɠala leʋegai ma, anzai ʋaani, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni kwɛɛni, nii kɛai. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Piyɛlɛ gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Gaamai wo mà, anɠɛ nɛi nuuma walii liegɔi ɠa, wo zooi ʋɔdiai la?» É naa wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ungo, naa ɠa pɔdiai la.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma naazu: «Lee vaa zu wo zoloogai ma, ga wo Maliɠii ná-Zɛnvui zuɠɔɠɔ? Wɛlɛ, zɔiti ti liai ti è-zinigi maaɠulu, ta pɛlɛlaʋɛ, ta liizu ga ɗe ɗa ɓalaa.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Gaamanɔ, é looni Piyɛlɛ ɠɔɠɔwu, é za. Zunu loungoiti ti lɛɛni, ti ka ga é zaa, ti liini la, ti maaɠulu sinigi ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Naama vai dualuagi lɔɔni Egilisii pɛ su, ta zɔiti ti naama wooi mɛnini.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laavɔɔ vai niiti keelaiti ti ɠɛni kɛɛzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Keelaiti ti ɠɛni laavɔɔ vaiti ta maaɓɛlɛ vai ma mɔinmɔin kɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti saama. Kidaaleʋe nuiti pɛ ti ɓena ɠaalɛ ba GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma zeizei bosuʋɛ, ʋɛ ná laa ga «Salomɔn ná-seizei bo kotai». <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Nu ɠili nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ʋɛɛzu ti ʋa, kɛlɛ ta-vai wola nɛɛni nuɓusɛi ʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Ti maa ɠɛni liizu ga mɔinɗa ga kidaaleʋe nu niinɛiti, zinaa ʋɛɛ anzaa ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ veezu Maliɠii ya. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Nuiti ti ɠɛni liizu vɔlɔ ga seeɓɛ nuiti koi yɔɠɔzu ʋeleiti su, ti ɗa ti la beteiti ta daama ani goiti ma, naa ɠa a kɛ Piyɛlɛ a ɠɛna leʋega, ma niinigi ʋɛɛ ɓalaa tanigaa ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni zeɠezu ɓalaa Zeluzalɛme ɠoba laa goiti su, ti ɗa ʋa ga seeɓɛ nuiti, ta niiti kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti ti ɠɛni ti zu, tama ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ʋalozu.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Keelaiti so fai ʋolu, ta ti unmɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Naazu, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai wuzeɠeni ga tolo ʋooʋamai, ta koba nuiti pɛ, niiti ti ga Saduseyɛinti ta-ɓɔgi. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Ti keelaiti soni, ti naati pili kaso ziɠi golai zu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Kɛlɛ kpidii, Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ʋaani, é kaso ziɠigi ma ɓogiti daalao, é ti ɠula, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>«À li, wo lo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, wo zɛnvu niinɛi ma ɓɔɛi pɛ daazeeli nuɓusɛi ma.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Keelaiti ti ɠoloni naama wooi ʋɛ, sobuzobui nɔ ɠɛni de, ti li GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti tɔɔzei ga kalagi woga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ta ba nuiti ti ʋaani, ti tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti gaalɛ ba ta Izilayɛle ɠɛwolaiti. Ti devei veeni ga ti keelaiti kula kasoi ɠa, ti ʋa ga tiye. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Kɛlɛ salaʋusuiti ti liini kaso ziɠigi zu, ti la ti ɠaani. Ti ɠaleni ma, ti ʋa, ti ʋoluvaawo kundiɠiiti ma, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi kaso ziɠigi ɠaaʋɛ piligai su kpe, kaso ʋɛlɛ makɛ nuiti ti loni ti-losuʋɛti pɛlɛlaʋɛti, kɛlɛ siɛgi zu gi pɛlɛiti daalaogai da, gi la nu nɔpɛ kaani bu.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Siɛgi zu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɓɛɛ ɠundiɠii ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ti naa mɛnini da, ti ɠidaaʋilini ga keelaiti ta-vai, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga ʋelei fai nii ɠaa ʋaazu ɓelazu la. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Nui ta ʋaani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À woilo dɛɛ! Zunui niiti wo ti ʋilini kasoi ɠa, tiya ɠanu, ti loni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti ɗa nuɓusɛiti kala.»<verse eid="ACT 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɓɛɛ ɠundiɠii ta polu nuiti ti liini naazu, ti ʋa ʋolu ga keelaiti, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni ga maaɓaa vaa, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni luazu ga nuɓusɛi mina yɛ ti zɔɔzu ga kɔtuiti, ti ʋa za. <verse eid="ACT 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Ti ʋaai ma ga tiye, ti naati toni tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakala. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ti ɠaazaɠani, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gi tɔ togɛ wo ma kpaan ga wo mina mɔ kala bo zunui tɔna daaseigi zu, kɛlɛ wɛlɛ, wo Zeluzalɛme laavega kpekpe ga kalagi wo bosu. Wa pɔ ga wo zunui naa ma ɲamai la gi unma mu ɓaa?» <verse eid="ACT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ta keelai zɔiti ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kɛni nu ɠolo GALA bɛ, é leʋe nuiti ba. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Ade-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI ɠa é Yesu wuzeɠeai, é kula saai ya, nii wo kpadɔni saa wului ma, wo paa. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Tɔ ma ka GALA ge buzeɠeai, é sei yeezazuʋɛ, é kɛ ga Totuɠɔi ta Kizo Nui, nii a kɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, ta-ɠotoiti suvaayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Gá ga naama vaiti ma zeeleiti, naa ʋɛɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɓalaa ba, nii GALA ge feai naati zea, niiti ti ɠolozu bɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Naama wooiti mɛni fai wanani ti ma ga gola, ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti keelaiti pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Kɛlɛ Faliziɛn gila ge wuzeɠeni kundiɠiiti saama, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Gamaliyɛle, é ɠɛni pɔ ga tɔ kalamɔin, nii nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni wola unfesu ma, é devei veeni ga ti keelaiti kula dɛ eteaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Izilayɛle nuiti, à dama ga naama vai, nii wo ɠɛɛzu wo kɛ ga zunui niiti. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Su la dɛ ɠoozani, Tudase wuzeɠeni, é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga nu ɓii, nu unnaanigɔ (400) ɠɛɠala ʋilɛni polu. Kɛlɛ ti paani, naa ʋoluma zɔiti kpein ti ʋilɛni polu, naati ti vazani, gila kpalaa ge la yɛni ná. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Tɔun poluma, Galilé nui Zudase wuzeɠeni daasei sɛʋɛ ziɛgi zu, é nu mɔinmɔin mɛɛnni, ti ʋilɛ polu. Kɛlɛ tɔ ɓalaa, ti paani, polu nuiti pɛ ti vaza. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Nii niina gè bosu wo ma, naa ɠa ga, à mina yeeʋili niima nuiti ta-vai zu, à ti yɛ ná, ti li. Ni nuɓusɛiti ka ti niima vaazeikpasui, ɓaa ma ɠɛɛwotiiti kɛɛzu, su ɠa ɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Kɛlɛ ni GALA ka é kɛɛzu, wo la zooga wo ʋa ti ɠoloɠolo. À dama, wo mina ʋa kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu GALA daalɔɠɔma.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Kundiɠiiti ti vaani gooi wu. <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Ti keelaiti tolini ʋolu, ti naati doɠa ga kpakɔi, ti tɔ sei ti ma kpaan ga ti mina mɔ ɓɔɛ Yesu laaseigi zu, naa ʋoluma ti ɓeni ti ʋa, ti li. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Naati ti zeɠeni tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakala ga koozunɛɛi, soloo fai zu ti ma ga ti ɲɛɛɠulasui zɔlɔɔ Yesu laaseigi ma vaa zu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Tama folo-o-folo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu ta koizuʋɛti, ti la ɠɛni ɓɔlɔzu ga kalagi woga, ta Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeliai ga Yesu ɠa é ga Kilista.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Zeelobai wo fai ga <optbreak/> Egilisi wotiɠɛ nu lɔfela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, tɛi kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni mɔinzu gola, ti zaama Zuifui niiti ti Gɛlɛke wooi wosu, naati ti ɠɛni unsuyelii losu ga Eɓulu nuiti, mazɔlɔɔ folo ɠilagila kɔnɔgi ɠaaɠwɛ ziɛgi zu, ti la ɠɛni ta-ʋoanzaiti daazɔbosu ga pagɔ. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) ti kaladopoiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «É la zolooni ga gi GALA daawooi laazeeli vai yɛ ná, ɠɔnɔ gaaɠwɛɛ vai zu. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à yeelo nu lɔfela ʋa wo zaama, niiti lɔɠɔ ʋagɔ ti ʋa, ti laavegai ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ta ɠimalai, gi naama wotii ve ti ya. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Gɔun, gá ɠaaɓaazu GALA falii ta GALA daawooi ma wotii ma.» <verse eid="ACT 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Naama wooi laani bɛbɛi yii ɠa ga pagɔ. Ti yeeloni Etiyɛni ʋa, zunui nii daaveni ga kidaaleʋei ta Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, naa ʋoluma Filipe ta Polokɔɔl, Nikanɔɔl ta Timɔn, Paalemenase ta Antiyɔse nui Nikola, nii é lɔɔni mɔungi Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA pelei ma. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Ti ti lɛɛni ga keelaiti, naati kpegai ma ga GALA falii ɠɛ, ti yeelaani ti ma.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>GALA daawooi zu ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu, kaladopoiti ti ɗa mɔin Zeluzalɛme, zalaɠa ɠula nui ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ɠidaaleʋezu ɓalaa.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kilista ná-zeelei Etiyɛni zɔɔ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Etiyɛni nii GALA ná-zaalai ta ná-zɛbɛi ɠɛni ba ga gola, é ɠɛni maaɓɛlɛ vaiti ta laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Kɛlɛ nui tanigaa ti wuzeɠeni daalɔɠɔma, tanigaa ti zeɠeni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, nii daaseigi ga «Duɔi niiti ti unmɔɔgai», naa tanigaa ti ɠɛni ga Silɛne Zuifuiti ta Alɛgezandili ʋeaiti, naa ʋɛɛ Silisi ta Azi Zuifuiti ba. Ti Etiyɛni maaɠaalini, <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni ziɛzu bu, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ga ɠigi, nii Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛni feezu zea. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Ti veleni nuiti su, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Gi goomɛnigɛ, é ɗa woo ɲɔi wo Moize ta GALA daalɔɠɔma.» <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Ʋele ɠana ti wutugi leʋeni la nuɓusɛiti saama, ta totuɠɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ba, naa ʋoluma ti liini, ti so ga maaɓaai, ti ʋaa la tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti pɔ. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Ti zɛɛ zeeleiti kulani, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Zunui nii ɠa woo ɲɔi wosu nɔ ɠɔ ada ɲadegai ta tɔgi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gi goomɛnigɛ, é ɗa ɠɛ ma, Nazalɛte nui Yesu ɠa adɛ ʋɛ ɠoloɠolosu, ta é faa wɔlɔmaiti maavalibo, niiti Moize ti lɛai ga adeye.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Zɔiti kpein ti ɠɛni zeini tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, ti ɠaazuloga ɠɛni de Etiyɛni ʋa, ti pɛtɛni ga gaazuʋɛ ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ geezuɠeelai.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Etiyɛni ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠɛni ma: «Gaama ɠa nuu nɛi ti bosu?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Etiyɛni gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «À woilo mà, wɔi wo ga kɛ̀ɛni ta kɛ̀ɛleaiti! Lɛbiya ƓALAGI ɠulani kɛlɛma ade-mɛmɛwola Abalaame ʋɛ, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la Mezopotami, aisa é ʋa li, é zei Ɠalan. <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>É ɠɛni ma: ‹Zeɠe ɗa-yooi zu, ɗa-wolodai zu, li zooi naa zu, ʋɛ gè ná lɛɛzu ga ɗe.› <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Názu ɠa é ɠula la Ɓaɓilɔne yooi ʋa, é li é zei Ɠalan. Miná ɠa é yɛni ná, kɛɛɠɛ zaai ma, GALA ge ɓudɛ la zooi nii zu, ʋɛ wo zeini ná za. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>É la ɠɛni ada nɔpɛ feeni zea naama yooi zu, anɛɛ kɔɠɔ lo daa ɠila kɛɠala you, kɛlɛ é minazeɠeni bɛ ga toɠa zooi naa veezu bɛ, ta mavofodaiti bɛ tɔun poluma, naazu doun nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni dɛ zea. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>À woilo dɛɛ naa ma, nii GALA ge boni ma: ‹Suɠwɛɛ ga è-mavofodaiti ta ɠɛ ga seikɔɠɔma nuiti zooi taɠili su, ta ɠɛ ná ga duɔiti, ti ti zopele ɲɔu kona unnaanigɔ (400) laawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Kɛlɛ nà zii naa lukpɔɠaaleʋe, nii ta duɔlai ɠɛ zeezu, naa ʋoluma, ta ɠula, ti ʋa, ti dɛ̀bi ʋɛ.› <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Naa ʋoluma, GALA ge minazeɠegi ɓɛtɛni ti yɔɠɔzu ta Abalaame, é tatipɛlɛʋolui ɠɛ ga ma ʋoogi. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, é Izaake zɔlɔɔgai ma, é tatini pɛlɛʋolu foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, Izaake ɓalaa kɛɛni ɠana nɔ ga Zakɔɓe, Zakɔɓe ɓalaa kɛ ɠana nɔ ga ade-mɛmɛwola puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12).<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>«Ade-mɛmɛwolani ti toloi ɠulani ga Zozɛfe, ti pɔdi ga ti lii la Ezipete yooi zu. Kɛlɛ GALA ge ɠɛni ba, <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>é kula ná-kpɔlɔi pɛ su. GALA ge ɠigi veeni zea, é zaala zɔlɔɔ Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn ɠaazu, naa sei ga kundiɠii Ezipete yooi ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei unda. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Pului looni Ezipete yooi zu ná pɛ ta Kanaan yooi ɓalaa su, kpɔlɔi wola wɔɔlɔni, ade-mɛmɛwolani ti la ɠɛni ɠɔnɔ sɔlɔɔsu. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Zakɔɓe mɛnigai ma ga moloi ɠa Ezipete yooi zu, é ade-mɛmɛwolani teʋeni ná mɔunpa. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Ti ziɛ laa velesiɛi zu, Zozɛfe ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga kɛɛɠɛlointi, Falaɠɔn Zozɛfe ɠulazuʋɛ ɠwɛɛni. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Naa ʋoluma, Zozɛfe valini ga ti ʋa ga kɛɛɠɛ Zakɔɓe, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei pɛ, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu ʋuulɔfela maazu lɔɔlugɔ (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Zakɔɓe liini Ezipete, é yɛ ná, é za, ade-mɛmɛwolani ɓalaa ti za. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Ti liini ga ti-ma ʋoomaiti Sikɛme, ti ti maaɠulu Abalaame ná-kabamaʋɛ, nii é geyani ga walii Ɠamɔɔl ná-doun zunuiti ma Sikɛme.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>«Tɛi yeeɠɛɠalai maa ɠɛni ɓuɠazu ga GALA ná-minazeɠegi laazeeli, nii é kɛɛni Abalaame ʋɛ, ada-nuɓusɛiti ti mɔinni, ti ɓuɠu Ezipete yooi zu, <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>eyɛsu masagi taɠili ge wuzeɠe Ezipete yooi zu, nii é la ɠɛni Zozɛfe ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Masagi naa zeini ada-nuɓusɛiti ga, é ɗa ade-mɛmɛwolani kpɔlɔ, eyɛsu é ɠɛ naati ma, ti ɗa ta-loun ɲɛgiti kula pɛlɛi ʋa, ti ɗa za.<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>«Naama ziɛgi zu ɠa Moize zɔlɔɔga da, gola ʋa GALA gaazu. É kɛɛni ga alu saʋagɔ, ti ɗa kɔnɔkula kɛɛɠɛ ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Siɛgi zu ti kulani la pɛlɛi ʋa, Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui seɠeni, é kulasu eɠɛ kpɔɠɔ loun zunu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Moize kalagi zɔlɔɔni Ezipete ɠimalai pɛ su, sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔni kpɔɛzuɠulai ta kɛɛwotiiti su.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>«É kona ʋuunaanigɔi (40) zɔlɔɔgai ma, ɠi ge looni bɛ ga é wɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ma, Izilayɛle nuiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>É gila kaani, ti ɗa kpɔlɔ, é naa maaloboni, nii ti ɠɛni kpɔlɔzu, naa nɔnɔi ʋotokulazuʋɛ, é Ezipete nui ʋaani. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>É ɠisiɛni ga kɛɛɠɛlointi ta gaaɠa ga GALA ka pɔ é ti ɠizo ga maaʋele, kɛlɛ naati ti la ɠɛni naa ɠaaɠaani. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Poluma voloi, é liini, é lɔ tanigaa yɔɠɔzu, niiti ti ɠɛni ɲɛpii ɠɔɔzu, nii a kɛ é ti yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ, é ɠɛni ti ma: ‹Wa ga ɠɛɛɠɛlointi, lee vaa zu wo ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔlɔzu?› <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é ɠɛni bɔɔlai ɓɔlɔzu, naa goolaaʋilini, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa é è zeiɗa ga kundiɠii ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui gi unda? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Ɗa pɔ è pàa, eɠɛʋelei è Ezipete nui ʋaani la wogi?› <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Moize naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, é ʋelani, é li, é zei Madiyan nuiti ta-yooi zu, é doun zunu felegɔ zɔlɔɔ miná.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>«Kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) leʋegai ma mɔnɔ, geezuɠeelai gila ge ɠulani bɛ kɛlɛma Sinayi gizei ma leʋebai zu, abuzogi zaama, nii é ɠɛni kpɔvɔ goi ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Moize laavɔɔ ʋelei ma ga naama ɠulakɛlɛmai, é ɠɛni maaɓuɠazu ba ga é ka, Maliɠii ɓɔɛni pɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‹Nà ɠa gè ga è-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI, Abalaame, Izaake, ta Zakɔɓe.› Moize zasuɓalini, é la ɠɛni zoosu é ʋa wɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: ‹Ɗa-zaʋalagiti kula ɠɔɠɔa, mazɔlɔɔ adaʋɛ ʋɛ è loni ná, zou ʋe gè maaɲɛɛ ʋɛai ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Gaamazu, gè nà-nuɓusɛiti ta-ɓɔlɔi ɠaa Ezipete yooi zu, gè ti ɓala gooi mɛniga, ti bosu. Gè ʋaa ga gè ti unmɔɔ. Naa ɠa é ba, nà è leʋesu Ezipete yooi zu.›<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>«Moizei tɔna nii ti ɠɛlɛni ba, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa é è zeiɗa ga kundiɠii ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui?› Naa ɠa GALA ge teʋeni ga kundiɠii ta unmɔɔ nui, geezuɠeelai ná-kpɔbai zaɓui zu, nii é ɠulani bɛ kɛlɛma kpɔvɔ goi zu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Tɔ ɠa é ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa ga maaɓɛlɛ vaiti ta laavɔɔ vaiti, Kpoloɗɛ Ɓɔigi zaama ta teʋebai zu kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>Moize ɠilagi naa nɔ ɠa, é ɠɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ma: ‹GALA ka GALA goo wo nui ta wuzeɠezu wo ʋɛ ga nɔ̀un kɛʋele, wo-ɠɛɛleaiti saama.› <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Siɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti gaalɛa ɠɛni de la ba teʋebai zu, tɔnɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ade-mɛmɛwolani zɔɠɔzu ta geezuɠeelai, nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ Sinayi gizei ma. É zɛnvu su wooiti sɔlɔɔni, ga é ti laazeeli ade ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>Ade-mɛmɛwolani ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni, ti ʋa ɠolo bɛ, kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni daaʋilisu, ti-yiimaʋɛ pɛ tatiga ɠɛni de Ezipete yooi ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Ti ɠɛni Aalɔn ma: ‹Wuzeɠena, è galagiti kpɛtɛ gi ʋɛ, ti lo gi luɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ Moize nii, é gi ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa, gi la kwɛɛ nii kɛai la.› <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, ti nikɛ yiʋoi maaniinigi ɓɛtɛni, ti ɗa zalaɠaiti kula kɔɔɠɔ ganigi naa ʋɛ, ti ɗa ɠoozunɛ naa ma, nii ti kpɛtɛai ga ti ɓɔɠɔ yeei. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>GALA ge ʋoluaveni ti ʋa, é ti yɛ ná, ti ɗa aniiti pɛ dɛbi, ti volozu geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Naa ɠa sɛʋɛai GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‹Ee, Izilayɛle nuiti, zalaɠa zuai wo ɠɛni ti ʋaazu, ta zalaɠai niiti wo ɠɛni ti ɠulazu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">nà ɠa wo ɠɛni ti ɠulazu bɛ̀ ɓaa?<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Ɓa-o, wo Mɔlɔke ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi zeɠeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">ta wa-ɠalagi Lefan ma zomideɠai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">maaniinigi niiti wo ti ɓɛtɛai ga wo ɗa nɔkɔ ti wu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Tɔ ɠa é ba, nà wo leʋesu duɔlai zu poun Ɓaɓilɔne ʋoluʋelei.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amɔ 5:25-27</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>«Ade-mɛmɛwolani kɛai ma teʋebai zu, seɠe ʋɛlɛi ɠɛni ti ya, nii minazeɠegi ma zɛʋɛi ɠɛni bu, seɠe ʋɛlɛi nii GALA ge Moize leveni ga é to, ga naama ɠazaʋigi nii é kaani. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Ade-mɛmɛwolani ti naa zɔlɔɔgai ma, Zozuwe yɛni ti luɠɔ, ti lɛɛ la zooi naa zu, ti kulani ziiti zea, niiti GALA ge ɠɛni ti ɓɛɛzu ti luɠɔ. Seɠe ʋɛlɛi naa yɛni ná eyɛsu Davide ná-yeeɠɛɠalai, <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>naa zaala zɔlɔɔni GALA gaazu, é suvali ga zobo ge ve bɛ, é pɛlɛ lo Zakɔɓe ná-GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Kɛlɛ Salomɔn ɠa niina, é pɛlɛi loni GALA bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa la ɗa ga zei pɛlɛi wu, nii togai ga nu ɓɔɠɔ yeei, eɠɛʋelei GALA goo wo nui boni da, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>‹Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: Geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa é ga nà-masa kpɔkpɔgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">zooi ɠɛ ga nà-kɔɠɔloma anii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Pɛlɛi ma zii ɓɛgele ɠa wa zoo tosu bɛ̀?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Mini ɠa nà zoo zeizu ná?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Nà lɛi gè ʋa naama aniiti pɛ kpɛtɛ ɓaa?›<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>«Ee, suvɔ nuiti, niiti ti-yiimaʋɛ, ta ti-woiyeɠeiti daaɠulugai! Wa Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zakpesu yeenɔpɛ! Wo ɠulaʋɛ ga wo-mɛmɛwolani. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>GALA goo wo nui ɓɛ ɠa, wo-mɛmɛwolani ti la kpɔlɔni? Ti naati paani vɔlɔ, niiti ti ɠɛni Telebo Nui ʋaa vai wosu ma yeeluɠɔ, nii wo yaavaai, wo pa. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Wɔigi wo GALA ná-tɔgi zɔlɔɔgai ga geezuɠeelaiti maaʋele, kɛlɛ wo la kɛɛni wo ʋa ɠolo bɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etiyɛni zɔɔ vai ga kɔtuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Ti naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, é wanani ti ma ga gola, ti ɗa ɲiigai ziɛ ga Etiyɛni laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi Etiyɛni mu daavega ɠɛni de ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, é ɠaazuwuzeɠeni geeɠɔlɔgi zu ʋele, é GALA ná-lɛbiyai ɠaani, ta é Yesu ɠa loni GALA zeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Nà geeɠɔlɔgi laalaogai ɠaazu, ta Nu ná-Doun Zunui loni GALA zeezazuʋɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Názu ɠa ti kpeei looni la, ti ɗa ti-woiyeɠeiti daaɠulu, ti ɓizɛ ʋɔɔma daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Ti kpɛɛni, ti kula taai ʋa, ti ɗa sɔ ga kɔtuiti. Naama zeeleiti ti ɠɛni ta-zeɠeiti feezu zunu loungoi ta ya, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Sɔle. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni Etiyɛni zɔɔzu la, é ɠɛni GALA falizu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii Yesu, yeezei zɛ̀nvui wu.» <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa, é ɓain ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, mina niima ɠotoi la ti unma.» É naa wogai ma, é zaani.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Sɔle vaani bu, ti Etiyɛni ʋa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Wɔinzeɠemai ta kidaaleʋe nuiti faza fai</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Naama voloi nɔ, wɔinzeɠema wolai laalɛɛni Zeluzalɛme Egilisii wu. É ɠula keelaiti polu, kidaaleʋe nuiti pɛ ti vazani Zudé laaiti ta Samali laaiti su. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>GALA gaazuluaba nuiti ti Etiyɛni maaɠuluni, ti wola wɔlɔ ná-faa zu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Kɛlɛ Sɔle mu ge ɠɛni Egilisi nuiti kpɔlɔzu, é ɠɛni lɛɛzu pɛlɛiti bu, é ɗa kidaaleʋe nuiti folo ná, zunuiti ta anzanuiti, é ɗa ti ʋili kasoi ɠa.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA daawooi laazeeli vai Samali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Zɔiti ti vazani, naati ti ɠɛni liizu adɛti, ti ɗa Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filipe yeini Samali laa wolai gila su, é Kilista ná-fai laazeeli ná. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Bɛbɛi pɛ ge woiloni ga pagɔ Filipe wooi ma, siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni gooi mɛnisu da, ti ɗa laavɔɔ vaiti ka, niiti é ɠɛni ti ɠɛɛzu. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɔzɔba yɛnvui ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ɠulazu inɛ su nuiti su, ti ɗa kpeei loo ga gola, naa ʋoluma mɛɠɛlɛ nuiti ta maalɛɠɛfɛ nui ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ʋalozu. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Koozunɛ wolai ɠɛni taa wolai naa zu.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Kaite zunui ta ɠɛni taai naa zu, daaseigi ga Simon, é ɠɛni molikula fai ɠɛɛzu, é Samali nuɓusɛiti pɛ daavɔɔni, é ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu ga toɠa ga nu wola. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ, ɓolomadɔɠɔiti ta seizumaanɛgiti, ti ɠɛni woilosu goo ma ga pagɔ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Zunui nii ɠa é ga GALA ná-zɛbɛi, nii daaseigi ga ‹Zɛbɛ Wolai›.» <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Ti wola ɓatani ba, mazɔlɔɔ é lɛbini gola ti laavɔɔzu ga ná-molikula faiti. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu ti ɠidaaleʋeni la Filipe laawooi ma, nii é ɠɛni GALA ná-masadai ta Yesu Kilista laaseigi ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu ti ma, zinaa ta anzaa, ti ɓatizeni. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Simon ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa ɠidaaleʋeni. Kpegai ma ga ɓatize, é la mɔ ɠɛni zeɠezu Filipe ʋolu. Daa ɠɛni vɔɔzu ga maaɓɛlɛ vaiti ta laavɔɔ vai, niiti Filipe ɠɛni ti ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Keelaiti ti ɠɛni Zeluzalɛme, ti mɛnigai ma ga Samali nuiti ti yeezeiɗa GALA daawooi wu, ti Piyɛlɛ ta Zan leʋeni ti ma. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Naati ti zeeliai ma ná, ti GALA falini ti ʋɛ, nii a kɛ ti Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai la ɠɛni dɛ yeini ti tanɔpɛ ma, ti ɓatizeni nɔ Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi zu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti yeelaani ti ma, ti Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Simon kaai ma ga kidaaleʋe nuiti ta Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔsu siɛgi zu keelaiti ti yeelaazu la ti ma, é walii leteni Piyɛlɛni ta Zan ma. <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À ma zobogi ve bɛ̀, ga zɔi nɔpɛ nà yeela ma, ma nu Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa walii yɛ è ʋa, wo li undaaʋiligi zu, tɔɔzei ɗa ɠisiɛzu ga GALA ná-vebɛanii ɠa zɔlɔɔsu ga walii. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Ɗɔnɔ ta è-ʋɔɔda nɔpɛ ge la niima vai zu, mazɔlɔɔ è-yii la zɔleni GALA gaazu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Nimiza mu ga è ɠoozu ɠisiɛ ɲɔi, Maliɠii maanɛɛnɛ, nii a kɛ ni soloo faa ʋe, é è zuvaayɛ ga kisiɛi, nii é è-yiimaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ʋelei gè kaazu la, è laavegɛ ga faa wanai, ta ɗa ga faa ɲɔi ná-duɔi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simon ɠɛni ma: «Wa ɓɔɠɔi à Maliɠii maanɛɛnɛ bɛ̀, nii a kɛ nii kpein wo bogai, naa tanɔpɛ ge mina zeeli mà.»<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Piyɛlɛ ta Zan ti ɓegai ma ga zeele wooi wo, ta ti Maliɠii laawooi laazeeli, ti ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme, ti ɗa li ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelia Samali nuiti ta-laa go mɔinmɔin su.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filipe ta Etiyopi ɠundiɠi wolai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Yeeta, Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ɓɔɛni Filipe ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe, è li ga lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ, pelei naa zu nii é zeɠezu Zeluzalɛme, é yei Gaza ʋelei, nii é teʋebai zu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Filipe liini gaamanɔ. Ná-pelei zu, é zunu zɛɛɠagai gila kaani, Etiyopi nu ɠɛni de. É ɠɛni ga kundiɠi wola, Etiyopi masa anzanui Kandase ná-naavoloi unda nui ɠɛni de. É ʋaani Zeluzalɛme GALA dɛbizu. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>É ɠɛni ɠalesu ma, é zeini ná-soo wotoloi zu, é ɗa GALA goo wo nui Ezayi ná-sɛʋɛi ɠala. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛni Filipe ma: «Maaɓuɠa soo wotoloi nuu ʋa.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Filipe ɓizɛni, é Etiyopi zunui woomɛni, é ɗa GALA goo wo nui Ezayi ná-sɛʋɛi ɠala. É ɠɛni naa ma: «Nii é kalasu, ɗa gaaɠaazu nɛi?»<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Zunui gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà gaaɠa ɠale, ni nu la suɠulani mà?» É Filipe lolini ga naa lɛ, é zei koba wotoloi zu. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Ʋɛ é ɠɛni ná ɠalasu, é zɛʋɛni ná ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">«É la ɠɛni woo ɲɛ gila kpalaa boni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">eɠɛ baalagi ti liizu la paazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">eɠɛ baala ziʋoi é loni maaleɠa leʋe nui ɠakala.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Ná-ɓɔɠɔmaayeii zu, ti ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋeni ga telebotalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">ɓɛ ɠa a kɛɛɠalazuʋɛti dɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Mazɔlɔɔ zɛnvui ɠulani zea.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:32-33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Eza 53:7-8</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Etiyopi zunui Filipe ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, ɓɛ ɠa GALA goo wo nui vaazu ma? Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋe, ɓaa nu ɠili be?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Filipe kpɔɛi zeɠeni naazu, é tɔɔzei naama zɛʋɛi zu wooi ma, é Yesu ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli ma. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Ti yɛni liizu, ti zeeli adɛ ta, ʋɛ ziɛi ɠɛni ná, kundiɠii ɠɛni Filipe ma: «Wɛlɛ ziɛi ʋa. Lee ɠa é pele leʋesu tùɠɔ, gè ʋa ɓatize?» <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filipe gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa ɠidaaleʋena ga è-yiimaʋɛ pɛ, ɗa zoo ɓatizesu.» Zunui ɠɛ ma: «Gè ɠidaaleʋea ga Yesu Kilista ɠa é ga GALA Doun Zunui.» <verse eid="ACT 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Etiyopi zunui devei veeni ga wotoloi lo. Filipe ta zunui naa ti felegɔ ti ʋilɛni ziɛi wu, Filipe kpatize. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠulani la ziɛi wu, Maliɠii ná-Zɛnvui Filipe zeɠeni. Etiyopi zunui la mɔ ɠɛni Filipe ɠaani, kɛlɛ é liini ga koozunɛɛi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Filipe wɛlɛni nɔ, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠa Azɔte, naa ʋoluma, taa wolai niiti kpein é ɠɛni leʋesu ti zu, é Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini naati pɛ, eyɛsu é zeeli Sezalé.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sɔle ɠidaaleʋe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Naama ziɛ su, Sɔle ɠɛni ba nɔ, é ɗa maalua vaiti ta nu ʋaa vai wo Maliɠii ná-kaladopoiti daalɔɠɔma. É liini zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ʋɔ bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>é sɛʋɛa ɠaiziɛ zea, teʋegai Damase ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu nuiti ma, ga ni a nu nɔpɛ kaana, zunu ɓaa anzanu, é kidaaleʋe ʋele niinɛi naa ma, é gili, é ʋaa la Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Kɛai ma pelei zu, é ɗa li, maaɓuɠaai ma Damase ʋa, gaamago nɔ wozakalagi ta ɠulani geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é ɗa volo maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>É looni zooi ma, é wooi ta mɛnini, é ɗa toli, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Sɔle, Sɔle, lee vaa zu è wɔ̀inzeɠezu?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>É ɠɛni naa ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa ga ɗe, Màliɠii?» Naa ɠɛ ma: «Nà ɠa gè ga Yesu, nii è wɔ̀inzeɠezu. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Kɛlɛ wuzeɠe, è lɛ taazu, ta naa wo è ma, nii ɗa kɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Siɛɲɔɠɔiti ti loni, ti laavɔ kpaan, ti la zooni ti ʋa woo ɠila kpalaa bo, ti ɠɛni wooi mɛnisu, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni nu nɔpɛ kaazu. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sɔle wuzeɠeni zooi ma, gaazuzeɠeni ma, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni wozaɠaazu. Ti soni zeei ʋa, ti lii la Damase. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>É kɛɛni ga folo saʋagɔ, é la wozaɠaazu, é la laamiizu, é la ɓɔɔlezu.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Tama kaladopoi ta ɠɛni Damase, daaseigi ga Ananiase. Maliɠii tolini, é ɠɛ ma: «Ananiase!» É gooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ɠaa, Màliɠii!» <verse eid="ACT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: «Wuzeɠe, è li ga koi yɔɠɔzu ʋelei nii daaseigi ga ‹Sɔlegai›, è wɛlɛ Zudase ná-pɛlɛi wu ga zunui nii daa ga Sɔle, Taalese nui, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa GALA falizu. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Tama é zunui ta ɠaaʋɛ kulakɛlɛmai zu, daaseigi ga Ananiase, é ɗa lɛ pɛlɛi wu ga é yeela ma, nii a kɛ gaazuʋɛ zeɠe ma.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Ananiase ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, gè mɛniga nu mɔinmɔin da, ga zunui naa faa ɲɔu mɔinmɔin kɛa ga ɗa-nuiti Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Naa ʋoluma, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta-zobogi ɠa zea ʋɛ, nii a kɛ é naati gili, zɔiti nɔpɛ a ti ɠa, ti ɗa wooɠula GALA ma è-laaseigi zu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Kɛlɛ Maliɠii ɠɛni ma: «Li, tɔɔzei zunui nuu ɠa ga aniɲakai nii gè yiimazeɠeai la, nii a kɛ é dàaseigi ɠula kɛlɛma zii ɠiligiti bɛ, ta masagiti, naa ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Nà ɓɔɠɔi, nà ʋaazu dɛɛzu la, ʋelei é ʋaazu ɓɔlɔzu la bɛ̀.»<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Ananiase liini, seeliai ma pɛlɛi wu, é yeelaani Sɔle ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Kɛ̀ɛloun Sɔle, Maliɠii Yesu, nii kulaai è ʋɛ kɛlɛma pelei zu, nii è ʋaai la, naa ɠa é tèʋegai ga è-ɠaazuʋɛ zeɠe ma, ta è laave ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Gaamago nɔ, é ɠɛɛni eɠɛ ani ɠalaiti ta ɠula Sɔle ɠaazuʋɛ, ti loo, gaazuʋɛ zeɠe ma. É wuzeɠeni, é ɓatize. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>É daamii wogai ma, é zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔni. É foloi tanigaa ɠɛɛni kaladopoiti ba, niiti ti ɠɛni Damase. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>É tɔɔzeini gaamago ga Yesu ná-fai laazeeli GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Yesu ɠa é ga GALA Doun Zunui.» <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Zɔiti pɛ ti ɠɛni goomɛnisu, ti laavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Nii lɛi é ɠɛa naama nuiti wɔinzeɠezu Zeluzalɛme, niiti ti GALA tolisu daaseigi nii zu? Kɛbɛ, paa ungi ɠa nɔ ga é naama nuiti gili, é li ga tiye zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti pɔ, kɛlɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Kɛlɛ folo-o-folo Sɔle ná-kala gooi zɛbɛi ɠɛni ɓaɠozu: Zuifui niiti ti ɠɛni Damase, ti la mɔ ɠɛni kwɛɛ nii ta bo, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni dɛɛzu ga tiye ga Yesu ɠa é ga Kilista.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Yeeɠɛɠala zuɠooza teʋegai ma, Zuifuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ leveni ga ti paa. <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Sɔle faa ɠwɛɛni ta-yaava vai zu. Ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu vɔlɔ taa ziɠidaʋɛti ma, folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa, nii a kɛ ti paa. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Kɛlɛ, ná-kaladopoiti ti seɠeni ga kpidii, ti da kpɔlɔgi zu, ti zei ga siɠigi ʋoluʋelei.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔle ɠɛɛ vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Sɔle zeeliai ma Zeluzalɛme, é kɔɠɔni ga é ʋɔ pɛɛ kaladopoiti ba, kɛlɛ ti pɛ ti ɠɛni luazu ba, ti la ɠɛni laani da ga é ɠɛa ga kaladopoi ta. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Ɓalanaɓase seɠe ʋele ɠana, é lii la keelaiti pɔ bɛ. É naa kpein suɠulani ti ma, ʋelei Maliɠii ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni la ga Sɔle pelei zu, é ɓɔɛ pɔ, ta ʋelei Sɔle GALA daawooi laazeelini la ga ladalai Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi zu Damase. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>É zo naazu ma niina, ta naati ti ɠɛni lɛɛzu, ti ɗa yei Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ, é ɗa GALA daawooi laazeeli ga ladalai Maliɠii laaseigi zu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Zuifui niiti ti Gɛlɛke wooi wosu, ta naati ti ɠɛni yɛpɛzu, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maaɠaali, kɛlɛ naati ti ɠɛni paa ɠeleɠele gaiziɛzu. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Kidaaleʋe nuiti ti naa zuɠwɛɛgai ma, ti liini la Sezalé, ti teʋe Taalese.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Ziilɛigi ɠɛni Zudé Egilisii pɛ su, ta Galilé, naa ʋɛɛ Samali ʋa, é ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu kidaaleʋei zu, é ɗa ziɛ ɓɔɠɔmaayeii zu Maliɠii ʋɛ, gaa ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu ga nui liegɔi, nii é ɠɛni ʋɛɛzu ba ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-kpɔbai.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ené ʋalo vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Tɛi Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni leʋesu zooi zu ná pɛ, é zeelini ɓalaa kidaaleʋe nuiti pɔ bɛ, niiti ti ɠɛni Lida taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>É zunui ta ɠaani ná, daa ga Ené, é laani seeɓɛ ʋetei ɠa kaite kona dɔsaʋa laawu ga kɔlɔsama zeeɓɛi. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Ené, Yesu Kilista é ʋaloa! Wuzeɠe, ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è ɗa-ʋetei lɛ ba.» É wuzeɠeni gaamago. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Lida ta Salɔn nɛmɛi zu nuiti pɛ ti miná ɠaai ma, ti ɠidaaleʋeni Maliɠii ma.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dɔlɔkase wuzeɠe vai, <optbreak/> é ɠula saai ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Kidaaleʋe anzanu ɠila ge ɠɛni Zɔpé, daa ga Taɓita, (nii poluʋɛ ga «Dɔlɔkase»), é ɠɛni botii ʋagɔ mɔinmɔin kɛɛzu, é ɗa faaɓɔɠɔiti kɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, é zeeɓɛni, é za. Ti maagbaai ma, ti daani geezu ʋɛlɛi ta wu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Zɔpé ɠaladopoiti ti mɛnigai ma ga Piyɛlɛ ɠa ti ɠobaʋɛ laai zu Lida, ti zunu felegɔ leʋeni polu, ti maanɛɛnɛni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Soma, è ʋa fala gi ʋɔ bɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Piyɛlɛ wuzeɠeni, é ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, ti li. Ti zeeliai ma, ti lɛɛni la geezu ʋɛlɛi wu. Poanzaiti pɛ ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɗa wɔlɔ, ti ɠɛni seɠe goiti ta tookɔba wolaiti dɛɛzu la, niiti Dɔlɔkase ɠɛni ti ɓɛtɛzu ti ʋɛ, siɛgi zu naa ɠɛni la ti ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Piyɛlɛ ɛsɛ pɛ kulani eteaʋɛ, é GALA fali. Naa ʋoluma, é ɠaaʋoteni poomai ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Taɓita, wuzeɠe!» Naa ɠaazuzeɠeni ma, é Piyɛlɛ ɠa, é zɛba é zei. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Piyɛlɛ yeelaani zea, é buzeɠe, naa ʋoluma é kidaaleʋe nuiti ta poanzaiti tolini, é dɛɛ ga tiye, é vulua. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Zɔpé nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti naa mɛnini, ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠidaaleʋe Maliɠii ma. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Piyɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠala go ɠɛɛni Zɔpé kɔlɔ ɓɛtɛ nui ta ʋɔ bɛ, nii daa ga Simon.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai Kɔlenɛye sɔlɔɔni Sezalé</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni Sezalé, daaseigi ga Kɔlenɛye, é ɠɛni salaʋusu ɓulu gila maazu, nii é zeɠeni Itali. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Zunui naa ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ti ɠɛni ga GALA gaazuluaba nua, é ɠɛni faaɓɔɠɔ mɔinmɔin kɛɛzu nuɓusɛiti bɛ, é ɠɛni GALA falizu siɛnɔpɛ su. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Yeeta, kpɔkɔ volo yeeɠɛɠalai zaʋasiɛi ma, é GALA ná-geezuɠeelai gila kaani, kulaai kɛlɛma kpezekele, é ɗa lɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu, naa tolini, é ɠɛ ma: «Kɔlenɛye!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>É ɠaazuloni naa ʋa, dualuagi soni, é ɠɛ ma: «Toɠa ɠale, Màliɠii?» Naa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-ƓALA faliiti, ta ɗa-vaaɓɔɠɔiti ti zeelia GALA ma, ki ka ti zu. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Keelaiti teʋena ɠaniɠani nɔ Zɔpé, ti Simon loli, nii daasei pɛai ga Piyɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Kɔlɔ ɓɛtɛ nui Simon ná-pɛlɛi wu ɠa é ɲiizu ná, kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Geezuɠeelai nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ, naa liini nɔ feya, Kɔlenɛye ná-botiɠɛ nu felegɔ loli, ta GALA gaazuluaba zalaʋusui gila, nii é botii ɠɛɛzu tɔun ba. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Kpegai ma ga fai pɛ suɠula ti ma, é ti leʋeni Zɔpé.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulakɛlɛmai Piyɛlɛ sɔlɔɔni Zɔpé</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Polumai, tɛi ti ɠɛni pelei ma, ti maa ɗa ɓuɠa Zɔpé ʋa, Piyɛlɛ lɛɛni pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ ga folo ɓekpegi, ná ɓɛtɛai ga dooɠo bosuʋɛ, ga é GALA fali. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Pului soni, é ɠɛni pɔ ga é daamii wo. Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ɠɔnɔgi ɓɛtɛzu la bɛ, suɠilini. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>É geeɠɔlɔgi laalaogai ɠaani, é ani ta ɠaani eɠɛ seɠe wolai toko logai seki naanigɔi pɛ ga, é ɗa yei zooi ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Ɠɔɠɔ naani suaiti ti ɠɛni su, ta kpokpo suaiti, naa ʋɛɛ wɔniiti ba. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Wooi ta zeelini ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe, Piyɛlɛ, è ta ʋaa, è mi!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Ɓa-o, Màliɠii, tɔɔzei kaipa gè la dɛ tɔ ma ani ɓaa kɔzɔba ani miini.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Wooi naa ɠɛni ma ʋolu ná velesiɛi: «Nii GALA ge ɠɛɛzu ma ɲadegɛ, mina naa ʋɛtɛ ga kɔzɔba ani.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Naama vai zeini ma ga seizu saʋagɔ, naa ʋoluma, anii naa ɠaaɠaleni ma geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Siɛgi zu Piyɛlɛ ɠoozuʋilini da ga é kulakɛlɛmai naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠwɛɛ, gaamago Kɔlenɛye ná-keelaiti é ti leʋeni, ti gaazaɠagiti boni, ti ʋa kwɛɛ ʋɛ Simon ná-pɛlɛi ná, naati ti loni siɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Ti toligi woni, ta ti ɗa gaazaɠagi wo, ni Simon laazuʋɛ ɠa ná, nii daasei pɛai ga Piyɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Tɛi Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu kulakɛlɛmai ʋoluʋɛ zu, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛni ma: «Wɛlɛ, zunu saʋagɔ ʋaaʋɛ, ti ɗa è ɠaiziɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Wuzeɠe, è yei, mina inɛinɛ, à li ʋɔɔma wa tiye, tɔɔzei nà ɠa gè ti leʋegai.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Piyɛlɛ yeini, é ɠɛ zunui naati ma: «Wɛlɛ nà ʋa, nà ɠa wo gàiziɛzu, lee ɠa é ga wo ʋaa ungi ʋɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Salaʋusu ɠundiɠii daa ga Kɔlenɛye, é ga zunui nii telebogai, ta é luazu GALA ba, nii Zuifuiti pɛ ti tɔɠɔ ʋagɔi wosu, naa ɠa GALA ge ná-geezuɠeela ɲadegai gila teʋegai ma, é ɠɛ, é è loli ná-pɛlɛi wu, nii a kɛ é è woomɛni.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Piyɛlɛ ti lɛɛni pɛlɛi wu, é ti laazuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Poluma zobui é wuzeɠeni, é ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, ti li. Zɔpé ɠidaaleʋe nuiti tanigaa ti ʋilɛni polu, ti maaza. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Poluma voloi, ti zeelini Sezalé. Kɔlenɛye ɠɛni ti ɓɔunsu, é ná-nuiti ta bɔɔla wanawanagiti tolini ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Siɛgi zu Piyɛlɛ lɛɛni la pɛlɛi wu, Kɔlenɛye daaɠomini, é loo kɔɠɔwu, é nɔkɔ bu. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ buzeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe, tɔɔzei nà ɓalaa, nà ga nui ga è ɠɛʋele.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Ti yɛni yɛpɛzu, ti lɛ pɛlɛi wu, ti nu mɔinmɔin kaani, ti ɠaalɛai ba. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo kwɛni ga tɔ ka Zuifuiti ma, ga ti mina ɓɔ faa nɔpɛ ma ta zii ɠiligiti, ɓaa ti ʋa lɛ naati ta-ʋɛlɛ wu. Kɛlɛ GALA ge dɛɛʋɛ ga ze ga maa la nɛɛni, nu ʋa ɠɛ nui tanɔpɛ ma kɔzɔba nu, ɓaa ɲadetala nu. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Naa ɠa é kɛa, siɛgi zu wo keela leʋega da mà, gè ʋa, gè la maaɠaali nɔpɛ kɛɛni su. Kɛlɛ nà wo ɠaazaɠasu, lee ɠa wo tòligai ma?» <verse eid="ACT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Kɔlenɛye ɠɛni ma: «Ma volo naanisiɛi ɠa ga za, niima yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu, gè ɠɛni GALA falizu nà-pɛlɛi wu kpɔkɔ volo yeeɠɛɠalai zaʋasiɛi ma. Zunu ɠila ge ʋaani, é lo kàkala, kɔba zeɠei ɠoleai é ɗa volo, <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>é ɠɛ mà: ‹Kɔlenɛye, ɗa-ƓALA falii ɠaaʋotega, GALA ki ka ɗa-vaaɓɔɠɔiti su. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Keelaiti teʋena ɠaniɠani nɔ Zɔpé, ti Simon loli, nii daasei pɛai ga Piyɛlɛ. Kɔlɔ ɓɛtɛ nui Simon ná-pɛlɛi wu ɠa é ɲiizu ná, kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ.› <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Gaamago nɔ, gè keelaiti teʋe è ma, è laaɠomi fai zu, ɗa ma, è soloogɛ ga è ʋa fala. Ʋɛ niina gi pɛ ka gi GALA gaazu, gi woilo naa ma, nii Maliɠii è leveai ma.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ ná-kpɔɛi é boni Kɔlenɛye ʋɔ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Piyɛlɛ kpɔɛi zeɠeni naazu, é ɠɛ ma: «Gaamazu, gè kwɛɛga niina ga GALA ge la zeelɔzɔɠɔzu ɠɛɛzu nuiti ba, <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>kɛlɛ zii pɛ saama, zɔi nɔpɛ é luazu ba, ta é telebodai ɠɛɛzu, naama nui nɛɛʋɛ bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Wo daawooi ɠwɛni, nii é teʋegai Izilayɛle nuiti ma, é ziilɛi Goo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli ti ma ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele, tama ka é ga ɛsɛ pɛ Maliɠii. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Wo kwɛni nii é ɠɛɛni dɛ Galilé, naa ʋoluma Zudé yooi zu ná pɛ, Zan daazeeliai ma bɛbɛi ma ga ti ɓatizei. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Wo kwɛni ʋelei GALA ge Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yeini la Nazalɛte nui Yesu ma, ta é zɛbɛi ve zea. Wo kwɛni ɓalaa ʋelei Yesu ɠɛni leʋesu da zooi zu, é ɗa faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ, é ɗa naama nuiti pɛ balo, niiti ti ɠɛni Inɛgi ná-zobogi wu, tɔɔzei GALA ge ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Nii kpein é kɛai Zuifuiti ta-yooi zu ta Zeluzalɛme, giya ɠa gi ga naama zeeleiti. Ti kpadɔni saa wului ma, ti paa. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>GALA ge buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya foloi zaʋasiɛi, é zobogi ve zea ga é ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga nuiti. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Kɛlɛ nui pɛ ge la ɠɛni de, kɛni zɔiti niiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeni ga tiye kaite, ga ti ɠɛ ga zeeleiti, gá ya, gɛi gi daamii ta kpɔɔlei woni ʋɔɔma gá tiye, GALA kpegai ma ga buzeɠe, é kula saai ya. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu devei veeni giya ga gi GALA daawooi laazeeli nuɓusɛiti ma, gi zeele wooi wo ga tɔ ɠa GALA ge yeelogai ba, ga é ɠɛ ga nu vuluiti ta gɔvɛiti ta-lukpɔɠaaleʋe nui. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>GALA goo wo nuiti pɛ ta naama zeele wooi wosu ná-faa zu, ga zɔi nɔpɛ a ɠidaaleʋena Yesu ma, naama nui ná-kotoi zuvaa ɠa yɛ ga tɔun daaseigi maaʋele.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yei vai zii ɠiligiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Siɛgi zu Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni dɛ naama wooiti bosu da, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yeini nuiti pɛ ma, niiti ti ɠɛni woilosu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Kidaaleʋe nui niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Zuifuiti ti yɛni Piyɛlɛ ʋolu ti ʋa, ti laavɔɔni ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yei vai zii ɠiligiti ɓalaa ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛni naati goomɛnisu, ti ɗa ɓɔɛ zii woo ɠiligiti su, ti ɗa GALA dɛbi. Piyɛlɛ kpɔɛi zeɠeni ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>«Nu ɠa ɠɛlɛ nɛi naama nuiti kpatizesu ziɛi wu, niiti ti Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔgai ga ade ɠɛʋele ɓaa?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>É devei veeni, ti naati kpatize Yesu Kilista laaseigi zu. Ti maanɛɛnɛni ga é yɛ ti ɠoba foloi tanigaa laawu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ ná-poluvaawogi Zeluzalɛme Egilisii zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Keelaiti ta kidaaleʋe nui niiti ti ɠɛni Zudé yooi zu, ti mɛnini ga zii ɠiligiti ɓalaa, ti yeezeiʋɛ GALA daawooi wu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Siɛgi zu Piyɛlɛ lɛɛni la Zeluzalɛme, kidaaleʋe nui niiti ti ga Zuifuiti ti peelalani, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>«È leʋe ɠale, è liai, è lɛ zii ɠiligiti ta-ʋɛlɛi wu, naa ʋoluma wo laami ʋɔɔma wa tiye.»<verse eid="ACT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Piyɛlɛ tɔɔzeini naazu ga faiti suɠula ti ma ga gilagila, é ɠɛni ti ma: <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>«Gè ɠɛni Zɔpé taazuʋɛ, gè yɛni GALA falizu sùɠili, gè kulakɛlɛmai ta zɔlɔɔni. Ani ta zeɠeni geeɠɔlɔgi zu, eɠɛ seɠe wola toko logai seki naanigɔi pɛ ga, é ɗa yei, eyɛsu é zeeli mà. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Gè suʋɛtɛni ga pagɔ, gè ɠɔɠɔ naani suaiti kaani, ta dɔɓɔ zuaiti, naa ʋɛɛ kpokpo suaiti ta wɔniiti ba. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Gè woo ɠila mɛnini ɓalaa, é ɗa ɠɛ mà: ‹Wuzeɠe, Piyɛlɛ, è ta ʋaa, è mi.› <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Kɛlɛ gè ɠɛni ma: ‹Ɓa-o, Màliɠii, tɔɔzei kaipa kɔzɔba ani ɓaa tɔ ma ani la dɛ lɔɔni dàaʋɛ.› <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Wooi woni mà ʋolu ná velesiɛi zu, é ɠula geezuʋɛ, é ɠɛ mà: ‹Nii GALA ge ɠɛɛzu ma ɲadegɛ, mina naa ʋɛtɛ ga kɔzɔba ani.› <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Naama vai zeini ma ga seizu saʋagɔ, naa ʋoluma, ti pɛ ge ɠaaɠaleni ma geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Gaamago nɔ, zunu saʋagɔ unkulani, ti zeɠe Sezalé, ti ʋa tòlisu, ti loni siɠidaʋɛ, ʋɛ gi ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛni mà, gè ʋilɛ ti ʋolu gi li, gè mina inɛinɛ. Wɛlɛ kɛɛloun lɔzitaiti ba, niiti ti màazani, gi li, gi lɛ Kɔlenɛye ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Naa ɓalaa boni gi ma, ʋelei é kulakɛlɛmai zɔlɔɔni la, geezuɠeelai loni, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Keela leʋe Zɔpé, ti Simon loli, nii daasei pɛai ga Piyɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Toɠa naa lɛ ga ɗe, ʋelei ɗa ɠizo da, wa ɗa-ʋɛlɛ wu nuiti.› <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Siɛgi zu gè kpɔɛzuɠulai lɔɔzeini la, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yeini ti ma, ʋelei é yeini la ade ma mɔungi. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, kìgi looni Maliɠii laawooi nii zu ga: ‹Mazɔlɔɔ Zan ɓatizei woni ga ziɛi, kɛlɛ wɔun, wa ɓatize ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai.› <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Ni tama GALA ge vebɛani ɠilagi naa nɔ vea ti ya, nii feai ada ɓalaa zea, adɛi de ɠidaaleʋeai Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ma, nɔ̀un nà ga leeni, nà li losu GALA daawu?»<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Naama wooi ti yiimaalɛini, ti lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «GALA ge va bu ga zii ɠiligiti ɓalaa ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, nii a kɛ ti zɛnvui zɔlɔɔ!»<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Antiyɔse Egilisii lɔɔzei ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Wɔinzeɠemai ʋaai ma eyɛsu ti Etiyɛni ʋa, kidaaleʋe nui zɔiti ti vazani, naa tanigaa ti zeelini fɔ Fenisi, ta Sipele, naa ʋɛɛ Antiyɔse ʋa, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni GALA daawooi laazeelizu zii ɠili nɔpɛ ma, kɛni Zuifuiti nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ti zaama, nui tanigaa niiti ti zeɠeni Sipele ta Silɛne, ti li Antiyɔse, naati ti ɓɔɛni ɓalaa zii ɠiligiti pɔ, ti Maliɠii Yesu ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli ti ma. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Maliɠii ɠɛni ti ʋa, nu mɔinmɔin ge laani ti-laawooi la, ti ɠaaʋote Maliɠii ma.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Naama wooi zeelini Zeluzalɛme Egilisii zu nuiti ma, ti Ɓalanaɓase leʋeni fɔ Antiyɔse. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Naa zeeliai ma, é pɛtɛni ʋelei GALA ná-zaalai ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu la, koozunɛɛni gola. É kidaaleʋe nuiti iɲɔdɔɔni ga ti ɠɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nu Maliɠii ʋɛ, ta ti ɠili ba ga ti-yiimaʋɛ pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɓalanaɓase ɠɛni ga nu ʋagɔ, nii daavegai ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ta kidaaleʋei. Nu mɔinmɔin ge zɔlɔɔni, ti ɓɔɠɔ ve Maliɠii ya. <verse eid="ACT 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Naa ʋoluma, Ɓalanaɓase liini Taalese, é Sɔle laaɠomi. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>É naa ɠaani ná, ti yɛ ʋolu, ti ʋa Antiyɔse. Ti kona gila kɛɛni miná, ti ɗa gaalɛbai wo ʋɔɔma ta Egilisii, ta ti ɗa nu mɔinmɔin kala. Antiyɔse ɠa kaladopoiti ti-laasei ge ʋɛɛni ná mɔunpa ga keletiɛinti.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, GALA goo wo nuiti ti zeɠeni Zeluzalɛme, ti yei Antiyɔse. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Ti ɠila ge ɠɛni ná, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Agaɓuse. Zɛnvu Ɲadegai loni tuɠɔ, é wuzeɠe, é bo ga pulu wolai ɠa loozu eteai zu ná pɛ. Pului naama ge looni Wɔlɔme masagi Kelode ná-siɛgi zu. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Kaladopoiti ti deveni ti zoloo ma ga nii nɔpɛgi ma zobogi ɛsɛ bɛ, ma nu kɛ ga kpɔbai kidaaleʋe nuiti bɛ, niiti ti Zudé yooi zu. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Naa ɠa ti kɛɛni, ti fe Ɓalanaɓase ta Sɔle ya, naati ti teʋe totuɠɔiti pɔ.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ ɠula vai kasoi ɠa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, masagi Elɔde yeeʋɛɛni Egilisii zu nui tanigaa ma. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>É Zan kɛɛɠɛloin Zake ʋaani ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Tɛi é kaani ga naa wola nɛɛni Zuifuiti bɛ, é Piyɛlɛ ɓalaa soni, fɛti ziɛgi zu, siɛgi zu ta ɗa ɓului mi la, nii lɛʋɛ la su. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>É naa zogai ma, é pili kasoi ɠa, é kalivaani salaʋusu naanigɔ zeizu naanigɔ ma, ga ti ɗa wɛlɛ ma. Ná-kisiɛi ɠɛni ga é naa ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe, siɛgi zu <char style="w" lemma="Pakegi">Pake</char> fɛtii leʋesu da. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Piyɛlɛ makɛga ɠɛni de kasoi ɠa, Egilisi nuiti ti la ɠɛni looɠosu GALA falii ʋa bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Yeei Elɔde deveni la ga geelaa ɠa laona nɔ feya, é naa ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe kɛlɛzu, naama yee ɓidii, Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni laani, é ɗa ɲi salaʋusu felegɔ yɔɠɔzu, giliai ga yɔlɔɠɔ felegɔ, kaso makɛ nuiti ti loni kaso ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Gaamanɔ, Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge ɠulani kɛlɛma, kaso ʋɛlɛi wu ɠalani kpoke, ʋɛ Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ná. Geezuɠeelai yeelooni Piyɛlɛ ɓɛtɛagaʋɛ, é maaloɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe fala!» Yɔlɔɠɔiti ti vieni Piyɛlɛ yeeiti ba, ti loo. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Geezuɠeelai ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-zaamaɠiligi ɠili zaama, è ɗa-zaʋalagiti dɔ ɠɔɠɔa!» Piyɛlɛ naa ɠɛɛni. Geezuɠeelai ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-zeɠe wolai loo ɠɔba, è ʋilɛ pòlu.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠulani kaso ʋɛlɛi wu, é ʋilɛ polu, é la ɠɛni laani da ga nii geezuɠeelai kɛɛzu, ɠite vaa ʋe, é ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu ga kulakɛlɛma nɔ ɠa é kaazu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Siɛgi zu ti leʋeni la kaso makɛ nuiti seizu mɔungi ta felesiɛi ʋa, ti zeelini kɔlu ɓogi ma, nii daalaosu ga taazu ʋelei. Naa laalaoni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ti luɠɔ, ti ɠulani ti ʋilɛ koi yɔɠɔzu ʋelei gila ma, ti ɗa li. Gaamago, geezuɠeelai ɲɛɛlɛni koba.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Piyɛlɛ naama vaiti gaaɠaani niina, é ɠɛ ma: «Gaamazu, gè kwɛɛ niina ga Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai leʋegɛ ga é kùla Elɔde yeezu, ta naa pɛ su, nii Zuifui nuɓusɛiti ki ge ɠɛa ba, é lo nɔ̀un ba.» <verse eid="ACT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>É ɠidaai ma faiti bu, é sakpani Zan nii daasei pɛai ga Maleke naa dee Mali ná-pɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠaalɛɛni ba ná, ti ɗa GALA fali. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Siɛgi zu é siɠigi ma ɓogi laaloɠani la, botiɠɛ anzanui ta ɠɛni ná, daaseigi ga Lɔde, naa maaɓuɠani kpogi ʋa ga é woilo. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>É ɠwɛɛsu ɠaani Piyɛlɛ wooi ʋa, koozunɛ ʋelei ma, é la ɠite siɠigi laalaoni, é ɓizɛni, é li ɠɛɛzu ti ma, Piyɛlɛ ɠa é siɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «È litigɛ!» Kɛlɛ é ti ɠisuɠalani ga gaamai ʋe. Ti ɠɛni ma: «Ná-geezuɠeelai ʋe mu.» <verse eid="ACT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Naazu Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ba nɔ, é ɗa pɛlɛi laaloɠa. Ti pɛlɛi laalaogai ma, ti laavɔɔni ga kaa vai. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>É yee ɠɛɛni ti ma ɓɛɓɛ ga ti maaɠɛ kpɔ, é zɛba é naa zuɠula ti ma, ʋelei Maliɠii kulaai la kasoi ɠa, naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À bo Zake ma ta kidaaleʋe nui zɔiti.» Naa ʋoluma, é liini ga ada ɠili pele.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Poluma zobui, salaʋusuiti ti wola ɠɛni unga wuulee naama vai zu, nii é ɠɛni ga Piyɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Elɔde numaa ʋilɛni ga ti Piyɛlɛ ɠaiziɛ, kɛlɛ ti la kaani. É kaso makɛ nuiti gaazaɠani, é devei ve ga ti naati paa. Naa ʋoluma, é zeɠeni Zudé yooi zu, é li zeizu Sezalé.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masagi Elɔde zaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Kpɔɛi ɠɛni Elɔdeni zɔɠɔzu ta Tiil nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Sidɔn nuiti ba. Naati seizu felegɔ ti zolooni faa ɠila ma, ti ʋoluzeigi ɠɛ ga Ɓalasetuse, masagi ɲii ʋɛlɛi wu lotuɠɔi. Naa ʋoluma ti liini ga ti ziilɛigi maavali masagi ma, tɔɔzei ti-ɠɔnɔgi pɛ ge ɠɛni zeɠezu masagi ná-zooi nɔ zu. <verse eid="ACT 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Naama voloi zeeliai ma, Elɔde ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilini ga masa seɠei, é zei ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, é ɗa masa kpɔɛ wolai wo ti ma. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni maamusɛzu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nu woo la ga nuu, galagi ta woo ʋe de!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Gaamago nɔ, Maliɠii ná-geezuɠeelai gila ge Elɔde loɠani, kpeinti ti kpudɛgi zumiini, é za, mazɔlɔɔ é la ɠɛni lɛbiya veeni GALA bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Kɛlɛ GALA daawooi ɠaa ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalanaɓase ta Sɔle leʋe fai keela ziɛgi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Ɓalanaɓase ta Sɔle ti ɓegai ma ga ta-wotii ɠɛ Zeluzalɛme, ti ɠaleni ma. Ti liizuʋɛ, ti liini ga Zan, nii daasei pɛai ga Maleke.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>GALA goo wo nuiti, ta kalamɔn wolai niiti ka ti ɠɛni Antiyɔse Egilisii zu: Ɓalanaɓase, Simiyɔn nii daaseigi velesiɛi ga ma Lɛigi, Lusiyuse Silɛne nui, Manayɛn nii ta zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Elɔde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Elɔde</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Elɔde Antipase ʋe, nii é ɠɛni ga Galilé you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii.</char></note> ti wɔɔlɔni ʋɔɔma, ta Sɔle. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Yeeta, ti ɠɛai ma Maliɠii lɛbizu ʋɔɔma, ti ɗa zugi zo, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛni ti ma: «À Ɓalanaɓase ta Sɔle ɠula ɓɔɠɔ zaama bɛ̀ yɛ, naama wotii vaa zu, nii gè ti loligai ma.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga zugi zo, ti GALA fali, ti yeelaani ti ma, ti ɓe ti ʋa, ti li.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalanaɓase ta Sɔle ti lii vai Sipele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai Ɓalanaɓase ta Sɔle leʋegai ma, ti liini Selusi, ti lɛ ɓatoi zu miná, ti li Sipele. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Ti zeeliai ma Salamine, ti GALA daawooi laazeelini Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu. Zan-Maleke ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-ɓɔba nui. <verse eid="ACT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Naa ʋoluma, siɛgi zu ti ɓeni la ga ziɛ zaama yooi maaleʋe, ti zeeli Pafɔse. Ti molikula nui ta ɠaani ná, Zuifui ta ɠɛni de, é ga zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nui ta, daaseigi ga Ɓaal-Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>É ɠɛni kundiɠii Sɛlɛziyuse Pɔluse ʋa, zunui naa ɠɛni ga faaɠwɛ nu wola. Naama zunui Ɓalanaɓase ta Sɔle lolini, é dɛɛ ga wɔin ɠa ma ga é GALA daawooi mɛni. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Kɛlɛ molikula nui Elimase (tɔɔzei daaseigi ɠana Gɛlɛke wooi zu), naa ɠɛni ti laalɔɠɔma, é ɠɛni pɔ ga é pele leʋe kundiɠii luɠɔ ga a ʋa ɠidaaleʋe Yesu ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Naazu, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai Sɔle laaveni, nii daaseigi ɓalaa ga Pɔle, naa ɠaazulo ba, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, ɗa ʋe, ɗɛi è laavegai ga keleɠele ɲɔi ma zii pɛ ta yaavai, Inɛgi ná-doun zunui, telebodai pɛ sili nui! È la ɓɔlɔa ɓaa, ga Maliɠii ná-pele zɔlegiti seɠea kɛʋele ma? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Niizu niina, Maliɠii ɠa yeevɔɔɠuzu è ʋa, è ɠaazuɠole, yeeɠɛɠala go laawu è la ɠaazulaa foloi ma.» Gaamago nɔ, kpidii ʋɛɛni Elimase ɠaazuʋɛti ma, é ɗa nuiti gaiziɛ mɛmɛ ga ti pelei lɛɛ la. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Kundiɠii naama vai ɠaai ma, nii kɛai, é ɠidaaleʋeni, mazɔlɔɔ daavɔɔni ga Maliɠii ná-kalagi.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti lii vai Antiyɔse Pisidi ɠoʋii ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Pɔle ta siɛɲɔɠɔiti ti lɛɛni ɓatoi zu Pafɔse, ti li Pɛɛlezé Panfili ɠoʋii ma. Zan-Maleke zeɠeni ti ʋolu, é ɠale ma Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Tɔnɔi, ti zeɠeni Pɛɛlezé, ti li ga luɠɔ, ti zeeli Antiyɔse Pisidi ɠoʋii ma. Dooɠo foloi, ti lɛɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, ti zei. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga GALA ná-tɔgi ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti su wooi tanigaa ɠala, GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠiiti ti nu leʋeni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gi-ɠɛɛleaiti, ni tɛnɛ goo ɠa wo la nuɓusɛiti faa ma, à bona.»<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Pɔle wuzeɠeni naazu, é yee ɠɛ ɓɛɓɛ ga ti maaɠɛ kpɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Izilayɛle nuiti ta wɔigiti wo luazu GALA ba, à woilo gòo ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi niiti ta-ƓALAGI ɠa é yiimazeɠeni ga ade-mɛmɛwolani, é ti ɠaawɔɔlɔ siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni zeini la Ezipete yooi zu. É ti ɠulani ná ʋa ga ná-zɛbɛ wolai. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>É yeezeini ti wu kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ɠɛɠala laawu teʋebai zu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Kpegai ma ga zii lɔfela ɠoloɠolo Kanaan yooi zu, é naati ta-yooi veeni ade-mɛmɛwolani zea ga tɔnɔ, <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>kona unnaanigɔ puulɔɔlugɔ (450) laawu. Naa ʋoluma, é tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti feeni ti ya, eyɛsu é zeeli GALA goo wo nui Samiyɛle ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Naa ʋoluma, wɔin ɠɛni ti ma ga masa ge zei ti unda. GALA ge Kise ná-doun zunui Sayile zeini ti unda kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu, é ɠɛni ga Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodamai zu nui ta. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>GALA kpegai ma ga ɠɛlɛ Sɔle ʋa, é Davide veeni ti ya ga masagi, é niima wooi woni naa ná-faa zu, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè Izayi ná-doun zunui Davide ɠaaʋɛ, zìima nui nii é ʋaazu zìima vaiti pɛ kɛɛzu.› <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Eɠɛʋelei GALA ge minazeɠeni la, Davide naa mavofodai zu ɠa é Yesu ɠulaai ná ga Izilayɛle Ɠizo Nui. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Aisa Yesu ʋa zɔlɔɔ, Zan ɠɛni GALA daawooi laazeelizu Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɛ ma ga ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, ti ɓatize. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Zan ɠɛai ma ná-botii ɠaaɓelasu, é ɠɛni ma: ‹Nà lɛi gè ʋa ɠɛ ga naa, nii wo ɠisiɛzu su. Kɛlɛ taɠili ka ʋaazu nɔ̀un poluma, nii gè la vɔlɔ kula ɠɛɛni su ga gè ʋa ná-saʋalagiti daavie.›<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>«Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo ɠɛni ga Abalaame mavofodai ta, ɓaa wɔiti wo luazu GALA ba, ade ya ɠa kizo kpɔɛi nii leʋegai ade ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Tɔɔzei Zeluzalɛme zei wo nuiti ta ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti la Yesu ná-fai ɠaaɠaani, naa ʋɛɛ GALA goo wo nuiti gooi ʋa, nii é ɠalasu dooɠo foloi pɛ. Ti peelalaai ma, ti GALA goo wo nuiti daawooi naati pilɛni su. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Anɛɛ ni ti la ɠɛni sɔ kaani ba, nii nu a nu ʋaa su, ti ɠɛni Pilate ma, é Yesu ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga naama vaiti pɛ daazeeli, niiti ti zɛʋɛai ná-faa zu, ti kulani saa wului ma, ti da kabai zu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Folo mɔinmɔin daawu, é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga niiti ti yɛni ba, ti zeɠe Galilé, ti li Zeluzalɛme, ti ɠɛai niina ga ná-zeeleiti nuɓusɛiti koba.<verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>«Giya ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa, gá naama Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu wo ma, nii GALA ge ma minazeɠegi woni ade-mɛmɛwolani bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>GALA ge naa laazeelia ade ʋɛ, adɛiti ade ga ti-lointi, ga Yesu wuzeɠe vai, é ɠula saai ya, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi ma wuyei velesiɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‹Ɗa ga dòun zunui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">za, gè è ɠɛa ga dòin.›<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>GALA ge buzeɠe vai, é kula saai ya, é mina mɔ ɠale ma, é ʋa luula, naa ɠa é boni ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‹Nà faa ɲadegaiti kɛ wo ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">niiti ti maa la valiboga pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">nii gè minazeɠeni la Davide ʋɛ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Eza 55:3</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Naa ɠa é kɛai é bogai la ná taɠili ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‹È la vaa bu ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">é ga wooɠɛɠila nui, é ʋa luula kabayeɠei zu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Guy 16:10</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>Tama Davide ɓegai ma ga botii ɠɛ GALA bɛ ná-yeeɠɛɠalai zu, é zaani, ti maaɠuluni mɛmɛwolani koba, é luula. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi GALA ge buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya, naa la luulani.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>«Kɛ̀ɛlointi, à suɠwɛɛ mu ga Yesu maaʋele ɠa kotoi zuvaayɛ fai laazeelizu la wo ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é ɠidaaleʋezu ma, naama nui ná-kotoi zeɠea ba, nii Moize ná-tɔgi la ɠɛni zooga kɛɛzu wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>À dama ga ɓɔɠɔ mu, naa ɠa a kɛ nii bogai GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti su, naa mina zeeli wo ma ga:<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>‹Wɔi wo ga nuɓusɛiti ti laavegai ga maayobalabɛi, à wɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">wo laa ɠa vɔ, wo-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Mazɔlɔɔ nà ʋaazu fai ta ɠɛɛzu wa-yeeɠɛɠalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">naama vai ni nu a la bona wo ma, wo la ɠɛni laa da.› »<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Bɛbɛi ɠɛai ma ɠulazu, ti naati maanɛɛnɛni ga ti ɓɔɛ ʋolu, é ʋilɛ naama vaa ɠilagi nɔ ʋa, dooɠo foloi nii é ʋaazu. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Gaalɛbai ʋoluma, Zuifui ma mɔinmɔin ta zii ɠiligi niiti ti latigai, ti ʋilɛ Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA pelei ma, ti ʋilɛni Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ʋolu. Naati ti ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ, ti ɗa ti iɲɔdɔ ga ti ɠili kpaan GALA ná-zaalai ʋa.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Poluma looɠo foloi, nu ɠa ɠɛ ma, taazuʋɛ nuɓusɛi pɛ ka nɔ é ɠaalɛɛni ba GALA daawooi mɛni fai zu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Zuifuiti ti bɛbɛi ɠaai ma, ti laaveni ga toloi. Nii Pɔle ɠɛni bosu, ti ɗa naa maaɠaali ga woo ɲɔiti. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ ga ladalai, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «Wa ɠa mɔunpa GALA daawooi maa ɠɛa nɛɛni, é wo wo ma. Kɛlɛ tɛi wo ɠɛlɛzu ba, ta wo ɓɔɠɔ levezu ga wo la zolooni ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui ma, naa maaʋele ma, ɓɛ gi ɠaaʋote zii ɠiligiti ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Tɔɔzei naama levei ɠa Maliɠii feai gi ya, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‹Gè è loga, è ɠɛ ga ziiti ta-wozakalagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">è kizo fai ɠula kɛlɛma eyɛsu zou ɓela ga.› »<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Zii ɠiligiti ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma, ti ɠoozunɛɛni gola, ti ɗa Maliɠii lɛbi daawooi vaa zu. Niiti kpein ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ti ma vaa ma, naati ti ɠidaaleʋeni. <verse eid="ACT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Maliɠii laawooi ɠaa ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu naama yooi zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Kɛlɛ Zuifuiti ti lɔɔni tosuba anzanuiti unsu niiti ti latini, ti ʋilɛ Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA pelei ma, ta taazuʋɛ zeizumaanɛgiti, ti wɔinzeɠemai ʋilɛni Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ʋolu, ti naati kpɛ ta-yooi zu. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Naati felegɔ ti ti ɠɔɠɔa vufiligi ɓukpunɛni ti laalɔɠɔma, ti li Ikoniyume. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Kaladopoiti mu, ti laaveni ga koozunɛɛi ta Zɛnvu Ɲadegai.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti ɠɛɛ vai Ikoniyume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti ɠɛai ma Ikoniyume, ti lɛɛni miná ɓalaa Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, ti yɛni ɓɔɛzu ga kɛʋelei ta, Zuifui ma mɔinmɔin ta Gɛlɛkii ma mɔinmɔin ti ɠidaaleʋe. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Kɛlɛ Zuifuiti ti ɠikpaai, naati ti lɔɔni zii ɠiligiti unsu, ti naati daaʋili ga ti faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ga kidaaleʋe nuiti. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti lɛbini Ikoniyume, ti ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ga ladalai, tɔɔzei ti laani Maliɠii la, naama ge ɠɛni ná-zaala wooi ma ɠaamai ɠulazu kɛlɛma ga laavɔɔ vaiti ta maaɓɛlɛ vaiti, nii é ma zobogi veeni ti ʋɛ ga ti ɗa kɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Taazuʋɛ nuɓusɛi ɠaaɠwɛɛni su fele, gilazuʋɛ ɠɛni Zuifuiti polu, gilazuʋɛ ɠɛ keelaiti polu. <verse eid="ACT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Tɛi zii ɠiligiti ta Zuifuiti é ʋɛɛ ta-ɠundiɠiiti ba, ti ɠɛni ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu ga ti Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase maanɔɠɔ, ti ʋa ti zɔɔ ga kɔtuiti, <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>naati ti suɠwɛɛgai ma, ti ʋelani ti li Likaoni ɠoʋii ma: Lisitele, Dɛɛleɓé, ta ti-maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Ti Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini miná.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti ɠɛɛ vai Lisitele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Mɛɠɛlɛ zunui ta ɠɛni zeini Lisitele taazuʋɛ, nii é zɔlɔɔni ga mɛɠɛlɛgi, kaipa é la ɠɛni dɛ zooni é ʋa ziɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>É ɠɛni woilosu Pɔle woo ma. Naa wɛlɛni ba, é ka ga kidaaleʋei ɠa zea ga é ʋalo, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>Pɔle wooɠulani, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe, è lo è-ɠɔɠɔiti ga!» Zunui ʋilini kpulu kɔɠɔiti ga, é tɔɔzei ga é ɗa ziɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Tɛi bɛbɛi naa ɠaani, nii Pɔle ɠɛni kɛɛzu, ti ɠɛni ɓainsu ga woo wola Likaoni wooi zu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Galagiti ti nuɓusɛ ɠɔlɔgi zeɠea, ti yei gi zaama.» <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Ti Ɓalanaɓase laasei pɛɛni ga Zuuse, ti Pɔle laasei pɛɛ ga Ɠɛɛlemɛse, tɔɔzei naa ɠa kpɔɛi ɠɛni da.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛlɛkiiti ta-ɠala pelei ma, Zuuse ɠa é ɠɛni ga galagiti ta-ɠundiɠii, ta Ɠɛɛlemɛse ɠɛ ga galagi naati ta-ɠeelai.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Galagi nii daa ga Zuuse, naama zalaɠa ɠula nui ná-gala pɛlɛi ɠɛni taa loaʋɛ, é ʋaani ga nikɛ zinɛiti ta tufa lɛʋɛlɛʋɛgaiti taa ziɠidaʋɛ. Ta bɛbɛi ti zolooni ma niina ga ti naama aniiti kula ga zalaɠai Ɓalanaɓase ta Pɔle ʋɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Keela felegɔiti ti naa mɛnigai ma, ti ti ɠɔba zeɠeiti balini ga kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, ti ɓizɛ bɛbɛi ʋɔ pelei, ti ɓain ga tiye, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>«Lee vaa zu wo naa ɠɛɛzu? Gá ɓalaa gá nɔ ga nuɓusɛi ga wo ɠɛʋele, gi ʋaaʋɛ Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu wo ma, ga wo ɓeteʋe ɠimalala vai naati ba, wo lati zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ma, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi, ta zooi ta kpoloɗɛi ɓɛtɛa ta ti zu aniiti. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai niiti ti leʋegai, é zii ɠilagilagiti pɛ zɛgɛ ná, ɛsɛ ge ɗa ziɛ ga yiima ʋele. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, é la ɓeni ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu ga tiye ga ná-faaɓɔɠɔiti maaʋele, niiti é ti ɠɛɛzu, tɔɔzei tɔ ɠa é tonai ta ani ɓɛtɛ yeeɠɛɠalaiti teʋesu wo ma, é ɗa ɠɔnɔgi ve wo ya, ta é koozunɛɛi lɔ wo-yiimaʋɛti.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Anɛɛ ɓalaa keelaiti ti naama wooiti boni, kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ga faa ɓaaɓa gola, ti ʋa pele leʋe bɛbɛi luɠɔ ga naati ti mina zalaɠai ɠula ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Naa ʋoluma, Zuifuiti ti zeɠeni Antiyɔse ta Ikoniyume, ti ʋa ti bɛbɛi unsu leʋe. Ti Pɔle zɔɔni ga kɔtuiti, ti kpokpo, ti kula taai ʋa, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu ga é za. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu kaladopoiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba la koba, é wuzeɠeni é lɛ taazuʋɛ, poluma zobui ta Ɓalanaɓase ti liini Dɛɛleɓé.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ti ɠalema vai Antiyɔse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Siɛgi zu Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti ɓeni la ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli Dɛɛleɓé, ti kaladopo mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔni ná, ti ɠaleni ma Lisitele ta Ikoniyume, ti gaaɓela Antiyɔse. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Ti ɠɛni kaladopoiti iɲɔdɔɔzu, ti ɗa ti lɛnɛ ga ti yɛ kidaaleʋei zu, ti ɗa ɠɛ naati ma: «Kɛni ade kpɔlɔ mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ pɛ, ade ʋa lɔ GALA ná-masadai zu.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Ti yeeloni totuɠɔiti ba Egilisii ɠilagilagi pɛ su, ta la ɓena ga GALA fali ti zugi zo, ti ɠɛni naati kalivaazu Maliɠii ma, nii ti ɠidaaleʋeai ma.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Naa ʋoluma, ti leʋeni Pisidi ɠoʋii ma, ti zeeli Panfili. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Ti GALA daawooi laazeelini Pɛɛlezé, naa ʋoluma ti li Atali. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Ti zeɠeai ma miná, ti lɛɛni ɓatoi zu, ti li Antiyɔse, ʋɛ ti ɠalivaani ná GALA ná-zaalai ma, botii naama vaa zu, nii ti ɓeni ga kɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Ti zeeliai ma, ti Egilisii zu nuiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, ti ʋoluvaawo ti ma ga nii pɛ GALA ge kɛai ga ti maaʋele, ta ʋelei naa kidaaleʋei ma ʋɛlɛi laalaogai la zii ɠiligiti tuɠɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Ti ku ɠɛɛni ná fele kaladopoiti saama.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Maaɓɔgi nii é ɠɛɛni Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Zunui tanigaa ti zeɠeni Zudé yooi zu, ti ʋa Antiyɔse, ti ɗa kidaaleʋe nuiti kala, ti ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: «Ni wo la latini pɛlɛʋolu, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la Moize ná-tɔgi zu, wo la zooga ɠizosu.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Naa ɠaaɓelani ga maaɠaali ɓaaɓa golai ti yɔɠɔzu ta Pɔle naa ʋɛɛ Ɓalanaɓase ʋa. Naa ʋoluma, ti deveni ga Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase naa ʋɛɛ taɠiligaa ʋa ti lɛ Zeluzalɛme, ti naama vai yɔɠɔzulɛ ga keelaiti ta Egilisi lotuɠɔiti. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Antiyɔse Egilisii ti leʋeni, ti liini ti leʋe ga Fenisi ta Samali ʋele, ti ɗa naa zuɠula, ʋelei zii ɠiligiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai la. Naama wooiti ti ɠɛni ga koozunɛ vaa wola kidaaleʋe nuiti bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Ti zeeliai ma Zeluzalɛme, Egilisii zu nuiti ti ti laaɠomini ta keelaiti naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ba, ti ʋoluvaawoni naati ma ga nii pɛ GALA ge kɛɛni ga ti maaʋele. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Faliziɛinti saama, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeni, naa tanigaa ti wuzeɠeni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kɛni zii ɠiligiti ti lati pɛlɛʋolu, é ti leve ga ti ɠolo Moize ná-tɔgi ʋɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Keelaiti ta totuɠɔiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti naama vai wuuʋɛtɛ ga pagɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Kpɔɛzuɠula wolai ɓegai ma, Piyɛlɛ wuzeɠeni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo kwɛni ga kaite GALA ge yiimazeɠeni ga ze wo zaama, nii a kɛ gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli zii ɠiligiti ma, ti ɠidaaleʋe. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>GALA nii é nu yiimaʋɛ ɠwɛɛ, naa ɓɔɠɔi ma zeele wooi woga ga é yeezeiɗa ti wu, tɔɔzei é Zɛnvu Ɲadegai vea ti ya ga ade ɠɛʋele, <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>é la zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu ɠɛɛni ade yɔɠɔzu ada tiye, tɔɔzei é ti-yiimaʋɛti ɲadegɛ ga ta-ɠidaaleʋei maaʋele. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Lee vaa zu mu wo GALA suɠɔɠɔsu, ga wo unbawului naa la kaladopoiti kpoɓoɠa, nii ada ade-mɛmɛwolani ade la ziɛni seɠe vai wu? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Kɛlɛ adɔun, Maliɠii Yesu zaalai ɠa ade ɠidaaleʋeai la ga ade ɠizogɛ ga ti ɠɛʋele.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Bɛbɛi pɛ ge maaɠɛni kpɔ, ti woilo Ɓalanaɓase ta Pɔle woo ma, ti ɗa naa zuɠula, ʋelei GALA ge ɠɛni laavɔɔ vaiti ta maaɓɛlɛ vaiti kɛɛzu la ga ti maaʋele zii ɠiligiti saama. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga ɓɔɛ, Zake kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à woilo dɛɛ gòo ma! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Simon naa zuɠulaa ade ma, ʋelei tɔɔzeizu mɔunpa GALA ge yiimazeɠeni la zii ɠiligiti saama ga zii ɠila, nii a ɠɛ ga nɔnɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Naama vai ɓalaa zoloogɛ GALA goo wo nuiti daawooi ma, tɔɔzei sɛʋɛʋɛ ga:<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>‹Naa ʋoluma nà ɠale ma ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Davide ná-pɛlɛi nii goloai, nà gaalɔ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">ʋɛti náti koloɠologai, gè mináti kpɛtɛ ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Nà to ʋolu,<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ti Maliɠii ɠaiziɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">ta zii ɠiligi niiti kpein ti ɠɛai ga nɔ̀nɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Naa ɠa Maliɠii bogai,<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>nii é ná-faazeikpasuiti kulaai kɛlɛma kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amɔ 9:11-12</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Zake ɠɛni mɔnɔ ti ma: «Naa ɠa é ba, nà kaazu ga fizɔgɛ ga ade mina faaɓa kpɛtɛ zii ɠiligiti tuɠɔ, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋezu GALA ma, <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>kɛlɛ ade sɛʋɛi leʋe ti ma ga ti ɓɔɠɔ maaɲɛ ga kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti, koloɠologi, ta ti mina sua mi nii ma ɲama la ʋuuni, naa ʋɛɛ ɲamai ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Tɔɔzei kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ ziɛgiti su, nuiti ta taa ɠilagilagiti su ti ɗa Moize ná-tɔgi ɠala, ta toɠa ɠalasu dooɠo foloiti pɛ GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛʋɛi é leʋeni kidaaleʋe nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, keelaiti ta totuɠɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ Egilisii zu nuiti pɛ ba ti zolooni ma, ga ti nui tanigaa ɠula ɓɔɠɔ zaama, ti ti ʋilɛ Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓaseni polu, ti li Antiyɔse. Ti yeeloni Zude ʋa, nii é lolisu ga Ɓalasaɓase, ta Silase, ti felegɔ ti ɠɛni ga nuiti, niiti unfema wola ɠɛni ti ʋɛ kidaaleʋe nuiti saama. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Ti sɛʋɛi veeni ti ya, nii su wooi ɠɛni ga nii: «Wo-ɠɛɛlointi, ti ga keelaiti ta totuɠɔiti ta wo luʋɔsu, wɔiti wo la ga Zuifua, wo Antiyɔse taazuʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ Siili ta Silisi ɠoʋiiti ba. <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Gi mɛnigɛ ga gi zaama, nui tanigaa ti ʋaaʋɛ wo ʋɔ bɛ, ti wo yiiɓɔlɔ, ti wo ɲiikpi ga ta-ɓɔɛzuɠulai. Gá lɛi gi ʋa naama levei ve ti ya. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Gi pɛ gi zoloogɛ ma ga gi yeelo nua ʋa, gi ti ʋɛɛ gi-nɛɛɲɔɠɔiti Ɓalanaɓase ta Pɔle ʋa, ti ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>niiti ti ɠikula ti-yɛnvuiti su ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista laaseigi vaa zu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Naa ɠa é kɛa, gi Zude ta Silase leʋega wo ma, ga ti ʋa ti niima ɠeela woo laazeeli wo ma ga laawoo. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Nɛɛʋɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ʋɛ, ta gá ɓɔɠɔi gi ʋɛ, ga nu mina kasɔ nɔpɛ da wo unma, kɛni nii maalaasu la ná. <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Naa ɠa é ga, kɛni wo mina ɗa ga suaiti mi, niiti ti ɠulaai ga zalaɠai kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ, ta ɲamai, naa ʋɛɛ suaiti ba ti ma ɲama la ʋuuni, wo ɓɔɠɔ maaɲɛ ɓalaa ga koloɠologi. Wa naati kɛɛna, faa ʋagɔ ʋe wo ʋɛ. Ade ɠaana mɔnɔ!»<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Ti yeeɓeni keelai naati ba, ti li. Ti liini Antiyɔse, ti kidaaleʋe nu ɓɔgi pɛ gaalɛ ba, ti sɛʋɛi ve ti ya. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Sɛʋɛi ɠalagai ma, ti wola ɠoozunɛɛni, tɔɔzei iɲɔdɔɔ wooi ʋa é ɠɛni su. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Tɛi Zude ta Silase ti ɠɛni ga GALA goo wo nuiti, ti lɛbini ɓɔɛzu kidaaleʋe nuiti pɔ, ti ɗa naati tɛnɛ, ta ti ɗa ti iɲɔdɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Ti ku ɠɛɛni ná fele, naa ʋoluma ɠɛɛɠɛlointi ti yeeɓeni ti ʋa ga ziilɛigi, ti ɠale ma naama nuiti pɔ, niiti ti valini ti ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>[Anɛɛ naa ʋe, é nɛɛni Silase ʋɛ ga é yɛ ná.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti yɛni Antiyɔse, naa ʋɛɛ nu mɔinmɔin ba, ti kalagi wo, ta ti ɗa Maliɠii ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Silase lii vai keela ziɛgi velesiɛi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Ku ɠɛɛni fele, naa ʋoluma Pɔle ɠɛni Ɓalanaɓase ma: «De ɠale ma ʋogi zu, de li de kidaaleʋe nuiti ka, ʋɛ pɛ de leʋega ná, de Maliɠi laawooi laazeeli, de ka mini ɠɛɠala ɠa ti ná kidaaleʋei zu.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Ɓalanaɓase ɠɛni pɔ, é Zan ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, nii daasei pɛai ga Maleke, <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>kɛlɛ Pɔle kaani ga é la vizɔni ga ti ʋa naa ʋilɛ ʋolu, nii é zeɠeni ti ʋolu siɛ mɔungi zu Panfili zɔli, é la ɠɛɛni ti ʋa ta-wotii zu. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Naama maaɠaalii ɓaani ti yɔɠɔzu, eyɛsu ti bali ma. Ɓalanaɓase Maleke zeɠeni, ti lɛ ɓatoi zu, ti li Sipele. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Pɔle ma ge yiimazeɠe ga Silase, kidaaleʋe nuiti ti ti ɠalivaani Maliɠii ná-zaalai ma, ti ɗa li. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Ti leʋeni Siili yooi zu ta Silisi, ti ɗa Egilisiiti iɲɔdɔ.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Timɔte ʋilɛ fai Pɔle ta Silase ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Naa ʋoluma, Pɔle zeelini Dɛɛleɓé, ta Lisitele. Kaladopoi ta ɠɛni miná, daaseigi ga Timɔte, dee ɠɛni ga Zuifu anzanui ta kidaaleʋeai Kilista ma, kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni ga Gɛlɛkii ta. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Kidaaleʋe nui niiti ti ɠɛni Lisitele ta Ikoniyume, naati ti ɠɛni zeele woo ʋagɔ wosu, é lo Timɔte ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Wɔin ɠɛni Pɔle ma ga é naa ɠɛ ga ziɛɲɔɠɔ, é naa zeɠeni, ti tati pɛlɛʋolu, tɔɔzei Zuifuiti ta-vai ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛni naama adɛti, mazɔlɔɔ ti pɛ ti ɠɛni kwɛɛni ga kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni ga Gɛlɛkii. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Taai niiti é ɠɛni leʋesu ti zu, é ɠɛni deveiti bosu nuiti ma, niiti keelaiti ta totuɠɔiti ti ti zeɠeni Zeluzalɛme, naa ɠa a kɛ ti ɠolo naama leveiti bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Egilisiiti sɛbɛ ɠɛni lɔɔzu kidaaleʋei zu, ta ɗa ʋɛɛ ti ʋa folo-o-folo.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle loli fai Masedoane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Ti Filizi ta Galate yooi maaleʋeni, tɔɔzei Zɛnvu Ɲadegai pele leʋeni ti luɠɔ ga ti mina wooi laazeeli Azi yooi zu. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Ti zeeliai ma Misi yooi ɠobaʋɛ, ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti li Ɓitini, kɛlɛ Yesu ná-Zɛnvui la ɠɛni vaani bu. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Ti Misi yooi maaleʋeni naazu, ti zeeli Toloase. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Kpidii Pɔle kulakɛlɛmai ta zɔlɔɔni, é Masedoane zunu ɠila kaani loni, naa ɗa maanɛɛnɛ, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Soma kae, è leʋe Masedoane, è ɓɔ gi ʋa!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Pɔle ná-kulakɛlɛmai naa maaʋele ma, gi pele ɠaiziɛni gaamago ga gi li Masedoane, mazɔlɔɔ gi kwɛɛni ga naa maaʋele ga GALA ka gi lolisu ga gi Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli ná.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lidi ɠidaaleʋe vai Filipe taazuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Gi lɛɛni ɓatoi zu Toloase, gi li Samotelase ziɛ zaama yooi ʋɔ pelei, poluma zobui gi li ga Neyapolise ʋele. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Gi zeɠe miná, gi li fɔ Filipe taazuʋɛ, nii é ɠɛni ga Wɔlɔme laai ta, é ɠɛni ga Masedoane ɠoʋi mɔungi ma laai ta. Gi ku felegɔ ɠɛni naama laai zu. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Dooɠo foloi gi ɠulani taai ʋa, gi li ziɛ wolai laaʋɛ, é ɠɛni gi-ɠi su ga gá Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA falizuʋɛ ta ɠaa ná. Tɛi gi zeini, gi ɓɔɛni anzanuiti pɔ, niiti ti ɠaalɛa ɠɛni de ba. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Anzanu ɠila ge ɠɛni ná, nii é ɠɛni ga GALA gaazuluaba nu, daaseigi ga Lidi, é ɠɛni ga seɠe ɓɔi pɔdi nui, ta ná-taazuʋɛ ɠɛni ga Tiyatiil. É ɠɛni woilosu ga pagɔ, Maliɠii ziilaalaoni, nii a kɛ é naati mɛni, nii Pɔle ɠɛni bosu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Tɛi ta ná-pɛlɛ wu nuiti ti ɓatizeni, é gi maanɛɛnɛni, é ɠɛ gi ma: «Ni wo kwɛni ga gè ɠidaaleʋea ga ɠite Maliɠii ma, à soma wo lɛ nà-pɛlɛi wu, wo zei ná.» É ɓɔini gi la gola ga kɛni gi naa ɠɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filipe ɠaso ziɠigi zu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Yeeta, gi ɠɛni liizu GALA falizuʋɛ, duɔ anzanu ɠila ge gi laaɠomini, nii adɔɓɛɛ yɛnvui ɠɛni su, ná-adɔɓɛɛ vaiti maaʋele ma, ná-duɔ kɛɛɠɛiti ti ɠɛni kulanuma wola zɔlɔɔsu. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>É ʋilɛni gi ʋolu, gá-o, Pɔle-o, é ɗa ɓain, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ka ga zunui niiti, ti ʋaaʋɛ kizo pelei lɛɛzu ga woye.» <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>É ɠɛni naa ɠɛɛzu folo mɔinmɔin daawu. Pɔle ɓɔlɔai ma ga naa, é latini, é ɠɛ zɛnvu ɲɔi ma: «Yesu Kilista laaseigi zu, nà è levezu ga è ɠula anzanui nii zu.» Gaamago é ɠulani anzanui zu.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Siɛgi zu ná-duɔ kɛɛɠɛiti ti kaani la ga kito ge la mɔ ti ʋɛ, ti ʋa ani mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ ga maaʋele, ti Pɔle ta Silase zoni, ti naati kpokpo taa zaamaʋɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti pɔ bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Ti naati teʋeni Wɔlɔme nuiti ma, niiti ti ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «Zunui niiti ka ti faa yaɠabagi ʋiliga ada-laai zu. Zuifuiti be, <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>ta kalagi ma zii tanigaa wosu, nii maa la nɛɛni ga adɛi de ga Wɔlɔme nuiti ade ʋa va bu, ɓaa ade ʋa kɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Bɛbɛi ɓalaa wuzeɠeni ti laalɔɠɔma. Tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ti ta-zeɠeiti kulaai ma ti ɠɔba, ti devei veeni ga ti naati doɠa ga kpakui. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga ti loɠa ga kpakɔ ɲɛ mɔinmɔin, ti naati pilini kasoi ɠa, ti kaso makɛ nui leve ga é ɗa wola wɛlɛ ti ma. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Tɛi naama levei veeni kaso makɛ nui ya, é ti ʋilini kaso ʋɛlɛi ɠoozu ʋele nuu, é ti-ɠɔɠɔiti dɔ kpeɠɔi ɠa.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Kua zaamai Pɔle ta Silase ti ɠɛni GALA falizu, ti ɗa GALA dɛbi wuyeiti too, kasoɠa nui zɔiti ti ɠɛni ti woomɛnisu. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Gaamago, zou ɓali wolai ɠɛɛni, é kaso ʋɛlɛi ma wuulaagiti ɲiikpi, kpogiti daalaoni nɔ ʋɔɔma, yɔlɔɠɔiti ti vieni kasoɠa nuiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Kaso ʋɛlɛ makɛ nui wuungai ma, é ka ga kaso ʋɛlɛi ma ɓogiti daalaogɛ, é ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulani ma laɠagi zu, é ɠɛni liizu ɓɔɠɔ ʋaazu niina, tɔɔzei é ɠisiɛni ga kasoɠa nuiti pɛ ti ʋela. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Kɛlɛ Pɔle ɓainni ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: «Mina faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kɛ ga ɓɔɠɔ, gi pɛ gá ʋɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Kaso ʋɛlɛ makɛ nui wozakalagi maalolini, é lɛɛni ga suvilɛ, é ɗa ɓali, é looni Pɔle ta Silase ɠɔɠɔwu, <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>é ɠula ga tiye eteaʋɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Kɛ̀ɛni, nà kɛ ɠale, gè ʋa ɠizo?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Pɔle ta Silase ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɠidaaleʋe Maliɠii Yesu ma, ɗa ɠizo wa ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Ti Maliɠii laawooi woni ma, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ kpidii, kaso ʋɛlɛ makɛ nui liini ga Pɔle ta Silase, é ta-ʋalaiti gaagba, naa ʋoluma ti ɓatizeni gaamanɔ ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>É lɛɛni ga tiye ná-pɛlɛi wu, é daamianigi ve ti ya. Zunui nii ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti pɛ ti ɠoozunɛɛni, ti ɠidaaleʋe vai zu GALA ma.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Sobui, tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ti salaʋusuiti teʋeni kaso ʋɛlɛ makɛ nui ma, ti ɠɛ ma: «Yeeɓe zunui niiti ba, ti li.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Kaso ʋɛlɛ makɛ nui naama wooi laazeelini Pɔle ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ti keela leʋegɛ mà, ti ɠɛ gè wo ʋilɛ, naa maaʋele ma à ɠula, wo li ziilɛigi zu.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Kɛlɛ Pɔle ɠɛni ti ma: «Gɛi gi ga Wɔlɔme nuiti, ti la gá-ʋeelala lɛɛni, ti gi loɠa kɛlɛmaʋɛ, ti gi ʋili kasoi ɠa. Ta pɔ niina ga ti gi ɠula dɔɔɠuzu? Gi la naa ɠɛa pɛ! Kɛni tiya ɓɔɠɔi ti ʋa, ti gi ɠula ti!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Salaʋusuiti ti liini ti naama wooiti bo tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ma. Naati ti wola luani, ti mɛnigai ma ga ta ga Wɔlɔme nuiti. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Ti liini ti pee ve Pɔle ta Silase ʋɛ, ti naati maanɛɛnɛ ga ti ɠula ta-laai ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Pɔle ta Silase ti ɠulaai ma kasoi ɠa, ti lɛɛni Lidi ná-pɛlɛi wu. Ti ɠɛɛɠɛlointi kaai ma, ti naati iɲɔdɔɔni, naa ʋoluma ti ɗa li.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Silase ti lii vai Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Pɔle ta Silase ti leʋeni Anfipoli ta Apoloni, ti zeeli Tesalonike, ʋɛ Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ta ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>É lɛɛni bu, eɠɛʋelei a ɗa kɛɛ la pɔlɔma, dooɠo folo saʋagɔ laawu Pɔle ɠɛni liizu, é ɗa ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ ga GALA Sɛʋɛi zu vaiti. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>É ɠɛni suɠulazu ti ma, é dɛɛ ga tiye ga kɛni Kilista a la ɓɔlɔ, é za, naa ʋoluma é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Yesu nii gè ná-fai wosu wo ma, naa ɠa é ga Kilista.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Tanigaa ti ɠidaaleʋeni ti zaama, ti ʋɛɛ Pɔle ta Silase ʋa, ta Gɛlɛkii ma mɔinmɔin niiti ti ɠɛni luazu GALA ba, naa ʋɛɛ tosuba anzanui ma mɔinmɔin ba.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Kɛlɛ toloi Zuifuiti ziimaʋɛ laaveni, ti nu ɲakai tanigaa zeɠeni bɛbɛi zaama, ti ti ɠaalɛ ba, ti wutugi ʋili taai zu. Ti liini ti Zazɔn ná-pɛlɛ laa ɠale, ti ɗa Pɔle ta Silase ɠaiziɛ ga ti li ga tiye bɛbɛi ʋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Tɛi ti la ɠɛni ti ɠaani, ti Zazɔn ta kidaaleʋe nui tanigaa zoni, ti li ga tiye tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti kakala, ti ɗa ɓain, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Niima zunuiti ka ti eteai pɛ kɛai unga wuulee, tiya ɠa ti ʋaai ʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Zazɔn ɠa é yeezeiɗai ti wu. Ti pɛ ta faiti kɛɛzu masagi Sezaal ná-deveiti daalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛ masa kili ka ná, nii daaseigi ga Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Naama wooiti ti bɛbɛi yiiɠulani ba ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti, <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>naati ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni, ti ʋa yeeɓe Zazɔn ta zɔiti ba, kɛni ti kpɔunma ani ɠulani ti ya pɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Silase ti lii vai Ɓelé</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Kpidii ʋɛɛni nɔ feya, kidaaleʋe nuiti ti Pɔle ta Silase leʋeni Ɓelé. Ti zeeliai ma, ti liini Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Naati koozu ɠisiɛi ʋani, é leʋe Tesalonike Zuifuiti ba, ti yeezeini GALA daawooi wu ga ɠoozunɛ ʋele, folo-o-folo ti ɠɛni GALA sɛʋɛiti fɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛsu, ti pɛtɛ ni, nii ti bogai ti ma gaamai ʋe. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠidaaleʋeni ti zaama, naa ʋoluma Gɛlɛkiiti saama, tosuba anzanuiti ta zunui ma mɔinmɔin ti ɠidaaleʋeni. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Kɛlɛ Tesalonike Zuifuiti ti kwɛɛgai ma ga Pɔle ɠa GALA daawooi laazeelizu Ɓelé, ti ʋaani ná ga ti bɛbɛi ɠaazulɛ, ti wutugi ʋili ti zaama. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Kidaaleʋe nuiti ti Pɔle leʋeni ga kpoloɗɛi laa ʋelei, kɛlɛ Silase ta Timɔte ti yɛni taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Zɔiti ti liini Pɔle maazaasu, ti liini la fɔ Atɛne. Ti ɠalesuʋɛ ma, Pɔle valini ti ma ga Silase ta Timɔte ti li pɔ bɛ fala.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ɠɛɛ vai Atɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Siɛgi zu Pɔle ɠɛni siɛɲɔɠɔiti kpɔunsu da Atɛne, zii ɠɛni ɓɔlɔzu, tɔɔzei é kaani ga taai naa wola laavegɛ ga kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>É ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu Zuifuiti pɔ, GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, ta zii ɠiligiti pɔ, niiti ti ʋilɛgai Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA pelei ma, naa ʋoluma folo-o-folo é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu nuiti pɛ pɔ, niiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ete zaamaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Faaɠwɛ nui tanigaa, niiti ti ga Epikuliɛinti ta Sitoisiɛinti, ti tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɛa pɔ. Tanigaa ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Lee ma ɓɔɛzuɠula ɲaka ɠa zunui nii bosu?» Zɔiti ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ka ga toɠa gala kiligaa ta-vaa laazeelizu.» Tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni Pɔle woomɛnisu, é ɗa Yesu ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, ta buzeɠe vai, é ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Ti li ʋele ɠana la Aleyopaze nuiti kakala, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gá zoo nɛi gi faa ɠwɛɛ ɓaa, é ʋilɛ kala niinɛi naa ʋa, nii è bosu ga giye? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Tɔɔzei gá fai tanigaa mɛnisu è-la, niiti kaipa gi la dɛ ta mɛnini. Tɔ ɠa é ba, gá pɔ gi naati poluɠwɛɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Tama Atɛne nuiti pɛ ta wɛɛinti ti ɠɛni ti zaama, ti ɠɛni ta-yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ kɛɛzu nɔ ga ti ɗa faa niinɛiti bo ɓɔɠɔ ma, ta ti ɗa mɛni.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Pɔle wuzeɠeni naazu Aleyopaze nuiti saama, é ɠɛ ma: «Atɛne nuiti, gè pɛtɛga ga wo pɛ wa ga gala pele ziɛ nu wolaiti, kɛʋelei pɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Tɔɔzei zɛ̀gɛ leʋesu taazuʋɛ, gè ɗa wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ka, eyɛsu gè zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ta ɠa, ʋɛ sɛʋɛai ná ga: ‹Galagi nii nu la kwɛɛ, naa nɔnɔi ɠa.› Nii wo dɛbizu, wo la kwɛɛ, naa ɠa gè ná-fai laazeelizu wo ma. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>GALAGI nii é eteai ta su aniiti pɛ kpɛtɛa, tɛigi é ga geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ti-Maliɠii, seizu la gala pɛlɛi naa wu, nii nuiti ti togai ga yeei. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Kpɛdɛ la ba ɓalaa ga nuiti ti ani ve bɛ, eɠɛ a ʋala ani ta ma zii nɔpɛ ma, tɔɔzei tɔ ɠa é zɛnvui ta zɛnvu viilɛi veezu nuɓusɛiti pɛ zea, naa ʋɛɛ ani mɔtaiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>É etea nuɓusɛi pɛ kpɛtɛʋɛ ga nu ɠila kpegi mavofodai nɔ, nii a kɛ ti zei zooi ɠa ná pɛ. É yeeɠɛɠalaiti teʋeni ba, é nuiti ti zei yooiti kwɛgiti da, <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>nii a kɛ ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu nuiti ti yɛ ɠɛɛzu tiɠili tiɠili ti GALA gaiziɛ ti ka. Tama tɔun maa la ɠoozani de tanɔpɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Tɔɔzei:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‹Tɔun maaʋele zu, zɛnvui ɠa de ya, de ɗa ɲiikpi, ta da vulua.›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Eɠɛʋelei wa-vaa ɠwɛɛ nui tanigaa ti bogai la ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‹Ada ga mavofodaiti.›<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Naa ɠa é ba, tɛi ade ga GALA mavofodaiti, ade mina ɠisiɛ ga GALA kulaʋɛ ga kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti niiti ɲɛɛliɠi ɠɛ nuiti, ti ti ɓɛtɛai ga zanugi, ɓaa walii, ɓaa kɔtui, ga ti ɠoozu ɠeleɠelegiti. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>GALA ge nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠimalala yeeɠɛɠalai naati zɛga ná, kɛlɛ niizu toɠa nuiti pɛ devezu adaʋɛ pɛ ga ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Tɔɔzei é yeeɠɛɠala leʋea ba, siɛgi zu é ʋaazu nuɓusɛi pɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋezu la ga telebodai, zunu ɠila kpegi maaʋele, nii é yiimazeɠeai la, é naama ʋoogi ɠula kɛlɛma ɛsɛ pɛ bɛ ga é naa wuzeɠe, é kula saai ya.»<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma ga gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai saai ya, tanigaa ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulasui ɠɛɛzu la, taɠiligaa ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Gá è woomɛni yee ɠili, é lo naama vaiti ba.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Ʋele ɠana Pɔle ɠulani la ti zaama. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ti zaama tanigaa ti ɠidaaleʋeni, ti ɠili Pɔle ʋa, naati tanigaa ti ɠɛni ga Denise, nii é ɠɛni ga Aleyopaze nui gila, ta anzanu ɠila nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Damalise, ta taɠiligaa.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ɠɛɛ vai Kolɛnte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Naa ʋoluma, Pɔle zeɠeni Atɛne, é li Kolɛnte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>É Zuifu ɠila pɛtɛni ná, daaseigi ga Akilase, é ɠɛni ga Pɔn nu, ta anzai Pilisile ti ʋaani nɔ feya ti zeɠe Itali, tɔɔzei masagi Kelode devei veeni ga Zuifuiti pɛ ti maaɠooza Wɔlɔme ʋa. Pɔle ɠilini ti ʋa, <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>tɛi ɲɛɛliɠi ɠilagi nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ti pɛ ti ya ga seɠe ɠota ɓɛtɛ vai, é yɛni ti ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɗa botii ɠɛ ʋɔɔma. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Dooɠo foloi ɠilagilagi pɛ Pɔle ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti pɔ, GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛni ɠaaɓaazu ga é ti lati.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Siɛgi zu Silase ta Timɔte ti ʋaani la, ti zeɠe Masedoane, Pɔle ɓɔɠɔ veeni GALA daawooi laazeeli vai nɔ ya niina, é ɠɛni dɛɛzu ga Zuifuiti ga Yesu ɠa é ga Kilista. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi Zuifuiti ti ɠɛni maaɠaalizu ga woo ɲɔiti, é ná-seɠeiti suɓukpunɛni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo-ma ɲamai ɠa la niina wo unma, wa-vaa nɔpɛ ge la mɔ nɔ̀un unma, ɓɛ niina gè ɠaaʋote zii ɠiligiti ma.» <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>É zeɠeni miná, é li zunui ta ná-pɛlɛi wu, nii é ɠɛni ga GALA gaazuluaba nu, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Titiyuse Zusetuse, ná-pɛlɛi ɠɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii, nii daa ɠɛni ga Kilisepuse, naa ɠidaaleʋeni Maliɠii ma, ta ná-pɛlɛ wu nuiti pɛ. Kolɛnte nui ma mɔinmɔin ɓalaa, niiti ti ɠɛni Pɔle woomɛnisu, ti ɠidaaleʋeni, ti ɓatizei zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Yeeta kpidii, Maliɠii ɠɛni Pɔle ma kulakɛlɛmai zu: «Mina lua pɛ, ɓɔɛ mina maaɠɛ kpɔ, <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>tɔɔzei nɔ̀un nà è ʋa, nu nɔpɛ ge la vɔɔɠua è ʋa, é ʋa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ga ɗe, mazɔlɔɔ nà-nuɓusɛi wola mɔinʋɛ taai nii zu.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Pɔle kɛɛni Kolɛnte ga kona gila ta tukpɛ (1,5), é ɗa nuiti kala ga GALA daawooi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Siɛgi zu Galiyɔn ɠɛni la ga Akayi masagi, Zuifuiti pɛ ti zolooni faa ɠila ma, ti wuzeɠe Pɔle laalɔɠɔma, ti liini la tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «Zunui nii ɠa é nuiti tatisu, é GALA dɛbi ʋelei taɠili dɛɛzu ga nuiti, nii é la zolooni tɔgi ma.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Pɔle ɠɛnina ɠɛɛzu é ɓɔɛ, eyɛsu Galiyɔn kpɔɛi zeɠe, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Zuifuiti! É ga é ɠɛni ga telebotala va ɓaa faa ɲɔu va, nà la woilo wo-woo ma, ʋelei maanɛai é ɠɛ la, <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>kɛlɛ tɛi é ga maaɠaali nɔ, é ʋilɛ wooiti ta daaseigiti ba, naa ʋɛɛ wo ɓɔɠɔ lɔgiti ba, wa-vaa ɠana. Gè la pɔ ga gè ɠɛ ga naama lukpɔɠaaleʋe nu.» <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>É ti ɓɛɛni, ti zeɠe tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Ti pɛ ti Sosɛtɛne zoni naazu, nii é ɠɛni ga GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii, ti ɗa doɠa tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ ɠakala. Kɛlɛ Galiyɔn maavaa la ɠɛni naa zu.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ɠale fai ma ʋolu Antiyɔse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Pɔle ku ɠɛɛni fele Kolɛnte, naa ʋoluma é valini kidaaleʋe nuiti ma, é lɛ ɓatoi zu, dii vai zu Siili ʋele, ta Pilisile naa ʋɛɛ Akilase ʋa. Aisa é ʋa zeɠe ná, é nɔungi ɓuyeni ma ɓato losuʋɛ Sankelé, tɔɔzei é minazeɠe kɛɛni. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Siɛgi zu ti zeelini la Efɛze, Pɔle siɛɲɔɠɔiti zɛni miná. É lɛɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɗa ɓɔɛ Zuifuiti pɔ, <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>naati ti maanɛɛnɛni ga é yeeɠɛɠala go ɠɛ ti ʋa, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni vaani naa wu. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, seɠezuʋɛ ná, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Ni GALA ka vaana bu, nà dɛ ɠalesu ma wo ʋɔ bɛ.» É lɛɛni ɓatoi zu Efɛze. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>É ɠulani ɓatoi zu Sezalé, é zeɠe miná é lɛ Zeluzalɛme, é laali Egilisii zu nuiti ma, naa ʋoluma é yeini Antiyɔse.<verse eid="ACT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle lii vai keela ziɛgi zaʋasiɛi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>É ku ɠɛai ma fele miná, é ɠaleni ma ʋolu, é ɗa leʋeteʋe Galate ta Filizi yooiti su, é ɗa kaladopoiti iɲɔdɔ.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Zuifui ta ʋaani Efɛze, é ɠɛni ga Alɛgezandili nu, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Apolɔse. Zunui naa ɠɛni ga kpɔɛzuɠula nu wola, kalagai gola GALA Sɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>É ɠalani ga Maliɠii ná-pelei ma vai, zɛbɛi ɠɛni ba, é ɗa nuiti kala ga Yesu ná-faiti ga gaamai, kɛlɛ Zan ná-ɓatizei nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni kwɛɛni. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>É tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɛa ga ladalai GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, kɛlɛ siɛgi zu Pilisile ta Akilase ti goomɛnini da, ti seɠeni ti maaɓuɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ti GALA ná-pelei lɛɛ la ga pagɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Tɛi é deveni ga é li ga Akayi ʋele, kidaaleʋe nuiti ti iɲɔdɔɔni. Ti sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni kaladopoiti ma ga naati ti yeezei bu ga pagɔ. Seeliai ma miná, é ɠɛni ga kpɔba nu wola naati bɛ, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeni GALA ná-zaalai zaɓui zu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Tɔɔzei é ɠɛni Zuifuiti ta-ɓɔɛiti polulaazu nɔ kpaun kɛlɛi zu, é ɗa dɛɛ ga tiye GALA sɛʋɛiti su ga Yesu ɠa é ga Kilista.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle zeeli vai Efɛze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Siɛgi zu Apolɔse ɠɛni la Kolɛnte, Pɔle leʋeni ga maazu ʋele yooi zu ʋele, é zeeli Efɛze. É kaladopoi tanigaa ɠaani ná, <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>é ti ɠaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Siɛgi zu wo ɠidaaleʋea la, wo Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔni?» Kɛlɛ naati ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Tɔun kaipa gi la dɛ vɔlɔ mɛnini ga Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠa ná.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Ɓatizei ma ɓɛgele ɠa mu wo sɔlɔɔgai?» Ti ɠɛ ma: «Zan ná-ɓatizei.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Pɔle kpɔɛi zeɠeni ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓatizei nii Zan ɠɛni kɛɛzu, naa ɠɛni ga nuiti siɛ ʋelei maavalibo fai, é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu nuiti ma, ti ɠidaaleʋe naama nui ma, nii é ʋaazu tɔun poluma, naa ɠa é ga Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma, ti ɓatizei zɔlɔɔni Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi zu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Pɔle yeelaai ma ti ma, ti Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔ, ti tɔɔzei ga ɓɔɛa zii woo ɠiligiti su, ta ti ɗa GALA gooi wo. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠɛɠala.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɛnɛgi Pɔle boni Efɛze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Pɔle ɠɛni lɛɛzu GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu alu saʋagɔ laawu, é ɗa ɓɔɛ ladalai zu Zuifuiti pɔ ga GALA ná-masadai ma vai, é ɠɛni ɠaaɓaazu ga é naati tati, niiti é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi tanigaa ti ɠigi ɓaani, ti la kɛɛni, ti ʋa valibo, tɔun ti ɗa kpɔɛ ɲɔiti bo kidaaleʋe ʋele niinɛi ma, bɛbɛi ɠaazu, Pɔle zeɠeni ti ɠoba. É ɠɛni liizu ga kaladopoiti, folo-o-folo é ɗa ti ɠala Tilanuse ná-kala bosuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>É yɛni naa ɠɛɛzu, eyɛsu é ɠɛ ga kona felegɔ, naa maaʋele ma nuiti kpein ti ɠɛni zeini Azi yooi zu, Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti, ti pɛ ti Maliɠii laawooi mɛnini.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seva ná-doun zunu lɔfelaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>GALA ge ɠɛni laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu ga Pɔle maaʋele, niiti ti la ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu pɔlɔma. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Eyɛsu ti ɗa Pɔle ná-maaɓale seɠeiti ɓaa ná-seɠe maazu zeɠeiti pɛɛ seeɓɛ nuiti ma, ti ɗa ɠɛdɛ, zɛnvu ɲɔiti ti ɗa ɠula ti zu. <verse eid="ACT 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Zuifui tanigaa niiti ti ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu ga ti ɗa inɛgiti kpɛ nuiti su, ti suɠɔɠɔni ga ti ɗa Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi wo naama nuiti ma, niiti zɛnvu ɲɔiti ti ɠɛni ti zu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nà wo levezu Yesu laaseigi zu, nii Pɔle ná-fai laazeelizu!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni niima vaiti kɛɛzu, ti ɠɛni ga Seva ná-doun zunu lɔfelaiti, nii é ɠɛni ga Zuifuiti ta-zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠii gila. <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Zɛnvu ɲɔi ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè Yesu ɠwɛni, gè kwɛni ɓalaa zɔi é ga Pɔle, kɛlɛ wɔun, wa ga ɓɛɛni?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Gaamanɔ, zunui nii zɛnvu ɲɔi ɠɛni su, naa valani ti ʋa, é vɔni ti ma, é ti loɠa ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ, eyɛsu ti ʋela ga ti maaɲakaiti, ti maawanaai. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge naama vai ɠwɛɛni, Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti niiti ti ɠɛni ɲii wosu Efɛze taazuʋɛ, dualuagi lɔɔni ti pɛ su, naa ɠɛni ga zaɓu Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi lɛbiya zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Zɔiti pɛ ti ɠidaaleʋeni, naati ma mɔinmɔin ti ɠɛni ʋaazu, ti ɗa laa zɔ ga ga nii pɛ ti kɛai. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Niiti pɛ ti molikula faiti kɛɛni, naati ti ʋaani ga ta-zɛʋɛiti, ti gala ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu. Ti naama zɔngɔi ɠaaluni, é ɠɛ ga wali ɠae waaʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50.000).<verse eid="ACT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Ʋele ɠana Maliɠii laawooi wo fai zu ɠɛni wɔɔlɔzu la ga gaaɓaai, Maliɠii ɓɔɠɔi ná-zɛbɛi zaɓui zu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wutugi é leʋeni Efɛze ta Pɔle zeɠe vai ná</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Naama vaiti kpegai ma, Pɔle deveni ga é li Zeluzalɛme, é leʋe ga Masedoane ta Akayi ʋele. É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Siɛgi zu gè zeelizu la Zeluzalɛme, kɛni ɓalaa gè ɠaazula Wɔlɔme ma.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>É ná-kpɔba nu felegɔ leʋeni Masedoane, Timɔte ta Elasete, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é yɛni dɛ Azi yooi zu.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Naama yeeɠɛɠalai zu ɠa kpɔɛ wolai leʋeni la, é lo kidaaleʋe ʋele niinɛi ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Zanu kpɛtɛ nui ta ɠɛni ná, daaseigi ga Demetiliyuse, é ɠɛni anzanu ɠalagi Aaletemise ná-pɛlɛi maaniini koiti kpɛtɛzu ga wali ɠolegi, é ɠɛni naavolo wola ɠaalɛɛzu ba kɔɔɠɔ gani naama ɲɛɛliɠi ɠɛ nuiti bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>É naati gaalɛɛni ba ta zɔi niiti ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛliɠi ɠilagi ɠɛɛzu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo pɛ wo kwɛni ga ada-ɠulanumai ɠa niima wotii nɔ zu, <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>kɛlɛ wa mɛnisu ta wa pɛtɛsu nii Pɔle kɛɛzu, Efɛze taazuʋɛ ta Azi yooi zu ná pɛ, é nu mɔinmɔin tatiga, é ɗa ɠɛ ti ma, galagi niiti pɛ nuiti ti kpɛtɛai ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, naa tanɔpɛ ge la ga gala. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Naama vai ɠa ʋaazu ɓaaɠulazu ada-wotii ma, é bɛlɛɠula anzanu ɠala golai Aaletemise ná-pɛlɛi ʋa, naa ʋoluma toɠa ʋala lɛbiya wolai ma, nii é zea, tɛigi nuiti ti nɔkɔsu bɛ Azi yooi zu ta eteai pɛ su.»<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Naama wooiti mɛnigai ma ti ʋɛ, ti wola yiiɠaawanani, ti ɗa ɓain, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Efɛze nuiti ta-ɠalagi Aaletemise wɔɔlɔʋɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Taai zu ná pɛ ge ɠɛni nɔ wuulee, ti pɛ ti liini ʋɔɔma ga kpizɛi naama adaʋɛ, ná ga maaɓɔ bosuʋɛ, ti li ga Pɔle ziɛɲɔɠɔ felegɔiti Masedoane nuiti Gaiyuse ta Alisitaake. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Pɔle ɠɛni pɔ é ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga bɛbɛi, kɛlɛ kaladopoiti ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Azi nu wolaiti tanigaa vɔlɔ, niiti ti ɠɛni ga bɔɔlaiti, naati ti wooleʋeni ma, ti tɛnɛni ga é mina li maaɓɔ bosuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni ɓainsu ga ʋelei é pɔ la, tɔɔzei faa wuuleegi wola wɔɔlɔni bɛbɛi zaama, nui bɔɔlɔzu ti la vɔlɔ ɠɛni kwɛɛni lee vaa zu ti ɠaalɛai ba. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Nui tanigaa ti ma vai zuɠulani Alɛgezandele ma, nii Zuifuiti ti ɠɛni daaʋilisu ʋelelaʋɛ. Alɛgezandele yee ɠɛɛni ti ma ɓɛɓɛ, é ɠɛni pɔ ga é goozuɠula bo bɛbɛi ɠaazu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Kɛlɛ ti kwɛɛgai ma ga toɠa ga Zuifui ta, ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ɓainsu lɛlɛ felegɔ laawu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Efɛze nuiti ta-ɠalagi Aaletemise wɔɔlɔʋɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Gaaɓelagi zu, taa zɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui zooni é bɛbɛi ɠaaɓɛ, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Efɛze nuiti, ɓɛ ɠa é la kwɛɛ ga Efɛze taai ɠa ga Aaletemise wolai ná-pɛlɛi makɛsuʋɛ, ta maaniinigi nii é ɠulani geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é loo? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Tɛi nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga zeɠezu naa ɠa, wo maanɛɛʋɛ wo maaɠɛ kpɔ, wo mina kazemazu vaa nɔpɛ kɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Tɔɔzei wo ʋa ga zunui niiti, tama ti la faa ɠoloɠoloni gala pɛlɛi ma, ti la woo ɲɔu woni ada-anzanu ɠalagi ma. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Ni nui tanɔpɛ sɔ ka Demetiliyuse ʋɛ ta ná-ɲɛɛliɠi ɠɛɛɲɔɠɔiti bɛ, tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloiti ta ná, tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta ná, ti ʋa ti ta-ɓaazaɠai la. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Kɛlɛ ni faa ɠiligaa ta wo ɠisu, naati gaaɠa ɠula ba gaalɛba ɠitei zu. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Zaa vai nii teʋegai, ni ade la daani ma, toɠa la ade unma, ti ade ʋeelala, eɠɛ ada ɠɛ ga gaazulɛɛ ʋea, tɔɔzei gi woozuɠulasu nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii a ɠɛ ga kpɔgi nii ma ungi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:40">Siɛgi zu é ɓeni la ga naama wooiti bo, é bɛbɛi ɠaaɠaleni ma.<verse eid="ACT 19:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle lii vai Toloase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Siɛgi zu zɔngɔi ɓeni la, Pɔle kaladopoiti tolini, é ti lɛnɛ. Naa ʋoluma é valini ti ma, é pele zo, é ɗa li ga Masedoane ʋele. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>É naama yooi zu ziɛni, é ɗa tɛnɛ mɔinmɔin bo ga kidaaleʋe nuiti. Naa ʋoluma é liini Gɛlɛki yooi zu, <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>é yɛni miná alu saʋagɔ laawu. É ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni niina ga é lɛ ɓatoi zu, é li Siili, eyɛsu é faa ɠwɛɛsu ga Zuifuiti ti yaavai ɠiliʋɛ ma. Naa maaʋele ma, é deveni ga é ɠale ma Masedoane ʋele. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Siɛɲɔɠɔiti daaseigiti kaa: Ɓelé nui Piiluse ná-doun zunui Sopatɛɛl, Tesalonike nu felegɔi Alisitaake ta Sekɔnduse, naa ʋɛɛ Dɛɛleɓé nui Gaiyuse ʋa, ta Timɔte, naa ʋoluma Azi nuiti Tisike ta Tolofime. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Naati ti toni da gi luɠɔ, ti li ti ɗa gi ɓɔun Toloase. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Gɔnɔi, siɛgi zu ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su naama vɛti voloiti ti ɓeni la, gi lɛɛni ɓatoi zu Filipe taazuʋɛ, gi kɛ ga folo lɔɔlugɔ ziɛi ɠa, gi li gi ti ɠa Toloase, gi kɛ miná ga dɔɔɠɔ ɠila.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etikuse wuzeɠe vai, <optbreak/> é ɠula saai ya Toloase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Dɔɔɠɔi ma volo mɔungi, gi ɠaalɛa ɠɛni de ba ga gi ɓului ɠaaɠwɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa. Tɛi Pɔle maanɛɛni ga é li poluma zobui, é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu gaalɛbai zu nuiti pɔ, é ná-kpɔɛi zuɠoozani, eyɛsu kua zaamai zeeli. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Lanboi wola mɔinni geezu ʋɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ gi ɠɛni ná gaalɛbai zu. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Zunu loungoi ta ɠɛni zeini fenɛtɛlɛi laaʋɛ, daaseigi ga Etikuse, tɛi Pɔle ɠɛni ná-kpɔɛi wola zuɠoozazu, ɲiimɛnii leʋeni la ga gola, é ɠula geezu ʋɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi zu, é loo zooi ma. Ti buzeɠeni, kɛlɛ é zaani niina. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu Pɔle ʋilɛni da, é maaʋɛɛni zunu loungoi ma, é seɠe é da yeezu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À mina yiizoolɛ, toɠa vulua!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Pɔle lɛai ma ʋolu geezu ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɓului ɠaleɠaleni, é daamii wo. Naa ʋoluma, é yɛni kpɔɛzuɠulai ɠa eyɛsu wozai seɠe ma, é zɛba é ɗa li. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Ti ʋaani ga zunu loungoi, é vulua, naa ɠɛni ga ɛsɛ pɛ iɲɔdɔɔ va.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle lii vai Milɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Gɔun, gi toni da Pɔle luɠɔ ɓatoi zu, gi li Asɔse, miná ɠa maanɛɛni ga gi Pɔle zeɠe ná, eɠɛʋelei tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é deveni la, mazɔlɔɔ kɛni a la leʋe ga siɛ kɔɠɔa ʋelei. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Seeliai ma gi ma Asɔse, gi seɠeni ɓatoi zu, gi li Mitilɛne. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Gi zeɠe miná, gi yɛ kpoloɗɛi ɠa poluma zobui, gi zeeli Siyo. Naa ʋolu voloi, gi zeeli Samɔse, naa ʋoluma voloi gi leɠa zeeli Milɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Pɔle deveni ga é leʋe Efɛze ɠoba, naa ɠa a kɛ é mina ɓɔɠɔ ma volo li Azi yooi zu, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni zuvilɛzu ga é li Zeluzalɛme, ni a la zoo ɠɛɛzu ná Pantekote voloi.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-falima wooiti Efɛze lotuɠɔiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Kɛlɛ Pɔle yɛni Milɛ, é keela leʋe Egilisi lotuɠɔiti tuɠɔ Efɛze ga ti ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Siɛgi zu naati ti ʋaani la pɔ bɛ, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Yeeɠɛɠalai kpein ge kɛa wo ʋa, wa ɓɔɠɔi wo kwɛni ʋelei gè ɠɛa ziɛzu la, é lɔɔzei folo mɔungi ma, yee gè ʋilɛni la Azi yooi ma. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Gè botii ɠɛɛʋɛ Maliɠii ʋɛ ɓɔɠɔmaayeii zu naa ʋɛɛ gɔlɔi ʋa, ta kpɔlɔiti, niiti ti ɠɛni zeizu mà Zuifuiti ta-yaavaiti maaʋele ma. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Wo kwɛni ɓalaa ga gè la faa nɔpɛ dɔɔɠuni wo ʋa, kɛlɛ gè naa pɛ daazeelini wo ma, ta gè wo ɠala kɛlɛi zu, ta wa-ʋɛlɛiti bu ga nii kpein soloogai wo ma. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Gè ɠɛni Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti tolisu yeenɔpɛ ga ti ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, é ʋilɛ GALA ba, ta ti ɠidaaleʋe ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ma.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>«Niima ziɛgi zu nà ɠa gè liizu Zeluzalɛme, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa é ɠɛ, kɛni gè li. Nɔ̀un, gè la kwɛni nii é kpɔ̀unsu ná. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Kɛlɛ taai kpein gè leʋesu su, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa dɛɛzu ga ze, é bo mà ga kasoi ta maanɔɠɔiti ta kpɔ̀unsu. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un zɛnvui la gàazu ga ani nɔpɛ, gè la pɛtɛsu ga sɔɓelama ani nɔpɛ, nii mà yiizoolɛi ma, naa ɠa ga gè kpizɛi ɠaaɓela ta botii, nii gè sɔlɔɔgai Maliɠii Yesu ya, nii é ga gè GALA ná-zaalai ma Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>«Gè kwɛni niina ga wɔi kpein gè ɠɛa leʋesu wo zaama, ga GALA ná-masadai ma wooi laazeelia wo ma, wo tanɔpɛ ge la mɔ nɔ̀un pɛtɛga. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma za ga: Wo tanɔpɛ ma ɲamai ma ɠoto la bà. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Tɔɔzei gè la GALA ziima vai tanɔpɛ dɔɔɠuni wo ʋa, gè ti pɛ dɛɛʋɛ ga woye. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à makɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, ta GALA ná-baala kpulugi pɛ ma, nii Zɛnvu Ɲadegai wo zeiɗai unda ga wo makɛ. À ɠaaɓa GALA ná-Egilisii ma, nii é geyaai ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-Doun zunui ma ɲamai. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Gè kwɛni ga siɛgi zu gè liizu la, zuluɓu vilɛiti ta lɔ wo zaama, ti la GALA ná-baala kpulugi maawɔinɠaa. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Wa ɓɔɠɔi wo zaama, nui tanigaa ta wuzeɠezu, ti ɗa zɛɛ ɓɔɛiti bo, nii a kɛ ti kaladopoiti tati ga ti ʋɔ pelei. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>À wɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma mu, wo ɠizɛ su ga kona saʋagɔ laawu, gè la ɓɔlɔni folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa ga wo ɠilagilagi pɛ tɛnɛga yeeta vɔlɔ ga gɔlɔi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>«Niizu, nà wo veezu GALA ta ná-zaalai ma wooi ya. Zobogi ɠa GALA bɛ ga é wo wɔɔlɔ kidaaleʋei zu, ta é tuyai loo wo ʋɛ, nii é makɛgai nu ɲadegaiti pɛ bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Gàazu la ɠulani nu nɔpɛ ná-wali ɓaa zanu, ɓaa nu ná-seɠea ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>À wɛlɛ zèeiti ba, wa ɓɔɠɔi wo kwɛni ga niiti ka ti màavaiti gaaɠulaai ba, ta zɔiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛa pòlu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Gè dɛɛʋɛ ga woye kɛʋelei pɛ su ga ʋele ɠana wo maanɛai wo botii ɠɛ la, nii wo ɓɔsu da zɛbɛsulala nuiti ba, wo ɠizɛ ɓalaa Maliɠii Yesu ɓɔɠɔi wooi zu, nii é boni ga: ‹Undaanɛɛ ɠa faanɛɛ ɠɛ nui ʋɛ, é leʋe naa ʋa, nii é sɔlɔɔsu.› »<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Siɛgi zu é ɓeni la ga naama wooiti bo, é ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa ga ti GALA fali ʋɔɔma. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Ti pɛ ti veleveleni Pɔle ɠɔbu, ti ɗa wola wɔlɔ, ti ɗa nɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Pɔle wooi é boni ti ma ga: «Wo la mɔ gàazuʋɛ ʋɛtɛga,» naa ɠa é ti wola yiizoolɛni. Ti liini ti pu ga pele ɓatoi ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle lɛɛ vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Gi zeɠeai ma ti ɠoba, gi lɛɛni ɓatoi zu, gi sakpa Kɔse, naa ʋoluma voloi gi zeeli Lɔde, gi zeɠe miná gi li Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Tɛi gi ɓatoi ta ɠaani miná, é ɗa kpoloɗɛi maaleʋe ga Fenisi ʋele, gi lɛɛni su, gi ɗa li. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Gi zeeliai ma Sipele ɠobaʋɛ, gi zɛni ga ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, gi li ga Siili ʋele. Gi loni Tiil, tɔɔzei miná ɠa ɓatoi maanɛɛni ga é laayei ná ná-kasɔi wu. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Gi kaladopoiti kaani miná, gi yɛni ti ɠoba dɔɔɠɔ ɠila daawu. Zɛnvu Ɲadegai puuni naati ziima ga ti Pɔle lɛnɛ ga é mina lɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Kɛlɛ naama voloiti teʋegai ma, gi pele zoni, ti pɛ ti gi ʋuuni ga pele, ta ti-anzaiti é ʋɛɛ ti-lointi ba, eyɛsu gi ɠula taai ʋa, gi ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ ga gi GALA fali. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Naa ʋoluma, gi valini ɓɔɠɔ ma ga tiye, gɔun gi lɛ ɓatoi zu, tiya ma, ti ɠale ma ta-laazu.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Gi kpoloɗɛ ɠa ziɛi ɠaaɓelani ga gi zeɠe Tiil gi li Petolemayise, gi laali kidaaleʋe nuiti ma miná, gi folo ɠila kɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Gi zeɠe ná poluma voloi, gi zeelini Sezalé. Gi lɛɛni Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔ laazeeli nui Filipe ná-pɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛni ga nu lɔfelaiti gila, niiti zeelobai woni ga tiye. Gi yɛni ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Anzalopo naanigɔ ɠɛni zea, ti la dɛ zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ, naati ti ɠɛni GALA gooi wosu.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Tɛi gi ku ɠɛɛni ná fele, GALA goo wo nui ta zeɠeni Zudé yooi zu, é yei, daaseigi ga Agaɓuse. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>É ʋaani gi ʋɔ bɛ, é Pɔle ná-saamaɠiligi zeɠe, é ɠɔɠɔiti ta zeeiti suɠili, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠɛ: ‹Zunui nii nɔnɔ ga saamaɠiligi nii, ʋele ɠa Zuifuiti ti ʋaazu gilizu la Zeluzalɛme, ti fe zii ɠiligiti zea.› » <verse eid="ACT 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Gi naama wooi mɛnigai ma ga taai naa zu nuiti, gi Pɔle maanɛɛnɛni ga é mina lɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Kɛlɛ Pɔle gi wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠana wo kɛɛzu, wo ɗa wɔlɔ, wo ɗa zìi ɠoloɠolo? Nɔ̀un, kɛ̀ʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ gìli vai nɔ laade, kɛlɛ gè za ɓalaa Zeluzalɛme Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi ʋɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Tɛi gi la ɠɛni zoosu gi ʋa ná-kisiɛi lati, gi la mɔ ɠɛni daani kpaangbali, gi ɠɛni ma nɔ: «Maliɠii yiimai zoo, é ɠɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Naama voloiti teʋegai ma, gi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni, gi lɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Kaladopoi tanigaa ti zeɠeni Sezalé, ti ʋilɛ gi ʋolu, ti li ti gi laazuʋɛɛ Sipele nui ta ná-pɛlɛi wu, daaseigi ga Menasɔn, zunui naa ɠɛni ga kidaaleʋe nu wɔlɔma.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Zake ti ɠomi fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Siɛgi zu gi zeelini la Zeluzalɛme, kidaaleʋe nuiti ti gi laaɠomini ga koozunɛɛi. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Poluma voloi, Pɔle ʋɛɛni gi ʋa, gi li Zake ʋɔ bɛ, totuɠɔiti gaalɛa ɠɛni de ba ɓalaa ná. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Pɔle ti luʋɔni, naa ʋoluma é tɔɔzei ga naa zuɠulaa ti ma ga gilagila, nii GALA ge kɛai zii ɠiligiti saama ga ná-botii maaʋele. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga goomɛni, ti lɛbiyai veeni GALA bɛ. Naa ʋoluma, ti ɠɛni ma: «Kɛ̀ɛloun, è pɛtɛga, nu waa mɔinmɔin ge ɠidaaleʋea Zuifuiti saama, ti pɛ ti zɛbɛzeɠeʋɛ tɔgi zo fai zu ga gola. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Tama ti mɛnigɛ ga Zuifuiti niiti ti zii ɠiligiti saama, ɗa naati pɛ kalasu ga ti ɓeteʋe Moize ná-tɔgiti ba, ɗa ɠɛɛzu ti ma ti mina mɔ ti-lointi tati pɛlɛʋolu, naa ʋoluma ti mina mɔ ʋokɔɠɔ faa wɔlɔmaiti ma. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Toɠa ɠɛ ɠale mu? Tɔɔzei zeɠe ma nɔpɛ ge la ba, ta ʋaazu mɛnisu ga è ʋaaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nii gi bosu è ma, naa ɠɛ. Zunu naanigɔ ɠa gi zaama, niiti ti minazeɠe kɛai, <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>ti zeɠe wo ɓɔɠɔ ɲade ʋɔɔma wa tiye, è ti-maavaiti pɛ seɠe ga ɠasɔ, naa ɠa a kɛ ti tɔungiti kpuye. Naazu ɛsɛ pɛ ka kwɛɛ ga zɛɛi ɠa ti bogai ti ma ɗa-vaa zu, kɛlɛ ɗa ɓalaagi ɗa ga tɔ so nui ta. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Nii é ga zii ɠiligiti tɔnɔi, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai, gi sɛʋɛi leʋegɛ ti ma ga ti mina ɗa ga suaiti mi, niiti ti ɠulaai ga zalaɠai kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ, ta ɲamai, naa ʋɛɛ suaiti ba ti ma ɲama la ʋuuni, ti ɓɔɠɔ maaɲɛ ɓalaa ga koloɠologi.» <verse eid="ACT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Poluma voloi Pɔle zunui naati seɠeni, ti ɓɔɠɔ ɲade ta naati, naa ʋoluma ti lɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. É kui lɛ ga tiye voloi ta-ɲade fai ɠaaɓelazu la, yeei zalaɠai maanɛai la, é ɠula ti ɠilagilagi ʋɛ.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle zo fai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Folo lɔfelasiɛi ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ ɠɛai ma zeelizu, Azi yooi zu Zuifuiti ti Pɔle ɠaai ma GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti bɛbɛi pɛ buzeɠeni daalɔɠɔma, ti so, <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>ti ɗa kpeei loo, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Izilayɛle nuiti, à ɓɔ gi ʋa! Wɛlɛ, zunui nii ɠa é ɛsɛ pɛ kalasu adaʋɛ pɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma, ta Moize ná-tɔgi ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laalɔɠɔma, é lɛa ga vɔlɔ zii ɠiligiti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti ada ɲadegai nii ɠɔzɔa!» <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Ti ɠɛni naa wosu, tɔɔzei mɔunpa ti Efɛze nui Tolofime ɠaani Pɔle ʋolu taazuʋɛ, ti ɠɛni kaazu ga tɛɛʋɛ ga naa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Taazuʋɛ naa pɛ ge ɠɛni gaama wuulee, nuɓusɛiti ti ɗa ɠula adɛti pɛ ga kpizɛi, ti ɗa ʋa, ti Pɔle zoni, ti kula GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti kpogiti daaɠulu gaamanɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, ti Pɔle ʋa, eyɛsu ma wooi zeeli Wɔlɔme salaʋusu ɓulugiti unda ɠɔɔɠuluɓai ma ga Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ ɠa wuulee. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Gaamago nɔ, é salaʋusuiti ta ta-ɠundiɠiiti seɠeni, ti li bɛbɛi ʋɔ pelei ga kpizɛi. Ti kɔɔɠuluɓai ɠaai ma ta salaʋusuiti, ti ɓeni Pɔle loɠa vai ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai maaɓuɠani Pɔle ʋa, é so, é devei ve ga ti gili ga yɔlɔɠɔ felegɔ. Naa ʋoluma, é ti ɠaazaɠani ga toɠa ga ɓɛ, ta leeni ɠa é kɛai. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Kɛlɛ bɛbɛi zaama ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni nɔnɔ wosu, ti ɗa ɓain, ti woo la liini ga faa ɠila. Tɛi kɔɔɠuluɓai la ɠɛni faa nɔpɛ gaaɠaazu naama vaa zupui zaama, é devei veeni ga ti lii la kɔɔlaaɠai zu. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Siɛgi zu Pɔle ɠɛni la nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, kɛni salaʋusuiti ti seɠeni, tɔɔzei bɛbɛi ná-ziiɠulai ʋa, <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>mazɔlɔɔ bɛbɛi ɠɛni polu, ti ɗa ɓain, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «À paa!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ɓɔɛ vai bɛbɛi ʋɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni Pɔle lɛɛzu la kɔɔlaaɠai zu, é kɔɔɠuluɓai ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa kɛ gè ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ ɓaa?» Naa ɠɛ ma: «È Gɛlɛke wooi ɠwɛɛ mu ɓaa? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Ɗa lɛi è ʋa ɠɛ mu ga Ezipete nui naa, nii é wutugi leʋeai feya, é li ga nu ʋaa nu waanaanigɔ (4.000) teʋebai zu?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Pɔle ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o, nɔ̀un, nà ga Zuifu ɠiteɠite, sɔ̀lɔɔgɛ Taalese, Silisi yooi zu, nà ga sɔɓelama laa wolai naa zu nu. Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, va bu, gè ɓɔɛ nuɓusɛiti pɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Tɛi kɔɔɠuluɓai vaani bu, Pɔle yɛni loni nu lɛɛzuʋɛ, é yee ɠɛ ɓɛɓɛ nuɓusɛiti ma ga ti maaɠɛ kpɔ. Naa lɛini tɔɔntɔɔn, Pɔle tɔɔzei ga ɓɔɛa ti ʋɔ Alame wooi zu, é ɠɛ ti ma:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>«Kɛ̀ɛni ta kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à woilo nii ma gè bosu ga nà-goozuɠulagi.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Naa mɔta lɛini ʋolu tɔɔntɔɔn, siɛgi zu ti mɛnini la ga Pɔle ɠa ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ Alame wooi zu. Pɔle ɠɛni ti ma: <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>«Nɔ̀un, nà ga Zuifui ta, sɔ̀lɔɔgɛ Taalese, Silisi yooi zu, kɛlɛ gè kulasui wogɛ taa wolai nii zu, gè kalagi zɔlɔɔ Gamaliyɛle yeezu, nii a kɛ gè ʋilɛ gi-mɛmɛwolani ta-lɔgi ɠwɛɛgai ʋolu ga ɠiteɠite. Sɛ̀bɛzeɠeni gola GALA ná-fai zu, eɠɛʋelei wo la za. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Gè kidaaleʋe ʋele niinɛi nii ma nuiti wɔinzeɠeni eyɛsu saai ɗa zeeli tanigaa ma, gè zunuiti ta anzanuiti gili, gè ɗa ti ʋili kasoi ɠa. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ta totuɠɔiti pɛ ta zoo ɠɛɛzu ga nà-zeele. Gè falima zɛʋɛiti sɔlɔɔni vɔlɔ ti ya, ga é ve ade-ɠɛɛlointi Zuifuiti zea, siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni liizu la Damase ga gè naama ɠidaaleʋe nuiti gili, gè ʋa ga tiye Zeluzalɛme, nii a kɛ gè faa zei ti ma.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>«Tɛi gè ɠɛni pelei ma, màaɓuɠazuʋɛ Damase ʋa, folo gaalɔgai ma ziɛgi zu, gaamago wozakala golai ta ɠulani geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é ɗa volo màaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Gè looni zooi ma, gè wooi ta mɛnini, é ɗa ɠɛ mà: ‹Sɔle, Sɔle, lee vaa zu è wɔ̀inzeɠezu?› <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa ga ɗe, Màliɠii?› É ɠɛ mà: ‹Nà ɠa gè ga Nazalɛte nui Yesu, nii è wɔ̀inzeɠezu.› <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Sìɛɲɔɠɔiti ti wozakalagi ɠaani, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni naama nui woomɛnisu, nii é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: ‹Màliɠii, lee ɠa nà kɛ?› Maliɠii ɠɛ mà: ‹Wuzeɠe, è li Damase, ta naa pɛ bo è ma, nii maanɛai ga è kɛ.› <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Tɛi wozakalagi naa ma voloi gàazuɠoleni, sìɛɲɔɠɔiti ti sòni zèei ʋa, ti li ga ze Damase.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>«Zunui ta ɠɛni miná, daaseigi ga Ananiase. GALA gaazuluaba nu ɠɛni de, é ɠoloni GALA ná-tɔgi ʋɛ. Zuifuiti kpein ti Damase ti ɠɛni tɔɠɔ ʋagɔi wosu. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>É ʋaani, é ɠɛ mà: ‹Kɛ̀ɛloun Sɔle, wozaɠa ʋolu!› Gaamago nɔ, gàazuʋɛ zeɠeni ma, gè wɛlɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>É ɠɛni mà: ‹Ade-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI yeelogɛ è ʋa kaite ma yeeluɠɔ ga è ziimai ɠwɛɛ, è Telebo Nui ʋɛtɛ, ta è daawooiti mɛni. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Ɗa ɠɛɛzu ga ná-zeelei nuɓusɛiti pɛ gaazu, é ʋilɛ naama vai ʋa, nii è kaai ta è mɛnigai. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Lee vaa zu mu è nɛkɛsu? Wuzeɠe, è ɓatize, ɗa-ɠotoiti ti gba è ʋa, è ɓɔɠɔ ɠaliva Maliɠii ma.›<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>«Naa ʋoluma, siɛgi zu gè ʋaani la ʋolu Zeluzalɛme, yeeta gè ɠɛni GALA falizu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu sùɠili. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Gè wɛlɛni, gè Maliɠii ɠa, é ɗa ɠɛ mà: ‹Suvilɛ, è ɠula Zeluzalɛme ʋa, tɔɔzei nuɓusɛi niiti ti zeini ná, ti la woiloga pɛ ɗa-zeele wooi ma, é ʋilɛ nɔ̀un ba.› <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Gè gooɠaaʋoteni, gè ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii, ti pɛ ti suɠwɛɛni ga gè ɠɛa liizu GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, gè ɗa naama nuiti pili kasoi ɠa, ta gè ɗa ti loɠa, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai è ma. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Anɛɛ ɓalaa siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ɗa-zeelei Etiyɛni ʋaazu la, nà ɓɔɠɔi gè ɠɛni ná, gè vaani bu, nà ɠa gè ɠɛni makɛsu ma nu ʋaa nuiti ta-zeɠeiti ba.› <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Naazu Maliɠii ɠɛni mà: ‹Li, nà è leʋesu ɠoozama poun zii ɠiligiti pɔ bɛ.› »<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ʋili fai kasoi ɠa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Ti woiloni goo ma, eyɛsu é naama wooi wo. Kɛlɛ naa ʋoluma ti wooɠulani, ti ɠɛ ma: «À nii ɠɛɠala nui ʋaa! Maa la nɛɛni ga wo ʋa zɛ vulua!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Ti ɠɛni kpeei loozu, ti ɗa ta-zeɠeiti pili ya, ti ɗa fufiligi wuzeɠe geezuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai devei veeni ga ti lɛ ga Pɔle kɔɔlaaɠai zu, ti gaazaɠa ga kpakɔi, nii a kɛ ti kwɛɛ lee vaa zu nuiti ti ɓainsu ɠani tɔun daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Tɛi ti ɠɛni gilizu ga ti ʋa doɠa, Pɔle salaʋusu ɠundiɠii ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Zobo feeʋɛ wo ya ga Wɔlɔme nu loɠa, nii ná-tukpɔi ɠaa la dɛ vɔlɔ leʋeni?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Salaʋusu ɠundiɠii naa mɛnigai ma, é liini é ɠɛ kɔɔɠuluɓai ma: «Lee ɠa è ʋaazu kɛɛzu? Zunui nii ɠa ga Wɔlɔme nu.» <verse eid="ACT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai ʋaani, é ɠɛ Pɔle ma: «Bo mà, ɗa ga Wɔlɔme nu ɠiteɠite?» Pɔle ɠɛ ma: «Ungo.» <verse eid="ACT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai ɠɛ ma: «Wali wola ɠa nɔ̀un gè kula, gè ʋa ɠɛ ga Wɔlɔme nu.» Pɔle ɠɛ ma: «Nɔ̀un, sɔ̀lɔɔgɛ su.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni gaazaɠasu ga kpakɔi, naati ti ɓeni ba. Kɔɔɠuluɓai wola luani, é kwɛɛgai ma ga Pɔle ɠa ga Wɔlɔme nu, tama é naa ɠiliai ga yɔlɔɠɔiti.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ɠɛɛ vai tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti kakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Poluma zobui, tɛi kɔɔɠuluɓai ɠɛni pɔ ga é naama vai ɠwɛɛ ɠiteɠite, nii Zuifuiti ti Pɔle ʋeelalazu su, é fieni, é devei ve ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti pɛ ti ɠaalɛ ba. Naa ʋoluma é devei veeni ga ti yei ga Pɔle, é naa ʋilɛni ti zaama.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Pɔle wɛlɛni tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti pɛ ba, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, sìɛʋɛ GALA gaazu ga kisiɛ ʋagɔi eyɛsu za voloi.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Ananiase devei veeni naama nuiti zea, niiti ti ɠɛni Pɔle ɠoba, ga ti naa loɠa daaʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Naama ziɛgi zu Pɔle ɠɛni ma: «GALA ka è loɠa, siɠi kolegi! Ɗa zeini ga è nà-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga tɔgi, è zɛba è ɗa devei ve tɔgi laalɔɠɔma ga ti dòɠa!» <verse eid="ACT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni ná, naati ti ɠɛni Pɔle ma: «Ɗa GALA ná-zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ʋoomusu!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Pɔle ɠɛni ti ma: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gè la ɠɛa kwɛɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ʋe, tɔɔzei sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Mina woo ɲɔu wo ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠii ma.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 22:27">Ɛgz 22:27</ref></char>.</char></note>»<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Tɛi Pɔle kwɛɛni ga kpɔgi ɠilazuʋɛ ɠa ga Saduseyɛinti, gilazuʋɛ ɠɛ ga Faliziɛinti, é wooɠulani tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti saama, é ɠɛ ma: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà ga Faliziɛn, Faliziɛin ta ná-doun zunu ɠa ga ze, kitogi é zèa gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai zu saai ya, naa maaʋele ɠa za tùkpɔɠaaleʋezu la.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>É naama wooi wogai ma, maaɠaali lɔɔni Faliziɛinti ta Saduseyɛinti zɔɠɔzu, bɛbɛi ɠaaɠwɛɛni su fele. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Tɔɔzei Saduseyɛinti ti ɠɛni bosu ga gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠea saai ya, geezuɠeela la ná, ta zɛnvu la ná, Faliziɛinti ma ti laaʋɛ naama vaiti pɛ da. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Kpɔɛ wolai leʋeni, Faliziɛinti pɔ pele tɔ kalamɔin tanigaa ti wuzeɠeni, ti maaɠaali ʋili su, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi la zunui nii zɔ ɲɔu nɔpɛ kaazu. Ɓɛ ɠa é kwɛɛ ni zɛnvui ta ɠa kpɔɛai pɔ, ɓaa geezuɠeelai ta ɠa kpɔɛai pɔ?» <verse eid="ACT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Kpɔɛi zuwɔɔlɔni, kɔɔɠuluɓai ɠɛni luazu ga nuiti ti mina Pɔle ʋaa, é devei veeni salaʋusu ɓulu gila zea ga ti yei ti Pɔle ɠula ti zaama, ti lɛɛ la kɔɔlaaɠai zu.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Naama yee ɓidii, Maliɠii ɠulani kɛlɛma Pɔle ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɛbɛzeɠe, è ɠɛa ga nà-zeelei Zeluzalɛme, kɛni ɓalaa è ɠɛ ga nà-zeelei Wɔlɔme taazuʋɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuifuiti ta-yaavai Pɔle laalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Poluma voloi sobuzobu wolai, Zuifuiti tanigaa ti yaavai ɠilini, ti ɠona ga tanɔpɛ ge mina daami wo ɓaa kpɔɔle, kɛni ta Pɔle ʋaana pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Zɔiti ti naama yaavai ɓɛtɛni, ti mɔinni nu ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ma. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Ti liini zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti pɔ bɛ ta totuɠɔiti, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «Gi minazeɠeʋɛ, gi ɠona ga gi la ani nɔpɛ pokɔɠɔga, ni gi la dɛ Pɔle ʋaani. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Wa ɓalaa mu, à zoloo faa ɠila ma wa tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti, wo ɓɔɛ kɔɔɠuluɓai ʋɔ, ga é ʋa ga Pɔle wo ʋɔ, eɠɛ wa ɠɛ ná-fai wuuʋɛtɛsu ga pagɔ. Gɔun, gi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ naama ziɛ su ga é ʋa ɠɛ é zeeli, gi paa.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Kɛlɛ Pɔle daaɓei yaavai naa zuɠwɛɛni, é liini kɔɔlaaɠai zu, é suɠula Pɔle ma. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Pɔle salaʋusu ɠundiɠi gila tolini, é ɠɛ ma: «Li ga zunu loungoi nii kɔɔɠuluɓai ʋɔ bɛ, faa ɠa kisu ga é bo naa ma.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Salaʋusu ɠundiɠii naa liini ga zunu loungoi kɔɔɠuluɓai ʋɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Kasoɠa nui Pɔle ɠɛ gè ʋa ga zunu loungoi nii è ʋɔ, faa ɠa kisu ga é bo è ma.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai zunu loungoi zoni zeei ʋa, é lii la, ti maaɠelesa ge leʋe, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠa è pɔ ga è bo mà?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zuifuiti ti zoloogɛ ma ga ti ʋa è ʋɔ bɛ ga è Pɔle leʋe tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti pɔ lina, eɠɛ ta ɠɛ ná-fai wuuʋɛtɛsu ga pagɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Kɛlɛ mina woilo ti-woo ma, tɔɔzei tanigaa ta ti zaama ta mɔin nu ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ma, niiti ti minazeɠeai, ti ɠona ga ti la daami woga ɓaa kpɔɔle, ni ti la dɛ Pɔle ʋaani, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ na, ɗa nɔ ɠa niina, ti è ɓɔunsu ga è va bu.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai ɓeni zunu loungoi ʋa, é li, kɛlɛ é naa laa maaɓakpani, é ɠɛ ma: «Mina bo nu nɔpɛ ma ga è ʋaaʋɛ è niima vai wo mà.»<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ti Pɔle leʋe fai masagi Felikise ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Naa ʋoluma, kɔɔɠuluɓai ná-salaʋusu ɠundiɠi felegɔ lolini, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À salaʋusu unfelegɔ (200) ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusu ʋuulɔfela (70), naa ʋɛɛ kpɛɛn ʋili nu unfelegɔ (200) ʋa, za ɓidii nɔ lɛlɛi laaʋuusiɛi ma, wo li Sezalé. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Kɛni ɓalaa wo sooiti faaɠɛ Pɔle ʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ é zeeli zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Felikise ma ga pagɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Ná-sɛʋɛi zu wooi ɠaa, nii é kɛɛni: <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>«Kelode Lisiyase ɠa é ná-tuʋɔ gooi laazeelizu ná-nu ʋagɔ wolai zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Felikise ma. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Zuifuiti ti zunui tɛi soni, nii gè teʋesu è ma, ti ɠɛnina paazu, eyɛsu gè zoloo ná ma, ga salaʋusu ɓulugiti ti kula ti ya, gè kwɛɛgai ma ga toɠa ga Wɔlɔme nu. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Tɛi gè ɠɛni pɔ ga gè so ungi ɠwɛɛ, gè liini la ta-lukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakala. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Gè pɛtɛni ga ta peelalazu, é ʋilɛ ta-lɔgi ma vaiti ba, kɛlɛ é ɠula naa ʋolu, é la faa ɠili koloɠoloni, nii nu a paa su, ɓaa nu a gili ma vaa zu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Kɛlɛ nui ta gòi vɛa ga yaavai ɠiliʋɛ ma ga ti paa. Naa ɠa é kɛa, gè la ná maaɓɔunsu, gè teʋega è ma, gè maalɔɔ nuiti deve ga ti ʋa è ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɓaazaɠa ná.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Tɛi salaʋusuiti ti naama levei zɔlɔɔni, ti Pɔle zeɠeni ga kpidii, eyɛsu ti zeeli Antipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Poluma zobui, ti ɠaleni ma kɔɔlaaɠai zu, ti zɛ soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti zea, ti li ta naati. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Ti zeeliai ma Sezalé, naati ti sɛʋɛi veeni zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ya, ti Pɔle lɛɛ la. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Siɛgi zu é ɓeni la ga sɛʋɛi ɠala, é Pɔle ɠaazaɠani naa zeɠezuʋɛ ma. Tɛi é kwɛɛni ga naa zeɠeʋɛ Silisi ɠoʋii ma, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>é ɠɛni naa ma: «Nà è woomɛni, siɛgi zu è maalɔɔ nuiti ti ʋaazu la.» É devei veeni ga ti makɛ naa ʋa Elɔde ná-masa pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle maalɔɔ vai zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Felikise ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Folo lɔɔlugɔ ʋoluma, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Ananiase, ta totuɠɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ laavaawo gila ba daaseigi ga Tɛɛlɛtule, ti yeini Sezalé. Ti zeelini zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Felikise ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɓaazaɠa ma ga Pɔle laalɔɠɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Ti naa lolini, Tɛɛlɛtule ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai lɔɔzeini ɠani: «Ee, gá-nu ʋagɔi Felikise, è zaala ɠa gi ziilɛi daazeeliai zu la, ta falibo pagɔi niiti ti zooi zu, gi naati sɔlɔɔga ga ɗa-ɠima wotii maaʋele. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>La da ga yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su, ta adɛ pɛ gi ɗa-vaaɓɔɠɔi wuuɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Kɛlɛ gi la pɔ ga gi è lɛbi zeini ada ɠilagi, naa ɠa é ba, soma ɗa-nuʋagɔlai zu, è woilo gi-woo ma yeeɠɛɠala ɓuɠa ko laawu. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Gi kaaʋɛ ga zunui nii ɠa ga ɗeɓulusa nu wola nuɓusɛiti saama, toɠa kpɔɛi lɔɔzu Zuifuiti pɛ zɔɠɔzu eteai zu ná pɛ, tɔ ɠa é ga Nazalɛte ɠalabo nuiti ta-lotuɠɔi. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>É ɠaaɓaani vɔlɔ ga é GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠɔzɔ, tama gi so. [Gi ɠɛni pɔ ga gi ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe, eɠɛʋelei gá-lɔgi la. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Kɛlɛ kɔɔɠuluɓai Lisiyase ʋaani ga maaɓaai, é kula gi ya, <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>é devei ve ga gi ʋa, gi gá-ɓaazaɠai la è ʋɔ bɛ.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:6-8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è gaazaɠa, è naama vaiti kwɛɛ niiti gi ti-ma ɓaazaɠai wosu è ma ga daalɔɠɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Zuifuiti ti vaani bu, ti ɠɛ ma zekana niima vaiti ti la.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-goozuɠulagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii yeeleteni Pɔle ma ga é ɓɔɛ, Pɔle kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè kwɛni ga kaite ɗa ɠa è tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu gá-yooi zu, naa maaʋele ma nà ʋaazu nà-goozuɠulagi wosu è ma ladalai pɛ su. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi ɗa zoo è poluɠula ga é la dɛ leʋeni folo puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ʋa, gè lɛɛni Zeluzalɛme GALA dɛbi vai ma. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Nu la kàani GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ɓaa GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ɓaa taazuʋɛ gi ʋa ɗa maaɠaali ɠɛ ga nu, gè ʋa nuɓusɛiti buzeɠe kpɔɛleʋe vaa ma. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Niima nuiti ti la zooga ti ʋa gaama ɠila kpalaa dɛɛ naama vaiti su, niiti ti màalɔɔzu ti zu. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Nii gè kwɛni naa ɠa ga, nà gi-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI lɛbizu ga kidaaleʋe ʋele niinɛi, nii ti ɠɛɛzu ma, gaaɠwɛ ʋelei. Nɔ̀un, dàaʋɛ naa pɛ da, nii sɛʋɛai tɔgi zu ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti su. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Kitogi ɠa zèa, é lo GALA ba, naama ɠitogi ɠa ɓalaa ga tɔnɔ, ga gɔvɛiti ta wuzeɠe saai ya, telebo nuiti ta telebotala nuiti. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà ɠaaɓaazu kele yeenɔpɛ ga peelalazu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ bà nà-kisiɛi zu, GALA ta nuiti gaazu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>«Naa ʋolu kona mɔinmɔin teʋegai ma, pàaʋɛ ga gè faaɓɔɠɔi ɠɛ nà-zou zu nuiti bɛ, ta gè zalaɠa ɠula, gè fe GALA bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Názu ɠa ti kàani la GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, kpegai ma ga nà-ɲade fai pɛ kɛ, bɛbɛ la ɠɛni kòba, zɔngɔ la ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Kɛlɛ Zuifui tanigaa ti zeɠeai Azi, naati ka ti ʋa ti pɛ̀tɛ, tiya mu ka vɔlɔ maa ɠɛa nɛɛni ga ti ʋa ti ɓaazaɠa è ma, ni faa ɠa ti ɠisu nɔ̀un daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Ni naa laade, zɔiti ti ʋɛ, naati ti dɛɛna nii nɔpɛ ti kaai ga pèelalazuʋɛ, siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni la tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakala. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Kɛni, ni ti yiiɠaawanaʋɛ mà, tɔɔzei naama wooi ʋa gè boni kpaun ti zaama ga: ‹Kitogi é zèa gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai ʋa saai ya, naa maaʋele ɠa za tùkpɔɠaaleʋezu la wo ɠakala.› »<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Tɛi Felikise ɓɔɠɔi faa ɠiteɠite kwɛɛ é ʋilɛ kidaaleʋe ʋele niinɛi ʋa, é ku loni ma dɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Siɛgi zu kɔɔɠuluɓai Lisiyase ʋaazu la, nà ɗa-vai wuuʋɛtɛ niina.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>É devei veeni salaʋusu ɠundiɠii ya ga é makɛ Pɔle ma kasoi ɠa, kɛlɛ é mina ɗa ga naa wola ɓata, ta é mina pele leʋe naa ná-nui tanɔpɛ tuɠɔ ga ti ʋa faa ɠɛ bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Ku ɠɛɛni fele naa ʋoluma, Felikise ʋaani ta anzai Dulisile, nii é ɠɛni ga Zuifui ta. É nu leʋeni ga ti ʋa ga Pɔle, é woiloni naa woo ma, é ʋilɛ kidaaleʋei ʋa Yesu Kilista ma. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi Pɔle ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu, é ʋilɛ telebodai ʋa, ta ɓɔɠɔzogi, naa ʋɛɛ tukpɔi ʋa é ʋaazu, Felikise luani gola, é ɠɛ Pɔle ma: «Ɠula ʋolu dɛ, voloi nà yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔ da, nà è loli niina.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Ki ge ɠɛni ba ga Pɔle ɠa wali veezu zea, naa ɠa é kɛɛni é ɠɛni naa lolisu da valafala, é ɗa yɛpɛ pɔ.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Ti yɛni naa zu kona felegɔ leʋe, naa ʋoluma ti Felikise maavalibo ga Pɔlisiyuse Fɛsɛtuse. Tɛi Felikise ɠɛni pɔ é Zuifuiti ziima vai ɠɛ, é Pɔle yɛni kasoi ɠa.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle wooɠula vai masagi Sezaal ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Siɛgi zu Fɛsɛtuse folo saʋagɔi ɠɛni la zooi unda, é zeɠeni Sezalé, é lɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta Zuifuiti ta-nu wolaiti ti ʋaani pɔ, ti ɓaazaɠa ma ga Pɔle laalɔɠɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Ti gola maanɛɛnɛni ga naa ɠɛ ga faaɓɔɠɔ wola ti ʋɛ, é Pɔle leʋe ti ma Zeluzalɛme. Ti yaavai zeini Pɔle luɠɔ ga ti paa pelei zu. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Fɛsɛtuse ti wooɠaaʋoteni ga Pɔle ɠa kasoi ɠa Sezalé, naa ʋoluma tɔ ɓɔɠɔi toɠa ɠalesu ma fala. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Zɔiti ti ga nu ɓiigiti wo zaama, naati ti ʋilɛ pòlu, gi li, ni zunui nii faa ɠoloɠolo kɛɛʋɛ, ti maaɓaazaɠa la.»<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Fɛsɛtuse folo lɔsaʋa ɓaa folo puugɔ nɔ ɠɛɛni ti ʋa Zeluzalɛme, é yei ʋolu Sezalé. Poluma voloi, é zeini tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, é devei ve ga ti ʋa ga Pɔle. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Siɛgi zu naa ʋaani la, Zuifui niiti ti zeɠeni Zeluzalɛme ti yei Sezalé, naati ti ɠakuni ma, ti ɗa maalɔ ga faaɓa golaiti, nii tiya ɓɔɠɔi ti la ɠɛni zooga gaama ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ bo su. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Pɔle woozuɠulani, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la faa nɔpɛ gaazani Zuifuiti ta-lɔgi ma, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma, anɛɛ masagi Sezaal ɓalaa ma.» <verse eid="ACT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Tɛi Fɛsɛtuse ɠɛni pɔ é Zuifuiti ziima vai ɠɛ, é ɠɛni Pɔle ma: «Ɗa pɔ ga è li Zeluzalɛme, ade pɛ ade yɛ ná ɗa-lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe gàazu, é lo niima vai ʋa?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Pɔle gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o, nà loni ʋɛ masagi ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, ʋɛ ɠa nà-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu ná. Gè la telebotala vaa nɔpɛ kɛɛni ga Zuifuiti, eɠɛʋelei ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è naa ɠwɛni la. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Ni nà ga sɔba nu, ɓaa ni gè faa ɠoloɠologɛ, nii soloogai saai ma, gè la ɠɛlɛni nɔ̀un saa vai ʋa, kɛlɛ ni gaama nɔpɛ ge la niiti ta-ɓaazaɠai zu, nii ti bosu ga ze, zobo ge la nu nɔpɛ zea ga é nɔ̀un fe ti ya. Nà wooɠulazu masagi Sezaal ma, gè suɠula ma.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Siɛgi zu Fɛsɛtuse ta nu wolaiti ti ɓeni la ga un pɛɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, é Pɔle wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «È wooɠulaa Sezaal ma, naa ɠa é ba, kɛni niina è li nɔ ti Sezaal ɠakala.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle lo fai Agilipa ta Ɓelenise ɠakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Ku ɠɛɛni fele, naa ʋoluma masagi Agilipa ta Ɓelenise ti ʋaani laaliizu Fɛsɛtuse ma, Sezalé. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Tɛi é ɠɛni ku ɠɛɛzu ná fele, Fɛsɛtuse Pɔle ná-fai lɛɛni ga masagi, é ɠɛ ma: «Felikise zunui ɠila zɛgɛ ʋɛ kasoi ɠa. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Siɛgi zu gè liini la Zeluzalɛme, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta Zuifuiti ta-lotuɠɔiti ti ɓaazaɠani ga daalɔɠɔ, ti ɠɛ gè ná-saa vai leve. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Gè ɠɛni ti ma: ‹Wɔlɔme nuiti ti la ɗa ga nui zaa vai levea nɔ, ni ti la ma nui loni maalɔɔ nuiti kakala, ti ʋa lukpɔ ta naati é woozuɠula.› <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni ti ʋaani ʋɛ, gè la ku ɠili toni ma, poluma zobui nɔ gè zeini tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, gè devei veeni ga ti ʋa ga zunui naa. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Gè ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu ga kpɔɛɲɔɠɔiti ta ʋaazu maalɔɔzu ga faaɠaaza golaiti, kɛlɛ naa la ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Nii ɓaagi é ɠɛni ti yɔɠɔzu, naa ɠɛni nɔ ga fai tanigaa ti ʋilɛgai ta-ɠala pelei ʋa, ta zunu ɠila nii daa ga Yesu, nii é zaani, tama Pɔle ɠɛɛzu ma toɠa vulua. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Gè pɛtɛni ga gè la zooga deve nɔpɛ seɠezu naa ɠɛɠala vai zu, naa ɠa é kɛɛni, gè Pɔle ɠaazaɠani, ni toɠa pɔ ga é li Zeluzalɛme, ti ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe miná. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Kɛlɛ Pɔle wooɠulani niina masa golai ma, é naa ɠwɛɛ faa loo ná-fai zu, gè deveʋɛ ga ti makɛ ba kasoi ɠa eyɛsu gè teʋe Sezaal ma.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Agilipa ɠɛni Fɛsɛtuse ma: «Nà ɓalaa nà pɔ gè zunui naa woomɛni.» Naa ɠɛ ma: «Lina ɗa goomɛni.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Poluma voloi Agilipa ta Ɓelenise ti lɛɛni tukpɔɠaaleʋe ʋɛlɛi wu lɛbiya wolai zaama, kɔɔɠuluɓaiti ta taazuʋɛ nu wolaiti ti ɠɛni ti ʋolu. Fɛsɛtuse devei veeni ti ʋa ga Pɔle. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Naama ziɛgi zu Fɛsɛtuse ɠɛni ma: «Masagi Agilipa ta wɔigi pɛ wo gi ɠoba, zunui nii é wo ɠakala, nii ɠa Zuifuiti ti ma ʋɛbɛ wolai ʋaani, ti ɓaazaɠa mà ga daalɔɠɔ Zeluzalɛme ta taai nii zu, ti ɗa ɓain, ti ɠɛ zunui nii maa la mɔ nɛɛni, é ʋa yɛ vulua. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Nɔ̀un gè kaaʋɛ ga é la faa ɠaazani, nii nu a paa su, kɛlɛ tɛi tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é wooɠula masa golai ma, gè ɠisiɛʋɛ ga soloogɛ ga gè teʋe naa ma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Kɛlɛ tama faa ɠiteɠite ge la ná, nii nà sɛʋɛ ná-faa zu masa golai ma, naa ɠa é kɛa gè toliga wo ɠakala, kɛlɛ ɗa ɠiteɠite è ɠakala, masagi Agilipa, naa ɠa a kɛ ada ɓena ga gaazaɠa, gè ɠɛ kwɛɛ nii gè ʋaazu sɛʋɛzu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Tɔɔzei toɠa bɛ̀ ga keleɠeletala va ga gè kasoɠa nu leʋe, ni gè la sɔgi ɠulani kɛlɛma, nii é laani unma.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-goozuɠulagi masagi Agilipa ɠaazu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agilipa ɠɛni Pɔle ma: «Kpɔɛi ɠa è ya, ɗa zoo è woozuɠula.» Pɔle yeemaaleni, é woozuɠula, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>«Ee, masagi Agilipa, gòla undaanɛɛʋɛ ga gè woozuɠula è ɠaazu, é ʋilɛ naama vaiti pɛ ba, nii Zuifuiti ti daazu ùnma. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Tɔɔzei ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è Zuifuiti kɛɛ vaa wɔlɔmaiti kwɛɛ kala, ta ta-ɓɔɛzuɠulaiti. Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu soma kae, è yiilɔɔ, è woilo gòo ma.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>«Zuifuiti pɛ ti sìɛ ʋelei ɠwɛɛ, kaite kɛ̀ai ma ga buzeɠe niinɛgi nà-nuɓusɛiti saama, ma un ge daa ma ga Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Kaite ti kwɛ̀ɛni, tiya ɓɔɠɔi ni ta pɔ ta zoo ti naama zeele wooi ve, ga gè nà-eteai ɠɛɛʋɛ é zoloo kpɔgi naa ma, nii ná-fai wola ɓaai ada-ƓALA pelei ma, naa ɠa é ga Faliziɛinti ta-ɓɔgi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Niima ziɛgi zu ti ʋa ga ze tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, tɔɔzei kitogi naa ʋa, nii é zèa minazeɠegi zu, nii GALA ge kɛɛni ade-mɛmɛwolani bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>ada-woloda puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) pɛ kitogɛ naa laazeeli vai ʋa, ti ɗa GALA dɛbi ma vaa zu kpidi ʋɛɛ folo ʋa. Ee, masagi Agilipa, naama ɠitogi maaʋele ɠa Zuifuiti ti màalɔɔzu su! <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Toɠa ɠale mu! Wo la laani da ɓaa ga GALA ka zoo é zɛnvui ve gɔvɛiti zea ʋolu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>«Nɔ̀un nà ɓɔɠɔi gè ɠisiɛni dɛ ga kɛni gè leʋe ga pele goi ma zii pɛ, gè wuzeɠe Yesu Nazalɛte nui laaseigi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Naa ɠa gè kɛɛni Zeluzalɛme, zobogi nii gè sɔlɔɔni zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti zea, gè lo naa ma, gè ɗa kidaaleʋe nui ma mɔinmɔin pili kasoi ɠa. Ni a la ɠɛna ga ti zaa vai leve vai, gè ɠɛni ʋɔɔpɛɛzu ba ga ti maanɛɛʋɛ ga ti za. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Gè ɠɛni leʋesu siɛ mɔinmɔin su GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti pɛ bu, gè ɠɛni faa zeizu ti ma, gè ɓɔi ti la ga ti ɠɛlɛ ta-ɠidaaleʋei ʋa, nà-ziiɠulai lateʋe pele ma ti laalɔɠɔma, gè ɠɛni liizu gè ɗa ti zo wɛɛn laaiti su.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>«Naa ɠa gè yɛni su yeeta, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ti valini mà ga ta-zobogi gè li Damase. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Ee, masagi, gè yɛni pelei zu, folo ɓekpegi gè wozakalagi ɠa, é zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é ɗa volo gi-maaɠoolii zu ga sìɛɲɔɠɔiti, ma zezei leʋegai foloi nɔnɔi ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Gi pɛ gi looni zooi ma, gè wooi ta mɛnini, é ɗa ɓɔɛ pɔ̀ Alame wooi zu, é ɗa ɠɛ mà: ‹Sɔle, Sɔle, lee vaa zu è wɔ̀inzeɠezu? Ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maawanazu ga ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔna ani ɠaazoɓagiti ga.› <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Gè ɠɛni ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa ga ɗe, Màliɠii?› Maliɠii ɠɛ mà: ‹Nà ɠa gè ga Yesu, nii è wɔ̀inzeɠezu. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Kɛlɛ wuzeɠe, è lo ɠɔɠɔiti ga, mazɔlɔɔ gè ɠulaa è ʋɛ kɛlɛma, nii a kɛ gè è ɠɛ ga nà-botiɠɛ nui, è ɗa zeele wooi wo nuiti ma ga è kàaʋɛ, ta è naama vaiti bo ti ma, niiti gè ʋaazu ti lɛɛzu ga ɗe mɔnɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Nà è unmɔɔ Zuifuiti ma ta zii ɠiligiti, niiti gè è leʋesu ti zaama. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Nà è leʋesu, nii a kɛ è ti-ɠaazuʋɛti seɠe ma, è ti ɠula kpidii zu, ti ʋa wozakalagi ɠa, è ti ɠula Setana ná-zobogi wu, ti ʋa GALA pɔ, nii a kɛ ti zuvaayɛ ga ta-ɠotoiti ta ti tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ʋɔɔma, ta niiti ti ɲadegai ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele nɔ̀un ma.›<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>«Masagi Agilipa, naa ɠa é kɛɛni, gè la zooni gè ʋa ɠɛlɛ kulakɛlɛmai naa zu vai ʋa, nii gè sɔlɔɔni, é ɠula geeɠɔlɔgi zu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Kɛlɛ gè tɔɔzeini dɛ, gè daazeeli Damase nuiti ma, naa ʋoluma Zeluzalɛme nuiti, naa ɠa é zeelini Zudé yooi zu nuiti pɛ ma, gaaɓela ga zii ɠiligiti, gè ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti ma, kɛni ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, ti ɠidaaleʋe GALA ma, ta ti kɛɛwotiiti kɛ niiti ti zoloogai maavalibogi ma kɛai ta-eteai zu. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Naa maaʋele ɠa é kɛa Zuifuiti ti sògai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti ɠɛ ti pàa. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Kɛlɛ GALA kpaaʋɛ nɔ̀un maazu, é yɛga su za zeeli zaaɠaza, nà ʋɛ mu, gè ɗa zeele wooi wo ɓolomadɔɠɔiti ta seizumaanɛgiti ma. Niima gè bosu, naa la ga faa ɠili nɔpɛ, kɛni nii GALA goo wo nuiti ta Moizeni ti boni ga daa ɠa zeeli. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni Kilista a la ɓɔlɔ, ta é ɠɛ ga nu mɔungi gɔvɛiti saama, é wuzeɠe, naa ʋoluma é kizo fai ma wozakalagi laazeeli dɛ Zuifuiti ma, é leɠa zeeli zii ɠiligiti ɓalaa ma.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masagi Agilipa ɠisu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Tɛi é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ɠanu, Fɛsɛtuse ɓainni la, é ɠɛ ma: «È litigɛ, Pɔle! Ɗa-vaaɠwɛ golai ɠana é ɓoloɠa!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Pɔle gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o, nà-nu ʋagɔ wolai Fɛsɛtuse, gè la litini. Wooi niiti gè ti wosu, ta ga gaama ɓɔɛi, gè ti wogɛ ɓalaa ga ɠimalai. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Tɔun vɔlɔ masagi Agilipa ɓɔɠɔi niima vaiti suɠwɛɛ, naa ɠa é kɛɛzu gè la ɓɔɛzu pɔ ga inɛinɛ, dàaʋɛ da ga niima vai tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛɛni zeemazu, tɔɔzei ti la ɠɛɛni ga dɔɔɠuzu va. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Masagi Agilipa, è laaʋɛ nɛi GALA goo wo nuiti gooiti da? Nɔ̀un, kìsuɠalagɛ ga è laaʋɛ ti la.» <verse eid="ACT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agilipa ɠɛni Pɔle ma: «Ɗa-ɠisiɛi zu, su la mɔ ɠoozani, è kɛ̀ ga keletiɛn!» <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Pɔle ɠɛ ma: «Suɓuɠani ɓaa suɠoozani, nà GALA falizu ga ɗa ɠila nɔ laade, kɛlɛ zɔiti pɛ ti gòoi mɛnisu za, wo pɛ wo ɠɛ ga kɛ̀ʋele, é ɠula gili ɠalui niiti polu!»<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Naa wogai ma, masagi ʋe-o, zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ʋe-o, Ɓelenise ʋe-o ta zɔiti pɛ ti sei woni ti ɠoba, ti pɛ ti wuzeɠeni. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ɠulazu la, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Zunui nii la faa nɔpɛ kɛɛni nu a paa ma vaa zu, ɓaa é ʋa ʋili kasoɠa ma vaa zu.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agilipa ɠɛni Fɛsɛtuse ma: «Ni zunui nii la ɠɛni wooɠulani masagi Sezaal ma, nu a la yeeɓe ba.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle lii vai Wɔlɔme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Tɛi ti ɓeni ga deve ga gi lɛ ɓatoi zu, gi li Itali yooi zu, ti Pɔle ta kasoɠa nui taɠiligaa veeni masagi Oguste ná-salaʋusu ɓulu kundiɠii ta ya, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Zuliuse. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Gi lɛɛni Adelamite ɓatoi gila su, nii é ɠɛni leʋesu ɓato losuʋɛti Azi yooi zu, gi liini. Alisitaake ɠɛni gi ʋa, Masedoane yooi zu nu ɠɛni de, ná-taazuʋɛ ga Tesalonike. <verse eid="ACT 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Poluma voloi gi zeelini Sidɔn. Tɛi Zuliuse ɠɛni ga nu ɓɔɠɔ Pɔle ʋɛ, é vaani bu ga naa li bɔɔlaiti pɔ bɛ, é kpɔba zɔlɔɔ ti ya. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Gi zeɠeni miná, gi ɗa ziɛ ga Sipele ɠake ɠobu ʋelei, tɔɔzei fiilɛi ɠɛni gi laaɠomisu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Siɛgi zu gi Silisi ta Panfili ɓoloɗɛi ɓudɛni la, gi zeelini Miila, Lisi yooi zu. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Salaʋusu ɠundiɠii Alɛgezandili ɓatoi gila kaani miná, é ɗa li Itali, é gi lɛ naa zu. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Folo mɔinmɔin daawu gá-ɓatoi la ɠɛni ziɛzu valafala, gi wola ɓɔlɔni, gi ʋa zeeli Kenide taai ɠobaʋɛ. Tɛi fiilɛi la ɠɛni kɛɛzu gi ʋa li miná ʋelei, gi leʋeni ga Salemone ʋele, gi leʋe Kelɛte ɠake ɠobu ʋelei. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Gi leʋeni naama ɠake ɠobuʋɛ ga kpalai nɔ, eyɛsu gi zeeli adaʋɛ ta naa laasei ge ga «Ɓato Losu Ʋagɔi», Lasé taai ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Yeeɠɛɠala mɔinmɔin ge leʋeni ɠana, ɓato zu ziɛi ɠɛni liizu ga wola ɓaa, tɔɔzei zugi ma ziɛgi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zugi ma ziɛgi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Unmɔɔ folo wolai ɠɛni ga naa, siɛgi zu zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ɠɛni zalaɠai ɠulazu la nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti pɛ faa zu. Naama vɛtii ɠaa ɠɛni ɓelazu ga zugi. Naa ɠɛni zoloosu Mozei ma alugi ma, ɓaa Latagi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ. Naama yeeɠɛɠalai ɓaani gola ɓato ziɛi ma vaa ma.</char></note> leʋeni niina. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, Pɔle ɠɛni ti ma: <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>«Bɔ̀ɔlaiti, nà kaazu ga ni ada ɠɛna ade siɛi nii wo nɔ ti, faa zuɠoloɠolo mɔinmɔin ka ɠɛɛzu ga ɓatoi ta suɠasɔi, kɛlɛ ada ɓalaa ade undaa ɠa ɠɛ é ʋili.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Kɛlɛ salaʋusu ɠundiɠii laani ɓato ɓizɛ nui ta ɓato kɛɛ nui la, é leʋe Pɔle wooi ʋa, é ɠɛni bosu. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Naa ʋoluma tɛi ɓato losuʋɛ la ɠɛni ʋani ga nu samai leʋe ná, nuɓusɛi bɔɔlɔzu zolooni ma ga gi zeɠe ná, ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu gi zeeli Fenikise, Kelɛte ɓato losuʋɛ nii gaaʋotegai lɛkpɛma nu yeezazuʋɛ folo liizu ʋelei ma, ta lɛkpɛma nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ folo liizu ʋelei ma, nii a kɛ gi samai leʋe miná.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fiilɛ wolai lokoleʋe vai kpoloɗɛi ɠa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋele viilɛ goi ʋaani fɛɛ, ti ɠisiɛni ga ti yiima vai laazeelia ti ʋɛ, ti kɔlu ɠapɔgi ɠulani ziɛi wu, ti li ga ziɛ zaama yooi Kelɛte ɠoba ʋelei. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Kɛlɛ su la ɠɛni ɠoozani, fiilɛ ɲɔi nii daaseigi ga «Elakilɔn», naa lokoleʋeni ziɛ zaama yooi maazu. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Fiilɛi ɓatoi zeɠeni ya, naa la ɠɛni zobo sɔlɔɔni fiilɛi ma, gi ɓɔɠɔ yɛni zea, é ɗa li ga giye. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Gi leʋeni ziɛ zaama you goi ta ɠoba, daaseigi ga Keloda. Tɛi é ɠɛni gi tago maalɔɔɠuzu, gi ɠaaɓaani kele gi kein koi mazɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Ti tɛai ma ɓatoi zu, ti kpɔba ʋele ɠaiziɛni, ti ɓatoi zaamaɠili ga galuiti. Tɛi ti ɠɛni luazu ga é mina ʋili ɲaɠae munɛmunɛgi zu, ti fiilɛ zuzo seɠei yeini, naa ɠa é kɛɛni ti ɓɔɠɔ yɛni fiilɛi ya, é ɗa li ga giye. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Poluma voloi, tɛi fiilɛi ɠɛni ɓatoi wo la ɲiikpisu, ti ná-kasɔi ɠilazu ʋilini ya kpoloɗɛi wu. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Foloi zaʋasiɛi, ti ɓatoi ɓizɛ zɔɔlaiti pilini ya kpoloɗɛi wu ga ti ɓɔɠɔ yeeiti. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Folo mɔinmɔin daawu nu la mɔ ɠɛni foloi ta somideɠaiti kaazu. Fiilɛi ɠɛni liizu ga zeeɠaaɓa nɔ kenein, gaaɓelasu kito nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛni gi ʋɛ, ga gá yɛ vulua.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Suɠoozani niina gi la daami wosu, Pɔle wuzeɠeni nuɓusɛiti saama, é ɠɛ ma: «Wo pɛtɛga, bɔ̀ɔlaiti, ga maanɛɛni ga wo woilo gòo ma, ade mina zeɠe Kelɛte, naazu ade ɠɛa ɠizosu niima maanɔɠɔi ta faa zuɠoloɠologi nii ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Kɛlɛ nà wo lɛnɛsu niizu ga wo zɛbɛzeɠe, wo tanɔpɛ ge la ʋalaga zɛnvui ma, kɛni ɓatoi nɔ ɠa é ɠoloɠolosu. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Za kpidii GALAGI nii gè zea ta gè dɛbizu, naa ná-geezuɠeelai gila maaɓuɠaʋɛ bà, <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>é ɠɛ mà: ‹Pɔle, mina lua, tɔɔzei kɛni è lo feya Sezaal ɠaazu, tɔ vɔlɔ ka GALA ge è-ziɛɲɔɠɔiti pɛ kaliva è ma, tanɔpɛ ge la zaa.› <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à zɛbɛzeɠe mu, bòaiti, tɔɔzei nɔ̀un daaʋɛ GALA da ga ʋelei bogai la mà, zekana é ɠɛɛzu la. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Kɛlɛ kɛni dɛ ade ʋili ya ziɛ zaama yooi gila su.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Nii ɠɛni ga kpidi puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14), fiilɛ wolai ɗa li nɔ ga giye Meditelane ɓoloɗɛi ɠa, kua zaamai ɓato ɓizɛ nuiti ti gaaɠaani ga gi maaɓuɠa kakei ta ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Ti kɔɠɔ galui ʋilini ziɛi wu, ti ka ga buuɠoozaʋɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔfela (37). Gi ʋa lago li poun, ti pili mɔnɔ, ti ka ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (28). <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi ti ɠɛni luazu ga ɓatoi mina loɠa kɔtuiti ba, ti kɔlu ɠapɔ naanigɔ ʋilini ɓatoi ɓoga ʋelei, ti ɓala ga wozai seɠema vai. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Tɛi ɓato ɓizɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti ʋela, ti ɠula ɓatoi zu, ti kein koi ʋilɛni ziɛi ɠa, eɠɛ ta ɠɛ liizu poun ga ti kɔlu ɠapɔgiti pili ʋelela ʋelei. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Pɔle ɠɛni salaʋusu ɠundiɠii ma ta salaʋusuiti: «Ni niima nuiti ti la yɛni ɓatoi zu, wo la mɔ ɠizoga.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Salaʋusuiti ti kein koi ma ɠaluiti teʋeleʋeni naazu, ti ɓe ba, é loo bu.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Wozai seɠe ma la yɔɠɔzu, Pɔle ɠɛni nuɓusɛiti pɛ tɛnɛsu ga ti daamii wo, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Za ɠa ga folo puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14) wo ɗa maaɓɔungi wo, wo la dɛ daami nɔpɛ boni. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu deɠɛmu ga wo daamii wo niina. Naa wola zoloogɛ wo ma, nii a kɛ wo ɠula ʋɛ, naa ʋoluma à la dà: Wo tanɔpɛ undeɠai ɠila kpalaa ge loa ya.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>É naa wogai ma, é ɓului zeɠeni, é mamagi ve GALA bɛ ti pɛ gaazu, é galeɠale, naa ʋoluma é tɔɔzei ga mia. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Zɔiti pɛ ti zɛbɛzeɠeni, ti tɔɔzei ga daamii woga. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Gɛi kpein gi ɠɛni ɓatoi zu, gi ɠɛni ga nu unfelegɔ puulɔfela maazu lɔzita (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Ti daamii wogai ma, ti ɓaa kpe, ti ta ɠulani ɓatoi ɠasɔi ma, moloi da ga ɓeleegi, ti ɗa naa ʋili kpoloɗɛi wu.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Siɛgi zu woza seɠeni la ma, ti la ɠwɛɛsu ɠaani kakei ʋa, ti wɛlɛni, ti ziɛ ɓekegi ta ʋɛtɛ ta ma ɲaɠaegi, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, ni ta zoo ti zɔ ɓatoi ʋa miná ʋelei. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Ti kɔlu ɠapɔgiti ma ɠaluiti teʋeleʋeni, ti naati zɛ ziɛi wu, ti yeeɓe gaamago ɓato ɓizɛ aniiti ba. Ti fiilɛ zuzo seɠei wuzeɠeni, ti tɛ, ti ɗa li ga kakei ma ʋele. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Kɛlɛ ti ziɠani ɲaɠae siɠigi gila ba, nii kpoloɗɛi ma veinfein felegɔi gaalɛai ba yɔɠɔzu, ti ɓata ná. Ʋelelaʋɛ ɓatani ba kpe é la ɠɛni ɲiikpisu, ʋoluzuʋɛ ɗa ɠaleɠale ga kpoloɗɛi ná-zeeɠaaɓaai.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Salaʋusuiti ti zolooni ma ga ti kasoɠa nuiti pɛ paa, naa ɠa a kɛ ta mina yɛ lasesu, é ʋa ʋela. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi salaʋusu ɠundiɠii ɠɛni pɔ ga é Pɔle ɠizo, é la ɠɛni vaani bu, ti ʋa naama vai ɠɛ. É devei veeni ga zɔiti pɛ ti zoogai lasesu, naati ti ʋili ziɛi ɠa mɔunpa, ti kakei mazɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>É ɠɛ zɔiti ti zei gulu zɛʋɛiti ma, ɓaa ɓatoi ma ɓulukpulugiti ma. Ʋele ɠana ɛsɛ pɛ ge kakei maazɔlɔɔni la ga pagɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-yeeɠɛɠalai ziɛ zaama yooi zu daa ga Malete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Gi ɠulaai ma faaɓaagi laawu, gi kwɛɛni ga ziɛ zaama yooi naa laasei ka ga Malete. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Ná nuiti ti yeezeini gi wu ga pagɔ, ti abu wolai ɠaazoni, ti gi pɛ toli ga gi ɠɔɔlɛ, tɔɔzei tonai ta kɔɔlɛi ɠa é ɠɛni ʋaazu ga gola. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Pɔle kpataɠalagi ta ɠaalɛɛni ba ga é pu abui ɠa, kɛlɛ abui liegi maaʋele ma, pɛɛɠaali ɠila ge ɠulani su, é so zeei ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Ná nuiti ti kaalii ɠaai ma zɛlɛni Pɔle yeei ʋa, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Gaamazu zunui nii ɠa ɠɛ ga nu ʋaa nui ta, kulaa nɔ ɠa feya faa ɓɔii zu kpoloɗɛi wu, gaamanɔ ada-ɠalagi ná-tukpɔi la vaani bu, é ʋa yɛ vulua.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Kɛlɛ Pɔle kaalii voɓeni abui zu, é la vɔlɔ ma zoolɛ nɔpɛ gaaɠaani. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Naama nuiti ti ɠɛni ná maaɓɔunsu, é ɠɛni ti ɠisu ga ti Pɔle ɠa zeei ve, ɓaa é loo é za gaamanɔ. Tɛi ti lɛbini maaɓɔungi naa zu, ti la faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kaani, é ʋa ɠɛ ga Pɔle, ti-ɠigi valiboni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Galagi ta ʋe de.»<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Ná ɠobaʋɛ ziɛ zaama yooi naa ma nu wola mɔungi daaseigi ga Puɓiliuse ná-kpeleiti ti ɠɛni ná. É yeezeini gi wu ga nɛɛnɛgi, é gi laazuʋɛɛ folo saʋagɔ laawu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Puɓiliuse kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni zeeɓɛzu, kɔlɔkpadimai ta kɛlɛndɛgi ɠa é ɠɛni ba. Pɔle lɛɛni pɔ bɛ, é GALA fali bɛ, é yeela ma, é balo. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Naa ʋoluma, seeɓɛ nui niiti kpein ti ɠɛni ziɛ zaama yooi zu, ti ʋaani ɓalaa, tama ti pɛ ti ʋaloni. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Ti unfema wola veeni gi ʋɛ, gi liizuʋɛ nii pɛ é ɠɛni ga gi ɓɛdɛma ani, ti naa pɛ feeni gi ʋɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle zeeli vai Wɔlɔme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Alu saʋagɔ leʋeni pɛ gi ʋa lɛ Alɛgezandili ɓatoi gila su, nii é samai ɠɛɛni ziɛ zaama yooi zu, Gala felegɔiti ti ga yoogiti naati ta-ʋoogi ɠa é ɠɛni ɓatoi naa ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Gi zeelini Silakuse taazuʋɛ, gi kɛ miná ga folo saʋagɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Gi zeɠeni miná, gi ɗa li ga kake ɠobu ʋelei, eyɛsu gi zeeli Legiyo. Poluma voloi lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ viilɛi lokoleʋeni, gi kɛɛni ga folo felegɔ gi ʋa zeeli Puzɔle. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Gi kidaaleʋe nuiti tanigaa ɠaani miná, ti gi maanɛɛnɛni ga gi dɔɔɠɔ ɠila kɛ ti ʋa. Ʋele ɠana gi zeelini la Wɔlɔme. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Wɔlɔme ɠidaaleʋe nuiti ti gi-maawoo mɛnini, ti ʋilɛ pele ma gi laaɠomisu eyɛsu ti ʋa adaʋɛ ná laa ga Apiyuse Lɔɔɠɔi, ta ʋɛ ná laa ga Wɛɛn Laazu Ʋɛlɛ Saʋagɔi. Siɛgi zu Pɔle ti ɠaani la, é GALA mamani, naa ʋoluma iɲɔ ge lɔɔni.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Siɛgi zu gi zeelini la Wɔlɔme, ti vaani bu ga Pɔle yɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛlɛ wu, salaʋusui gila ge ɗa wɛlɛ ma.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Folo saʋagɔ leʋegai ma, Pɔle Zuifuiti ta-lotuɠɔiti tolini ga ti ɠomi ta naati. Siɛgi zu naati ti ʋaani la pɔ bɛ, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gè la faa ɠoloɠoloni ada-nuɓusɛiti ma, gè la ade-mɛmɛwolani ta-vaa wɔlɔmai ta ɠoloɠoloni ɓalaa. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ti sòni, ti pìli kasoi ɠa Zeluzalɛme, ti kùla miná, ti fè Wɔlɔme nuiti zea. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Naati ti ɓegai ma ga nà-faiti buuʋɛtɛ, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, ti pìlɛ, tɔɔzei ti la ɠɛni nɔ̀un sɔ kaani, nii soloogai nu ʋa vaa ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi Zuifuiti ti la ɠɛni vaazu naa wu, kɛɛɠeleɠele ge la ɠɛni ná kɛni gè wooɠulani masagi Sezaal ma, naa la bosu ga wɔin ɠa mà ga gè nà-nuɓusɛiti maalɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Naa ɠa é kɛa gè toligi wogai la ga ade ɠa, ade yɛpɛ é ʋilɛ naama vai ʋa, tɔɔzei Izilayɛle ná-kitogi maaʋele ɠa za gè yɔlɔɠɔi nii zu la.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Zuifuiti ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi la sɛʋɛ zɔlɔɔni, é ʋa zeɠe Zudé yooi zu ɗa-vaa zu, gi-ɠɛɛloin gila kpalaa ge la ʋaani, é ʋa ɗa-vaa ɲɔu wo gi ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Kɛlɛ wɔin ɠa gi ma ga ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è ɗa-ɠisiɛi lɛ ga giye. Nii é ga kalagi naa è ʋɔɔpɛai ba, gi kwɛni ga adɛ pɛ nuiti ta wuzeɠezu daalɔɠɔma ga gola.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Ti ku ɠili toni ga ti ɠomi. Naama voloi zeeliai ma, ti ʋaani pɔ bɛ, ti mɔin, é leʋe ma mɔungi ʋa. É zo sobui ma eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli, Pɔle ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ, é ná-kalagi wo pelei lɛ ga tiye: É GALA ná-masadai ma wooi laazeelini ti ma, é Moize ná-tɔgi zu wooiti seɠeni ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-ɓɔɛiti, é ɠaaɓa kele ga é ti-ɠigi lati, é lo Yesu ná-fai ʋa. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Tanigaa ti laani gooi la, zɔiti ti la kɛɛni pɛ ti ʋa la da. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni zeɠezu la Pɔle ʋɔ bɛ, tiya letele ti la ɠɛni zolooni faa ɠila ma, Pɔle niima ɠisiɛ ɠilagi woni ti ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Gaama ɠɛni Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ya, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu la wo-mɛmɛwolani pɔ ga GALA goo wo nui Ezayi maaʋele, é ɠɛni ti ma:<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>‹Li, è ɠɛ niima nuɓusɛiti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Wa la woilo nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kɛlɛ wo la faa ɠaaɠaa pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Wa la wɛlɛ nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">kɛlɛ wo la wozaɠaa pɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Tɔɔzei niima nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛa ga kigaaza nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ti ɓɔɠɔ woizuɓɔlɔa, ti yeeʋɛɛ ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">naa ɠa a kɛ ti ɠaazu mina wozaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ti-woiyeɠeiti ti mina faa mɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ti-yii mina faa ɠaaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ti ʋa ɠale ma pɔ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nii a kɛ gè ʋa ti ɠɛdɛ.› »<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Pɔle ɠɛni ti ma ʋolu: «À kwɛɛ mu ga kizo fai nii GALA ge fea, daa ɠana zeelizu zii ɠiligiti ma, naati mu ta woilo ma.» <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>[Pɔle naama wooi wogai ma, maaɠaali wolai yɛni Zuifuiti zɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa li.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Pɔle kɛɛni ga kona felegɔ pɛlɛi naa wu, nii é seɠeni. É ɠɛni yeezeizu nuiti pɛ bu ná, niiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu pɔ ga ti ka. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>É ɠɛni GALA ná-masadai ma vai laazeelizu, é ɗa kalagi wo, é ʋilɛ Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-fai ʋa ladalai zu, faa nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni kpeteʋeni naa ʋa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
